window.AKK_GREAT_GRANDMOTHER_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_GREAT_GRANDMOTHER_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":301,"title":"Chapter 301: Remember, you are a class, a big collective.","paragraphs":["Rong Yu returned to her squad and continued to stand at attention.","During the afternoon military training, Yu Kexin's leave ended.","After resting for two hours, she couldn't exactly say she was fully revived, but her condition was at least much better.","\"Basic movement training, start now!\"","Instructor Yan's whistle pierced the summer heatwave, causing everyone to tense up.","Constantly turning forward, backward, left, right, goose-stepping... A simple movement, repeated dozens of times back and forth.","Song Huai was having a hard time holding on. In a moment of distraction, he suddenly staggered while turning, his shoe tripping over the uneven ground, and he pitched forward.","Rong Yu was standing in the first row, and Song Huai was in the second. When turning around, Rong Yu happened to see him. She subconsciously took a half step forward, her hand shooting out like lightning to grab Song Huai's belt and pull him back.","Song Huai stood straight in his original spot.","He was a bit stunned.","Rong Yu had actually helped him.","She always wore a cold face; no matter what he said, she was too lazy to respond. He thought she was disgusted by him.","But at such a moment, she had extended a helping hand...","\"Rong Yu, step out!\"","The instructor's devilish voice rang out.","\"Leaving the formation without permission, one hundred push-ups!\"","Song Huai had just been about to say thank you when he heard these words, instantly drawing in a breath of cold air.","He wanted to say something, but meeting the instructor's sharp, authoritative gaze, all his words were forced back down his throat, unable to utter a single syllable.","Rong Yu stepped out, bent down, and placed her hands on the ground. A scorching heat hit her, but she showed no signs of dissatisfaction. She quickly began to do push-ups, each movement astonishingly standard: arms bent at ninety degrees, back taut as a straight line, even her breathing rhythm completely steady.","\"Report!\" Sheng Ciyuan said loudly, \"Instructor, I think this is unfair. Rong Yu was clearly helping a classmate, why should she be punished?\"","Instructor Yan's voice was very cold: \"Questioning the instructor, very well. Get ready for push-ups, also one hundred!\"","Sheng Ciyuan didn't say another word and dropped down next to Rong Yu.","His physical fitness wasn't great, and push-ups were quite difficult for him. After only doing a dozen or so, his body started to sag, but he still persisted, shouting the numbers loudly: \"Eighteen, nineteen, twenty!\"","Song Huai's lips tightened into a straight line.","As if making a massive decision, he walked over, stayed silent, and dropped down on the other side of Rong Yu, also starting to do push-ups.","One after another.","After Rong Yu reached fifty, Instructor Yan shouted: \"Stop!\"","The three of them stopped in unison. Sheng Ciyuan collapsed on the ground, as did Song Huai. Only Rong Yu stood up straight, drenched in sweat.","Instructor Yan: \"Do you know why I punished you?\"","Rong Yu: \"Because I acted without authorization.\"","In the war-torn era, acting without authorization was a fatal matter.","She still remembered Ji Zheng's comrade-in-arms, who disobeyed orders without authorization to save a local, and was ultimately shot in the head by the enemy, exposing the entire company's whereabouts.","Perhaps having stayed in an era of peace for too long, she had even forgotten the most basic military discipline.","\"I accept the punishment!\"","Rong Yu said loudly.","\"On the battlefield, any heroism will bring immeasurable consequences, but—\" Instructor Yan paused, a look of appreciation surfacing in his eyes, \"Your actions today taught everyone a lesson, letting everyone understand what collectivism is. Remember, you are a class, a large collective! You don't have to do the remaining push-ups. Now, everyone, right face! Destination: the cafeteria, double time, march!\"","The whole class erupted in cheers.","Song Huai spoke up: \"Rong Yu, if you hadn't pulled me, I probably would have smashed my head. Thank you.\"","Rong Yu's face was indifferent: \"I would have reached out for anyone. No need to thank me.\"","She headed toward the cafeteria with Yu Kexin and Xue Yun.","Looking at her retreating back, Song Huai found it hard to look away for a long time. Actually, she was really great; why had he only realized it now...","\"What are you looking at?\" Sheng Ciyuan walked over, \"I heard you have a fiancée?\"","Song Huai pressed his lips tightly together.","He and Rong Ruoyao grew up together as childhood sweethearts and had a great relationship.","She got into Jingda University.","He got into Huaqing.","They were the best of friends on the same path.","He shouldn't develop any other thoughts.","Sheng Ciyuan glanced at him and eagerly chased after Rong Yu: \"Wait for me!\"","Thus, he successfully infiltrated the female group of the Tianxingjian class. Three girls, plus him, a big guy, sitting at one table.","Rustling discussions came from the side.","\"Did you see? That's the freshman Rong Yu, she is really beautiful.\"","\"Nonsense, if she wasn't beautiful, could she be on the school beauty voting list? She's already fourth and still climbing.\"","\"I wonder if she has a boyfriend, I really want her contact info.\"","\"Just started college, probably hasn't had the time to date yet...\"","Hearing this, Sheng Ciyuan's face darkened.","He picked up a piece of braised pork and put it in Rong Yu's bowl: \"You're too thin, eat more meat.\"","He also deliberately helped Rong Yu adjust her bangs.","A few male students nearby stopped in their tracks, looking incredulous, and could only retreat in regret.","Sheng Ciyuan curled his lips into a smile.","Let them misunderstand.","Anyway, no matter what, he had to guard Rong Yu for his older brother; he absolutely couldn't let Rong Yu be snatched away by someone else.","Rong Yu looked up at him: \"What are you smiling at?\"","Sheng Ciyuan guiltily continued to give her food: \"Nothing, eat more to keep up your strength, there's still military training tonight.\"","Rong Yu: \"...\"","Messages kept coming into her phone. She opened it to see the \"Loving Family\" group chat, where her several good grandsons were sharing their daily lives.","Ji Zhiyuan: \"Great-grandmother, Chuan, Aye, how is the first day of college?\"","Ji Yanting: \"The first day of college is military training, it probably feels terrible.\"","Ji Mohan: \"It's just half a month, it's nothing, endure it and it'll pass.\"","Ji Jingchuan: \"It's okay, much easier than doing farm work.\"","Ji Zhouye: \"...\"","Rong Yu: \"What's wrong with Aye?\"","Ji Zhouye sent ten crying emojis in a row: \"I want to take leave, boohoo, military training is too bitter, so hot, so tiring, I'm about to die. Tonight is also my goddess Yaoyao's esports match, I really want to go, but the counselor won't let me...\"","Old Master Ji: \"Your great-grandmother didn't complain, you're a grown man, what are you complaining about? Aren't you supposed to be starting a company? With this attitude, it'll be a miracle if you can get it running!\"","Ji Zhouye instantly perked up: \"My business plan is already done, I'm in the stage of attracting investment, it'll be up and running soon. Just wait, all of you wait and see!\"","Duoduo: \"Uncle, I believe in you!\"","Rong Yu couldn't help but laugh.","After standing at attention for a while in the evening, the sports field suddenly started to have singing competitions. A dozen or so formations instantly acted like boiling water, a sea of camouflage surging in the twilight.","The male formation of the physics department opposite had already set up their stance. The leading boy stepped on a stair and shouted loudly: \"Comrades opposite, sing up, sing up! One two three four five, we've waited so hard!\"","The wave of sound pressed over like a landslide and a tsunami.","Rong Yu looked over. The person standing on the steps was another old acquaintance, Zhang Haoyu from Haicheng First High School. He used to be in the same class as Song Huai and had participated in a physics competition with her. She had a pretty good impression of him.","Zhang Haoyu bellowed, \"Rong Yu, Rong Yu, hurry up! Don't dawdle like an old lady! When we ask you to sing, just sing! Stop being so bashful, it's not a good look!\""]},{"number":302,"title":"Chapter 302: Rong Yu, You've Rushed to the Top of the Campus Belle Rankings","paragraphs":["The entire sports field instantly fell silent.","Students from all the formations turned their heads, casting countless gazes upon Rong Yu like spotlights.","The name Rong Yu was more or less familiar to everyone.","Whether it was because of chasing stars, scientific research, or the campus forum's beauty ranking, in short, she was considered a prominent figure among the freshmen.","Zhang Haoyu looked at Rong Yu from a distance, a smile suddenly rising on his face.","Meeting Rong Yu at Huaqing University and singing songs on the same sports field was truly a very lucky thing.","It was a pity his abilities weren't quite enough; otherwise, he could have entered the Tianxingjian class and become classmates with Rong Yu.","But things were already pretty good as they were.","He strained his voice and shouted, \"Rong Yu, Rong Yu, you're too slow! Did you skip dinner?!\"","\"The physics department has thick skin, singing out of tune like a leaky window!\" Yu Kexin shouted back loudly. \"If you want to know who sings best, it has to be—\"","The entire Tianxingjian class shouted loudly in unison: \"Our class beauty, Rong Yu!\"","Rong Yu's forehead darkened with speechlessness.","When did she become the class beauty?","Before she could think too much, the boys in the class, led by class monitor Duan Fei and Sheng Ciyuan, beat their water bottles like war drums. The girls waved their flashlights and cheered. Yu Kexin pushed Rong Yu right to the front, the lights gilding her with a golden rim.","With no microphone and no accompaniment, her voice was like an unsheathed sword cleaving through the twilight.","\"The wind is howling, the horses are neighing—\"","When she sang, she didn't use any vocal techniques or embellishing trills, but every word was like a tempered blade, piercing straight into people's hearts.","As soon as the first line left her lips, everyone present collectively lost their voices.","Sheng Ciyuan thought silently, how hard must his older brother work to be worthy of a Rong Yu like this?","Song Huai stared at her blankly. The beam of the sports field's searchlight passed through her flying hair, casting fine shadows beneath her eyelashes. Such an old, cliché red song was actually sung by her with a completely different feeling.","\"The Yellow River is roaring! The Yellow River is roaring!\"","Sheng Ciyuan was the first to follow the rhythm, followed closely by the entire Tianxingjian class, and finally, the whole sports field joined in this grand chorus.","The night wind swept past the teaching buildings, making the sycamore leaves rustle.","The collective revelry didn't end until nine o'clock in the evening.","Just as they returned to the dorm, Yu Kexin let out a shriek: \"My god, Rong Yu, you've shot up to first place on the campus beauty ranking!\"","Xue Yun wasn't interested in these things and went to take a shower first.","Rong Yu spoke up, \"Can I withdraw from the campus beauty contest?\"","\"Of course not.\" Yu Kexin's voice was filled with excitement. \"When we were singing tonight, your voice amazed everyone. Someone uploaded a video of you to the forum, causing countless people to flood in and vote for you. The original first place was Luo Xuan from the art department, but now you've surpassed her. The art department is going crazy trying to canvass for votes.\"","Rong Yu was left speechless.","By the time the three of them had showered and lain down, it was already past eleven at night.","It was the first day of military training, and their bodies hadn't adapted yet. They felt as if their entire bodies were falling apart, so the three fell asleep as soon as they hit the bed.","\"Beep—beep beep!\"","The sharp sound of a whistle pierced their eardrums like a knife. Rong Yu suddenly bounced up from her bed.","She glanced at the time; it was three minutes past two in the morning.","Instructor Yan's roar came from downstairs: \"Three minutes, assemble on the sports field!\"","\"What the heck, assembling in the middle of the night?\" Yu Kexin was completely bewildered. \"Did the handbook say anything about a midnight assembly?\"","Xue Yun quickly put on her military training uniform. \"Two and a half minutes left.\"","Rong Yu was already fully dressed. As she tied up her hair, she said, \"It takes a minute to get downstairs. Yu Kexin, speed it up.\"","The whole dormitory building was in chaos. A crowd of people rushed downstairs in a panic, mixed with all sorts of complaints.","On the sports field, Instructor Yan stood under the streetlight like a fierce deity, coldly watching this group of disheveled freshmen.","He said coldly, \"Look at yourselves! During an enemy air raid, you wouldn't even qualify as cannon fodder!\"","\"What era is this, still talking about enemy air raids? This is purely torture!\"","\"I paid tuition to study, not to be a soldier!\"","\"Mom, save me, boo hoo hoo...\"","\"Attention all!\" Instructor Yan roared. \"Run three laps around the field!\"","The group resentfully ran their laps. After finishing, they returned to the dorm to sleep. It felt like they had just closed their eyes when the alarm went off; as soon as they opened their eyes, it was already daylight.","After three or four consecutive days of military training, a group of raw recruits gradually adapted from their initial state of chaos.","On the fifth day, the program changed. From standing at attention, running laps, and goose-stepping, it changed to a weighted cross-country march.","The whole class was particularly looking forward to this cross-country event and was extremely excited.","At 6:30 in the morning, dozens of military trucks rolled over the muddy suburban roads, kicking up billowing yellow dust.","The vehicles stopped, and Instructor Yan's voice rang out with authority: \"There's a five-kilometer mountain trek ahead. You are to plan the route yourselves. Everyone, get off!\"","As soon as they got out of the vehicles, everyone was dumbfounded.","The imagined green hills and clear waters turned into a ferocious mountain forest. There was no decent road ahead at all, only a wide muddy ditch winding deep into the dense forest. Thorny bushes grew taller than a person, and barbed vines sprawled aggressively across the inevitable path.","Yu Kexin was stunned: \"T-this is cross-country training? How are we supposed to walk?\"","Xue Yun, who rarely showed any expression, swallowed hard: \"I think... I saw a snake. There are snakes here...\"","The freshman class of the sports department, being the physical standouts, had already begun exploring the path and heading into the mountain forest.","Afraid of falling behind, Duan Fei spoke up loudly: \"All boys clear the way, girls stay in the middle. Let's get through this section first, then we'll plan the route!\"","After all, they were carefully selected students of Huaqing University. Their innate resilience was actually stimulated in desperate situations. Amidst the mountain forest, this group of favored children of heaven showed strong adaptability.","Duan Fei led a group of boys to push aside the thorns.","Sheng Ciyuan rushed to the very front to scout the route.","Song Huai observed the movements of the other classes from a distance.","Rong Yu was originally quite worried about Yu Kexin and Xue Yun, but after the two got over their initial fear, they gradually calmed their minds and joined the boys in clearing the thorns on the path.","Soon, the Tianxingjian class made it out of the thorny area and reached an open space where small paths branched out in all directions.","Duan Fei took out a map, his fingertip pointing to an almost invisible dashed line: \"If we take this woodcutter's path, we can save two kilometers. Let's strive to take first place in the freshman camp!\"","Song Huai frowned and leaned in: \"Are you sure this path is passable?\"","Sheng Ciyuan pointed to the path they came from: \"Just now, it was covered in thorns, yet didn't we carve out a path? If there is no road, we'll trample one out!\"","Xue Yun was a bit hesitant: \"What if something happens...\"","\"Scared already?\" Duan Fei pushed up his glasses. \"Do us Huaqing students lack even this bit of adventurous spirit?\"","The boys' blood immediately boiled with excitement: \"Let's go, we'll take this path. We want to be number one!\"","Rong Yu looked ahead.","For some reason, she thought of more than seventy years ago, when Ji Zheng took her on a shortcut to avoid an ambush, successfully shaking off the enemy troops... The competitive spirit dancing in the eyes of these young students before her also ignited a spark within her.","Youth is fleeting; when there's a challenge, one must embrace it.","She asked, \"Yu Kexin, Xue Yun, can you hold on?\"","Yu Kexin said loudly, \"Yes.\"","Xue Yun nodded: \"I'll follow the group.\"","However, this path was much worse than they had imagined."]},{"number":303,"title":"Chapter 303: Serving as a One-Day Military Physical Fitness Boxing Instructor","paragraphs":["The path through the thorny bushes grew narrower and narrower, leaving countless white scratches on the military training uniforms of the Tianxingjian Class.","The trees overhead blotted out the sun and sky. Beneath their feet was muddy yellow soil, and on both sides were piercing thorns. The road conditions were absolutely terrible.","\"Hold on a second,\" Rong Yu's voice suddenly rang out. \"Class Monitor, I think we've strayed off the path.\"","Duan Fei wiped the sweat from his forehead. \"We didn't stray. I changed the route on the fly. Going this way will save us at least another twenty minutes. If everyone just pushes through for another half hour, we'll make it out. We'll definitely leave the other classes in the dust!\"","Sheng Ciyuan loudly echoed his enthusiasm, \"Just half an hour more, let's go, guys!\"","Rong Yu was speechless.","When they first met, she thought Sheng Ciyuan was a refined and proper person. Now, she increasingly felt that this guy was a bit of a goofball.","She looked up, scanned their surroundings, and suddenly pointed above a large tree. \"Do you see that sign? It says the area ahead is a danger zone. No entry!\"","Duan Fei glanced over and scoffed. \"That sign is completely rusted, and half the words have peeled off. Who knows how many years it's been there? It means nothing!\"","\"What do you mean it means nothing?\" Yu Kexin argued. \"If there's a sign, it means the path ahead is dangerous. You're the class monitor, you shouldn't be leading everyone down a dangerous trail, right?\"","Xue Yun nodded. \"There might be mudslides or landslides ahead. Class Monitor, let's change our route.\"","\"You girls are just too timid,\" Duan Fei sneered. \"Anyone who wants to take first place, follow me this way!\"","He strode forward.","A group of highly competitive boys immediately swarmed after him.","Sheng Ciyuan was eager to join them, but before moving, he glanced at Rong Yu. Seeing her shake her head, he had no choice but to suppress his impulse and stand by her side.","The group instantly split into two factions.","Song Huai stood in the middle, hesitating for quite a while before finally walking toward Rong Yu. \"I'll go with you.\"","Duan Fei looked back over his shoulder. \"I get it for the girls, they're naturally timid. But Sheng Ciyuan and Song Huai, those two cowards are really an embarrassment to men...\"","As his group walked deeper into the area, it surprisingly opened up, making the trek much easier.","Meanwhile, at the observation post, a group of instructors frowned.","The head instructor spoke up, \"This is the Tianxingjian Class, Huaqing University's most elite group. It's a good thing that these kids have spirit and dare to push boundaries, but they are too reckless. Their desire to win is far too strong.\"","Instructor Yan's mouth immediately turned downward in a scowl. \"They even dare to enter the danger zone. Have all the rules they memorized been eaten by dogs? I'm going in after them!\"","Just then, a cold, crisp voice rang out. \"Why don't I go?\"","The instructors turned around and saw a young man in a military uniform. He appeared to be in his early twenties, very tall, with sharp eyes, chiseled features, and an exceptionally striking appearance.","The head instructor immediately stood up to greet him. \"You must be the military martial arts instructor sent from above?\"","\"That's me.\" The man shook hands with everyone. \"My name is Sheng Qingyan. I'll be serving as the military martial arts coach for a one-day session. I arrived half a day early, and since I have nothing else going on, let me go meet the students of the freshman camp.\"","From joining the army in April until now, in less than half a year, he had earned several merits and been promoted, requiring him to return to Beijing to process his files.","Since he was back, he naturally had to find something else to do.","Thus, he applied to become the military martial arts coach for Huaqing University.","Originally, he was assigned to Jingcheng University.","Relying on his youth, he shamelessly pestered his superiors for ages until they finally agreed to the switch.","Back on Rong Yu's side, they had chosen the other path.","Although the road was rugged, it wasn't dangerous. The group kept hiking upward. Once they crossed the mountain ridge and headed down, they would have successfully traversed the forest and completed their mission.","Yu Kexin's body felt weak all over. \"This is too exhausting. Weighted cross-country trekking is way too tiring. I hope I never have to do this a second time.\"","Xue Yun held out her hand. \"Give me your water bottle. I'll lighten your load.\"","\"Let me carry the water bottles for you guys,\" Sheng Ciyuan offered, reaching out. \"Hang them all around my neck, I can handle it.\"","Song Huai spoke up, \"I can help carry one too.\"","As they were talking, they suddenly noticed Rong Yu standing frozen in place, completely motionless.","Sheng Ciyuan quickly asked, \"What's wrong?\"","The tips of Rong Yu's ears twitched.","She heard the sound of rushing water. The continuous roar of the current was slowly amplifying, drawing closer and closer. She spun around, her pupils shrinking sharply. Up in the valley, a murky yellow line was rapidly expanding, rolling down the mountain at breakneck speed.","\"It's a flash flood!\" Xue Yun gasped. \"A torrent formed by the sudden accumulation of water on the slopes after heavy summer rainstorms.\"","Yu Kexin's face paled for a moment, but then she breathed a sigh of relief. \"Thank goodness we're in the safe zone and won't be affected by it. That's terrifying...\"","Rong Yu's voice was heavy. \"But the path the class monitor chose is right in the flash flood danger zone.\"","She had already unbuckled her heavy backpack and pulled out a rope, tying a professional climbing knot in under ten seconds. She looked up. \"Xue Yun, you lead everyone and stay put here. Do not leave the high ground of the ridge under any circumstances.\"","Sheng Ciyuan was stunned. \"What are you going to do?\"","\"The class monitor and the others are in mortal danger,\" Rong Yu said calmly. \"It's going to take time for the instructors to get here. I'm going over first to see if I can help.\"","\"Rong Yu, you're crazy!\" Sheng Ciyuan grabbed her wrist. \"You can't go, it's too dangerous! There's no need to put yourself in that kind of peril!\"","Song Huai added, \"I don't agree with you going either. You won't be able to do anything even if you go.\"","Rong Yu smiled and said, \"If I really can't do anything, I'll just come back. Don't worry.\"","Tying the climbing rope around herself, she began making her way down.","The flash flood had already washed over the low-lying areas, completely submerging the path they had originally come from.","Yu Kexin couldn't quite hold back her tears.","Sheng Ciyuan wanted to chase after her, but Xue Yun pulled him back. Her voice was calm. \"The past few days of military training have already proven that the person with the best physical stamina in our class is undoubtedly Rong Yu. She can go, but you can't, because you have no way to protect yourself.\"","Sheng Ciyuan's eyes turned red.","Song Huai watched Rong Yu's fading silhouette, his lips pressed into a tight, straight line.","He had always been a selfish person.","Yet, in this moment, he suddenly wanted to follow her.","But he also knew clearly that he was inferior to Rong Yu in every way; chasing after her would only make him a burden.","Rong Yu stepped over the slippery rocks as she headed downstream.","By now, the roaring sound of the flash flood was gradually fading. Although the muddy water had leveled out somewhat, the current was still incredibly swift. The rocks, washed over by the floodwaters, lay exposed, their surfaces coated in a layer of slick, sticky mud.","Suddenly, a faint cry for help carried over, mixed in with the sound of the rushing water.","\"Help!\"","She quickened her pace and turned a corner. Not far away, in the center of the torrent, she saw a large group of boys clustered around a boulder. As the water level rose, their safe haven grew increasingly cramped. More than a dozen boys on the outer edge were already standing in the floodwaters, the water reaching their waists. Every single one of them wore an expression of absolute despair."]},{"number":304,"title":"Chapter 304: One must always pay for one's own actions.","paragraphs":["The water level continued to rise.","Over twenty boys were on the verge of an emotional breakdown, angrily pointing fingers at Duan Fei.","\"It is all your fault for insisting we take this route!\"","\"My phone was washed away, and my backpack is gone too.\"","\"Rong Yu already said this was a danger zone, but you still insisted on leading us here. You are going to get us killed!\"","\"...\"","Duan Fei sat on a rock, looking utterly wretched. He had broken his leg while fleeing for his life and was in agonizing pain, but he could not care less about that right now because they could die here at any moment.","He snapped back, \"I did not force you to take this path. You followed me voluntarily, and now you are blaming me? Stop pointing fingers at a time like this and think of a way out!\"","They were a group of top students, highly accomplished academically, but their practical survival experience was practically zero. They had no idea what to do.","\"Look! Who is that?\"","\"It is Rong Yu. Why is she...\"","Everyone looked up toward the riverbank. Rong Yu, dressed in her military training uniform, was tying a rope, securing it firmly to a large tree on the bank.","She raised her voice, \"Hold hands so you do not get washed away by the flood! I am coming over right now!\"","The boys wore complicated expressions.","They never expected that the person coming to save them would be the girl they considered the most timid.","In such a dangerous situation, she had actually come alone.","Was she not afraid?","In Rong Yu's mind, there was no concept of fear.","After tying the rope, just as she was about to step into the floodwaters.","Suddenly.","Her arm was grabbed.","She thought it was that disobedient kid Sheng Ciyuan following her, but when she looked up, she froze.","\"Sheng Qingyan?\"","Was he not at the No. 4 Base Military District? Why would he suddenly appear in the mountain forest during the freshmen's weighted cross-country march?","Her eyes sparkled.","Causing Sheng Qingyan's ears to quickly turn bright red.","He looked down and untied the rope from her waist. \"The flash flood water is too cold. Girls should not wade in it. Leave it to me.\"","He fastened the rope around his own waist. With steady steps, he waded directly into the water, fighting the strong current as he made his way toward the large rock.","The current was quite fast. Even though he was a soldier, the force of the water made him stumble slightly, but he did not stop. He pushed forward and finally stepped onto the large rock.","\"Count off first, then come over one by one. Hold tightly to the rope!\" Sheng Qingyan's voice was cold and commanding. \"Groups of three, move quickly!\"","Duan Fei, pale-faced, endured the pain and said, \"Instructor, my leg is broken. I cannot walk. Could you please carry me over on your back?\"","Sheng Qingyan crouched down and examined him. \"It is a dislocated bone, nothing serious. I will splint it for you.\"","He casually fished two branches out of the water and swiftly and neatly fashioned a splint for Duan Fei.","Two boys helped Duan Fei stand up.","As soon as Duan Fei stood straight, he trembled in pain. He stammered, \"Instructor, I...\"","He wanted someone to carry him.","\"A person must pay the price for their actions,\" Sheng Qingyan said mildly. \"You walk back the same way you walked here.\"","The group slowly but systematically crossed the rapids.","Sheng Qingyan stood in the most dangerous part of the river's center, like an unshakeable reef, steadying the rope for every student who passed.","Rong Yu assisted from the bank, pulling the mud-covered students ashore one by one.","The boys said sincerely, \"Thank you, Rong Yu.\"","Even Duan Fei muttered a word of thanks.","After the last student arrived safely, Sheng Qingyan finally untied the rope from his waist. He walked toward the shore against the light, the water parting around his legs. His camouflage pants clung to his muscular lines, and every step carried the distinct crispness of a soldier.","He stopped in front of Rong Yu and suddenly frowned. \"Your hand.\"","Rong Yu was startled. \"What is wrong?\"","Sheng Qingyan took a band-aid from his shirt pocket and placed it on the back of her hand.","Only then did she notice that the back of her hand had somehow been scratched by a rock. The skin was slightly broken and bleeding a tiny bit, but it was nothing serious.","However, seeing him act so carefully, she did not pull her hand back.","In the distance, the rescue team arrived.","Huaqing University's freshman weighted cross-country march had to be terminated early because the flash flood cut off the roads. Everyone gathered on the main road and took trucks back to the campus.","The vehicles parked at the campus gate. After a day of suffering, the exhausted students trudged toward their dormitories.","Rong Yu was not in a hurry to leave.","She stood at the gate and waited for a while.","A head popped over. It was Sheng Ciyuan. \"Rong Yu, are you waiting for my older brother?\"","Rong Yu flicked him on the head. \"You know, yet you still ask.\"","Sheng Ciyuan whispered, \"My brother got off early to change clothes. Rong Yu, do you want to go change too?\"","Rong Yu looked down.","She was still wearing her military training uniform. Her upper body was fine, but below the knees, she was covered in mud. Her shoes, in particular, were completely unrecognizable from their original color.","She said, \"Then wait here for me for a bit. I will go change.\"","She turned around and ran toward the dormitory building.","Just as she left, Sheng Qingyan arrived.","Sheng Ciyuan looked at the approaching man and almost did not recognize him.","Was this really his older brother?","Stripped of his military uniform, he wore a simple, crisp white shirt. His shoulders were broad, filling out the fabric perfectly, faintly revealing the outline of his back muscles. His waist was trim, and the black casual pants tucked at his waist made his legs look even longer.","Sheng Qingyan coughed slightly. \"What is wrong? Is there a problem?\"","Sheng Ciyuan gave a thumbs up. \"No problem at all. You look super handsome, bro, leagues ahead of Huaqing's campus heartthrob. Rong Yu definitely will not be able to take her eyes off you.\"","He had thought his brother had stumbled through his twenties without a clue on how to pursue a girl.","It seemed he had worried too much.","He looked into the distance and saw Rong Yu approaching.","\"Good luck, bro.\"","Sheng Ciyuan turned and left.","Sheng Qingyan turned his head and looked at the approaching girl.","She had changed into a white dress, her hair tied in a high ponytail, radiating youthful energy. The closer she got, the redder his face became.","She was truly too beautiful.","Rong Yu originally wanted to tease him.","But seeing him like this, he could not handle being teased at all. Never mind.","She asked, \"Why did you come to the capital?\"","Sheng Qingyan walked beside her and replied, \"I returned to the capital to handle some file-related matters, and took the opportunity to serve as the military martial arts instructor for Huaqing University's freshman camp for a day. I am leaving tomorrow night.\"","\"That is perfect. Let us grab a bite first, then go watch a movie.\" Rong Yu took two movie tickets out of her bag. \"It is the big star Yan Ting's new movie. I have not seen it in the cinema yet. Are you interested?\"","Sheng Qingyan said, \"I have never actually been to the movies before. I am very interested.\"","Rong Yu could not help but laugh.","The two grabbed a casual meal near the school and then entered the cinema.","Ji Yanting's movie was a crime-solving thriller with a very minimal amount of romance. Even though the romantic subplot was sparse, it jumped straight into explicit scenes.","The male and female leads were passionately making out in the shower.","Rong Yu: \"...\"","Are movie scales all this big nowadays?","That kid A-Yan looked so honest and well-behaved, she never expected him to be so fierce in kissing scenes... This was not something an elder like her should be watching!","She turned her head away.","Only to meet Sheng Qingyan's gaze.","He actually swallowed hard, his Adam's apple bobbing.","Rong Yu thought of her past life..."]},{"number":305,"title":"Chapter 305: Captain Sheng is too timid to even hold hands.","paragraphs":["Emerging from the movie theater, it was already nine o'clock at night.","Most of the moviegoers here were young couples. Boys and girls held hands or had their arms around each other's waists, looking incredibly intimate.","Sheng Qingyan only dared to lightly brush against Rong Yu's arm, not daring to make any further moves.","The next second.","Rong Yu, however, linked her arm through his.","Even through his clothes, she could feel the hard, solid muscles of his arm.","Sheng Qingyan's entire body stiffened.","Suddenly, he didn't even know how to walk anymore, his arms and legs moving awkwardly in tandem.","\"Hahahaha, I'm dying of laughter!\"","\"Captain Sheng is actually walking like a crab, that's too funny.\"","\"Hurry up and take a video, let Si Lin and Hai Chang'an have a good laugh too...\"","Rong Yu turned her head.","She saw two people sneaking along behind them. It was Tang Mi and Zhou Shiyu.","Now that they were caught, the two stopped hiding.","Zhou Shiyu winked playfully. \"Captain Sheng, you were way too restrained back there in the theater. Why didn't you go in for a kiss?\"","Tang Mi smirked. \"Captain Sheng is too timid. He doesn't even dare to hold her hand, let alone force a kiss. Keep dreaming!\"","Sheng Qingyan was speechless.","He was timid?","He was actually being called a coward?","He wanted to argue back, but didn't know where to start. He could only keep a cold face, silently radiating a chilling aura.","Rong Yu was truly at a loss for words.","How could she run into these two gossips even on a date?","She let go of Sheng Qingyan's arm and asked with a serious expression, \"What are you two doing at Huaqing University?\"","\"Two things,\" Tang Mi replied. \"First, regarding Ji Zhouye's startup—his proposal is ready, so a few of us investors are meeting up to discuss it. Second, Zhou Shiyu got herself a boyfriend who also got into Huaqing University. He broke his leg during military training, and Shiyu was so heartbroken she had to come visit him.\"","Rong Yu paused. \"Zhou Shiyu, your boyfriend is actually a freshman?\"","Zhou Shiyu lifted her chin. \"What's wrong with an older woman-younger man romance? Miss Rong, let me tell you, younger 'puppy dog' boyfriends are the best. That physique, that energy, those skills in bed... you should try dating one to experience it for yourself...\"","Halfway through her sentence.","She suddenly felt a sharp, icy glare sweep over her.","Forced to swallow the rest of her words, she let out a dry laugh. \"But soldiers are even better! Their physiques are way more impressive, hahaha! You two enjoy your date. I'm going to go see my boyfriend now. I'll introduce you guys later.\"","Waving her hand, she grabbed Tang Mi and quickly fled the scene.","The nighttime campus was filled with couples.","At the entrance of the dormitories, there were several couples locked in tight embraces, reluctant to part.","Sheng Qingyan didn't even dare to look at the others. He could only stare at Rong Yu, his throat suddenly dry. \"I... I've been promoted. I'll be very busy from now on. After I leave tomorrow night, I might not be able to return to Beijing until the Spring Festival...\"","Rong Yu met his deep, dark eyes. \"That means we won't see each other for at least a few months. Aren't you going to give me a hug?\"","The night breeze brushed past, carrying the scent of osmanthus. Sheng Qingyan's breath visibly hitched for a moment.","His heart was pounding wildly in his chest. He slowly raised his arms, but paused just as he was about to wrap them around Rong Yu. In the end, he only loosely hovered his arms behind her back, keeping a safe distance between his palms and her body.","Rong Yu could smell the clean scent on him.","His chest was very warm, and his heartbeat was incredibly fierce, transmitting rapid vibrations through his shirt.","The hug was very light, yet it carried a scorching heat.","Sheng Qingyan's hands remained restrained throughout. His lips were only an inch away from her forehead, but he turned his face away at the very last moment before touching her, leaving behind only the trace of his hot breath.","Three seconds. It must have been only three seconds.","Sheng Qingyan let her go.","He said hoarsely, \"Tomorrow... yeah, we'll see each other tomorrow. I'm your instructor.\"","Rong Yu smiled and said, \"See you tomorrow then.\"","She waved at him and turned to head upstairs.","The moment she entered her dorm room, she was cornered by Yu Kexin. \"Wow, Rong Yu! It's only been a few days since school started and you're already dating? Spill it! Who was the guy that just dropped you off? When did you meet? How long have you been dating? Quick, quick, quick, I want all the gossip!\"","Rong Yu was speechless.","\"I'm exhausted. I'm going to take a shower first.\"","By the time she came out of the shower, the gossip-hungry Yu Kexin had already fallen asleep in her bed.","At 5:30 the next morning, they woke up on the dot. Morning runs, standing at attention, goose-stepping... After a series of basic training exercises were completed, Instructor Yan announced sternly, \"Attention! At ease. Next up is military martial arts training, which will be guided by Instructor Sheng.\"","Only then did the freshmen notice a figure slowly approaching from a distance. He was also wearing a military uniform and combat boots. His aura was completely different from Instructor Yan's—much colder and more intimidating—but it couldn't hide his outstanding facial features.","\"Oh my god, he's so handsome!\" Yu Kexin covered her mouth and gasped. \"In my short eighteen years of life, I've never seen someone so handsome in real life!\"","The boys also exclaimed, \"Holy crap, did this instructor just step right out of a special forces poster? He looks so badass!\"","Sheng Ciyuan proudly puffed out his chest, dying to tell everyone that this was his older brother.","Sheng Qingyan slowly walked closer.","He took off his sunglasses, revealing a pair of eyes as sharp as a falcon's. \"I am your military martial arts instructor. My surname is Sheng. First, let me get a feel for your foundations. Who wants to come up and exchange a move with me?\"","The boys were eager to try, but also a bit intimidated.","Sheng Qingyan was just about to call on someone.","Yu Kexin impatiently raised her hand. \"Ladies first! Me, me, me! Let me give it a try.\"","She had barely rushed over.","Sheng Qingyan executed a clean shoulder throw. The world spun around Yu Kexin, and the next thing she knew, she was lying on the mat. Staring up at the blue sky, she muttered, \"Mom, my first love hasn't even started, and it's... it's already over...\"","Sheng Qingyan spoke in a flat voice, \"Who's next?\"","The boys were spooked and backed away in unison.","\"I'll go.\"","Rong Yu stepped forward.","A hint of a smile flashed in Sheng Qingyan's eyes as he imperceptibly adjusted his stance.","Rong Yu had never specifically trained in military martial arts. Her older brother had taught her a few moves when she was little, and while she was studying abroad, Ji Zheng had also given her hands-on instruction. She had picked up a bit here and there, though she hadn't mastered it.","She made the first move.","Her movements were incredibly fast. Her right leg swept toward Sheng Qingyan's lower body like a whip, bringing with it a fierce gust of wind. This low sweep was clean and sharp, striking from a tricky angle. It was a variation of military martial arts that Ji Zheng had taught her abroad.","A flash of surprise appeared in Sheng Qingyan's eyes. He took a half-step back, his left hand forming a claw to grab Rong Yu's ankle, while his right hand was primed and ready—a standard military grappling starting stance.","But Rong Yu had anticipated this.","She suddenly changed tactics, forcefully retracting her half-completed sweep. Using her momentum, she launched herself into the air, driving her left elbow toward Sheng Qingyan's temple.","Instructor Yan couldn't help but exclaim, \"Beautiful!\"","From the very first day, this girl had demonstrated military aptitude far beyond that of a normal person, leading the pack in every aspect. He hadn't expected her to actually know military martial arts too.","Yu Kexin was stunned. \"Rong Yu is so incredibly badass.\"","Xue Yun secretly pushed up her glasses. \"She's so amazing.\"","Sheng Ciyuan's jaw dropped in disbelief.","Why did it feel like these two were enemies, trying to beat each other to death?","\"Thud.\"","The heavy impact forced Sheng Qingyan to take a few steps back.","The boys couldn't hold back their cheers: \"Rong Yu, you're awesome! Go for it, take down Instructor Sheng!\"","The moment Rong Yu hit the ground, she executed another roll, her legs snapping out like a pair of scissors toward Sheng Qingyan's knees."]},{"number":306,"title":"Chapter 306: The Most Handsome Coach in the History of Huaqing University","paragraphs":["Sheng Qingyan suddenly laughed.","He didn't dodge or evade, allowing Rong Yu to lock his right leg. But in the moment he was about to lose his balance, his left hand clamped down on Rong Yu's right wrist like an iron vise. His right hand supported her lower back, and using her momentum, he fell backward, completing a flawless reversal.","As the world spun, Rong Yu realized Sheng Qingyan was protecting the back of her head, gently placing her onto the soft mat.","Yu Kexin raised her hand weakly. \"Instructor, you didn't treat us like this just now...\"","Sheng Qingyan's expression didn't change. \"Because you were the wrong examples, while she is the textbook answer.\"","\"You're very impressive,\" Sheng Qingyan said, looking at Rong Yu. \"But you lack systematic training. You should find an opportunity to learn.\"","Rong Yu stood up and said loudly, \"Thank you for the guidance, Instructor.\"","She returned to her spot in the formation.","Sheng Qingyan swept a cold gaze across the field. \"Male comrades, it's your turn. First up, the class monitor.\"","Song Huai replied, \"Report, Instructor! The class monitor broke his leg yesterday and is in the hospital.\"","\"Then you'll do.\" Sheng Qingyan pointed at him. \"Come up here.\"","Song Huai was speechless.","He shouldn't have opened his big mouth.","He stepped forward and stammered, \"I-Instructor, I'm not feeling well. Could I...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, Sheng Qingyan's long leg swept him right onto the soft mat. \"A true soldier never shows weakness. You can go down now.\"","Song Huai scrambled up from the mat, looking thoroughly disgraced, and returned to the ranks.","The rest of the boys shivered in fear.","Sheng Ciyuan raised his hand. \"I'll do it.\"","Sheng Qingyan struck like lightning. He grabbed Sheng Ciyuan by the belt with one hand, spun him around in the air three times like a windmill, and then lightly dropped him to the ground.","Sheng Ciyuan felt so dizzy he almost threw up on the spot.","This was his older brother, his own flesh-and-blood brother! How could he be so ruthless? After all these years of painstakingly raising his older brother, his efforts had ultimately been betrayed.","The boys went up one by one.","Sheng Qingyan stood in the center of the training ground. Over a dozen boys were already sprawled at his feet, scattered haphazardly like small saplings swept up by a sandstorm. He said coldly, \"This is Huaqing University's elite class? You can't even withstand a single blow. Rong Yu! Step forward! Come and give everyone a demonstration!\"","\"Yes, Instructor!\"","Rong Yu stepped out and stood before the crowd.","Everyone felt as if they had been granted amnesty and quickly ran back to their places in the formation.","The ground of the combat training field was scorching hot under the midday sun. Over twenty pairs of eyes from the Tianxingjian class were fixed squarely on Rong Yu.","Sheng Qingyan announced, \"I'm going to exchange a few moves with Rong Yu. Watch closely.\"","Hearing this, Rong Yu's gaze sharpened. She quickly adjusted her stance, lowered her center of gravity, and assumed a standard combat-ready posture. She knew Sheng Qingyan wanted to use actual combat to give the freshmen a more intuitive understanding of the techniques.","\"Watch closely. When the opponent attacks with a straight punch, after a conventional block, you can counterattack like this.\" As soon as Sheng Qingyan finished speaking, his right fist drove forward with a fierce gust of wind.","Rong Yu reacted extremely fast. She blocked with her left arm while spinning her body to the right. Her right hand formed a palm and chopped toward Sheng Qingyan's ribs as fast as lightning.","This strike was fast and precise, carrying the sound of breaking air. The freshmen couldn't help but let out low gasps.","But it was as if Sheng Qingyan had eyes in the back of his head. Just as Rong Yu's palm was about to touch his body, he violently twisted his waist, easily dodging the blow. At the same time, his left hand naturally grabbed Rong Yu's wrist. With a slight pull, he forced her arm off course.","\"Note that when counterattacking, you must leave yourself some leeway. Don't completely give away your center of gravity.\"","The two went back and forth, their movements so fast they were a dazzling blur.","Suddenly, a jarring voice rang out.","\"Stop! Stop right now!\"","The stunned twenty-plus freshmen looked toward the sound and saw an old man braving the blazing sun. He rushed over shakily and grabbed Sheng Qingyan by the shoulder.","Sheng Qingyan instinctively prepared to counterattack.","But the moment he turned his head and met Old Master Ji's aged face, he immediately let go, allowing himself to be pushed away.","\"This is too much! A grown man bullying a little girl, an instructor bullying a student—it's outrageous!\"","Old Master Ji hurriedly bent down to help Rong Yu up.","Sheng Qingyan spoke up, \"Old Master Ji, you misunderstand. This is a routine teaching demonstration, not bullying...\"","\"Oh, it's you.\" Old Master Ji recognized him and looked at him in astonishment. \"Weren't you at Base 4? Why did you come to Huaqing to be an instructor? Are you using this as an excuse to pursue...\"","\"Cough, cough, cough!\"","Rong Yu coughed loudly.","Over twenty pairs of bright, wide eyes were staring right at them. Why was this old guy spouting nonsense?","Old Master Ji finally realized his slip of the tongue.","He immediately looked at Instructor Yan and explained, \"I was invited by Huaqing University to give an entrepreneurship guidance lecture to the seniors. I just happened to be passing by. It was a misunderstanding, and I interrupted everyone's military training. I hope the instructor won't hold it against an old man like me.\"","Rong Yu silently grumbled in her heart.","This old guy definitely wasn't just passing by; he had gone out of his way to come watch her military training.","Moreover, this so-called entrepreneurship lecture was probably an opportunity he had painstakingly fought for, just so he could experience her college life.","Having such a clingy son was actually quite a blessing.","She suddenly felt very curious about what kind of presence this old guy would have on the podium.","She asked, \"What time is the lecture?\"","Old Master Ji replied, \"It starts at seven o'clock tonight.\"","It happened to be Saturday, so there was no military training in the evening. Rong Yu said, \"Save a seat for me in the front row. I'm going too.\"","Old Master Ji suddenly felt a bit embarrassed.","His little bit of entrepreneurial experience might serve as guidance for students, but wouldn't Mom find it too childish?","He hurriedly said, \"You guys continue your military training. I still have some matters to attend to.\"","He quickly walked to the shadows of a teaching building and made a phone call. \"A-Yuan, that entrepreneurship guidance PowerPoint you made for me is still lacking something. I need it to be of a higher level and more in tune with the times. Furthermore, it absolutely must be high-end, profound, and difficult to understand...\"","Ji Zhiyuan was speechless.","An entrepreneurship guide that needed to be profound and difficult to understand? Had the old man gone mad?","Sheng Qingyan was the military martial arts coach for the entire freshman camp. After teaching the Tianxingjian class for half an hour, he transferred to other colleges, while Rong Yu and her classmates continued their basic training.","After the day's training ended, Rong Yu and her roommates finished their dinner and went to attend the lecture together.","Just as she walked to the door, Rong Yu was surrounded by a crowd of people.","Most of them were junior and senior upperclassmen.","\"Look, the newly crowned campus belle is here! Winning the title by an absolute landslide, she truly deserves it!\"","\"She looks so beautiful and her grades are insanely good. I heard she's in the Tianxingjian class. Seriously, what door did God even close for her?\"","\"I heard that during the freshman military training today, she fought the martial arts instructor to a draw. She's too strong.\"","\"...\"","As they were talking, a figure suddenly walked in, and the crowd instantly fell silent.","These juniors and seniors hadn't participated in the military training, so theoretically, they shouldn't have recognized the martial arts coach. However, Sheng Qingyan's looks were simply too top-tier. Someone had secretly taken a photo of him and posted it on the school forum, where it instantly went viral. He was dubbed the most handsome instructor in the history of Huaqing University.","A group of girls began to scream wildly.","\"Oh my god, Instructor Sheng looks even more handsome in a button-down shirt!\" Yu Kexin stared in disbelief before immediately shrinking back. \"Is he walking toward us? Just seeing him terrifies me. I'm going inside.\"","Rong Yu stood her ground. When Sheng Qingyan walked over to her, she asked, \"Didn't you say you were leaving tonight?\"","\"I'll leave after the lecture,\" Sheng Qingyan replied calmly.","He couldn't shake the feeling that if he missed this lecture, he might miss out on something important."]},{"number":307,"title":"Chapter 307: Forgot to Say Thank You to Sheng Qingyan","paragraphs":["At seven o'clock, the lecture began.","The massive lecture hall, which seated hundreds of people, was fully occupied.","Ji Shunying, the founder of the Haicheng Ji Group, was a name that resonated like thunder.","He started from scratch, founding the Ji Group during the early waves of the commercial boom. Using minimal resources to achieve massive gains, he quickly established a firm foothold in the market through a few brilliant business decisions. Over the years, under his leadership, the Ji Group had continuously grown, its business empire expanding wildly from a single initial industry to multiple sectors, including finance, real estate, technology, and entertainment.","More than a decade ago, Huaqing University had invited him.","But Old Master Ji was a man of action; he knew how to do things, not how to talk about them, so he had refused.","If Rong Yu hadn't been studying at Huaqing University, he absolutely never would have appeared in this classroom.","Old Master Ji looked radiant. Standing on the podium in a Chinese tunic suit, he looked toward a group of students walking in from the doorway and spotted Rong Yu at a glance.","Among all these young people, his mother had the most vibrant energy and was the most eye-catching.","He smiled and waved, gesturing for Rong Yu to sit in the first row, but his smile froze the moment it appeared.","Why was that guy, Sheng Qingyan, following his mother?","There were exactly five seats in the first row, and five people sat down. From left to right, they were Sheng Ciyuan, Sheng Qingyan, Rong Yu, Yu Kexin, and Xue Yun.","The class bell rang, and Old Master Ji couldn't care about anything else. He cleared his throat and began, Hello, students. I've been in the business world for so many years, I assume there's no need for an introduction?","The students immediately chimed in:","No need, no need! We all know you, Old Mr. Ji!","The Ji Group is the leading enterprise in Haicheng, who wouldn't know your great name!","Old Master Ji smiled in satisfaction and got straight to the point. Today, we are going to talk about the opportunities and challenges of college student entrepreneurship. However, before we begin, I want to gauge how much everyone here knows about this topic.","Rong Yu was originally quite curious about how this old boy would teach the class, feeling much like parents of this era watching their children perform at a kindergarten Children's Day show. However, she saw her old son's eyes dart around mischievously.","She was far too familiar with this expression.","It was the precursor to him doing something bad.","Sure enough, Old Master Ji's gaze locked precisely onto Sheng Qingyan. He smiled and said, This male student in the white shirt, could I ask you to answer a few questions?","The eyes of the entire classroom turned in unison toward Sheng Qingyan.","Rong Yu: ...","She knew he would pull a stunt like this, she just knew it!","Yu Kexin raised her hand. Reporting to the teacher, this is not a student, but the military martial arts instructor for the freshman camp!","It seems this instructor is very interested in the knowledge of college student entrepreneurship. It is my honor, Old Master Ji continued to smile amiably. Since he has come to my classroom, he is my student. Is there a problem with a teacher asking a student to speak?","Sheng Qingyan straightened his back and stood up.","He was too tall. Standing in the first row, he was like a solid wall, blocking everyone's line of sight.","Old Master Ji sneered inwardly, but his face remained genial. I'll ask a simple, basic question. Please explain the difference between a full ratchet provision and a weighted average provision, and their impact on an entrepreneurial team.","Sheng Qingyan: ?","He could take down a sniper in a single second, and he could locate a target ten kilometers away in a sandstorm, but he completely couldn't understand these words that sounded like absolute gibberish to him.","Seeing him standing there looking bewildered.","The little person in Old Master Ji's heart couldn't help but put his hands on his hips and laugh up at the sky.","He snorted. You don't even know such a simple piece of knowledge, so why did you come to listen to this class? I see your standing posture is quite standard, but unfortunately, your head is empty. Young man, having nothing but brute strength won't do...","At this time, a student in the front row raised his hand. Old Mr. Ji, your question itself is contradictory. The full ratchet provision only applies when the subsequent financing price is lower than the previous round, whereas the weighted average provision applies to all situations. The two shouldn't be comparable.","Old Master Ji: ...","When he was studying back in the day, there weren't so many bizarre terms. It was Yuan who had written them into the lesson plan. Because he had to teach, he had researched it for several days in advance just to understand the superficial meaning. If he had to go deeper, he wouldn't be able to say anything.","Of course, he wasn't here to teach students these basic concepts in the first place.","He was a man of action, so naturally, he would start from practical situations.","He came up with this question to make Sheng Qingyan lose face, but he didn't expect that the one losing face would be himself...","Sheng Qingyan suddenly spoke up. What Old Mr. Ji means is for us to consider the differences in the applicable scenarios of these two provisions. Just as there are no completely identical battle plans on the battlefield, business decisions also need to be adapted to local conditions.","This analogy made Old Master Ji's back relax, and he immediately said, Exactly, this is exactly the direction I wanted to guide everyone to think about. Alright, you can sit down. Now, let's officially begin the lecture.","Old Master Ji adjusted his collar in front of the microphone. Most of the unpleasantness from just now seemed to have been absorbed by the podium. He sat on the edge of the podium, his legs dangling in the air, looking much more approachable and easygoing like a grandpa next door than when he was standing.","Speaking of my first time starting a business... he recalled. It was different from you guys now. At that time, carrying the eighty yuan I got from selling an ancestral inkstone, I rented a tin shed next to the train station...","A low murmur of amazement rippled through the audience below. Some students were busy taking shorthand notes in their notebooks, but he tapped his finger at them. Don't write down these useless things. You won't be able to use them in this era anyway. Just sit nicely and listen to the story.","Old Master Ji's voice echoed in the classroom.","Rong Yu seemed to see that eight-year-old child from years ago. He had also stood on a stage, wearing a big red flower, telling stories to the children in a loud, clear voice.","Time flew by in the blink of an eye, and he had become the Old Mr. Ji respected by everyone, capable of guiding the youth.","Sometimes there was cheerful laughter in the classroom, sometimes there was thoughtful silence, and sometimes new ripples of insight were drawn out, immersing the entire space in a peculiar tension—it held both the awe for a business legend and the relaxation of listening to a neighborhood grandpa tell old tales.","Sheng Qingyan suddenly squeezed Rong Yu's hand gently. A-Yu, I have to go.","According to regulations, he had to report back to the base tonight.","He had asked his leader for an extra two hours of leave, and dragging it out until now was pushing it to the absolute limit.","He reluctantly let go of Rong Yu's hand, took another look at Old Master Ji who was teaching with great enthusiasm on the stage, quietly got up, and bent over to walk out of the classroom.","When Old Master Ji finished his lecture, he subconsciously looked toward Rong Yu, and then casually glanced beside her. The seat was empty. For some reason, his heart suddenly felt empty as well.","He obviously hated this person being with his mother. Now that this person was gone, shouldn't he be happy?","Oh, he seemed to have forgotten something. He forgot to say thank you to Sheng Qingyan—thank him for the gift Sheng Qingyan had sent on his birthday, that bullet-shell mecha car that carried his beautiful childhood dreams."]},{"number":308,"title":"Chapter 308: The flag bearer is not an honor, but a responsibility.","paragraphs":["The class came to an end.","Many students gathered around, asking Old Master Ji for his autograph.","After Old Master Ji signed autographs and took photos with the students, he looked toward the door. His mother was still there waiting for him, which instantly filled him with a profound sense of security.","He trotted over eagerly. \"Mom, how was I during the lecture just now?\"","\"Yingbao did great,\" Rong Yu said with a smile. \"Military training will be over in a week. When the weekend comes, I'll go home and stay for a couple of days, so stop tiring yourself out by coming to the campus, okay?\"","Old Master Ji obediently agreed.","Rong Yu made a call, asking the third son, Ji Mohan, to drive over and pick up her elderly son to take him home.","Once she got used to the intensity of the military training, time flew by like water. In the blink of an eye, it was already the last two days of training.","\"Rong Yu, step forward!\"","Instructor Yan roared, and Rong Yu stepped out of the formation.","Throughout the military training, she had frequently been called out by the instructor to serve as a model for the rest of the class. She had long since grown accustomed to it.","\"You will be the flag-bearer for the entire freshman camp,\" Instructor Yan said, looking at her with admiration. \"You don't need to participate in the class training anymore. Go to the East Field for the flag-bearer's special training.\"","Rong Yu didn't have much interest in being the flag-bearer and asked, \"Reporting to the instructor, can I decline?\"","\"Do you think this is a personal matter?\" Instructor Yan's voice suddenly rose. \"On the day of the exhibition, you will be carrying the spirit of the entire freshman camp! It's the collective dignity that says we cannot be cowards once we put on this uniform!\"","He paused, his tone softening slightly. \"Being a flag-bearer isn't just an honor; it's a responsibility. Do you want other universities to treat Huaqing as a joke?\"","Rong Yu's blood instantly boiled with passion. She raised her hand in a standard military salute. \"Yes, Instructor.\"","The flag-bearer training ground was located in the open space behind the gymnasium.","When Rong Yu arrived, several people were already there, all preparing for tomorrow's military training exhibition.","One of the girls looked somewhat familiar. She recognized her as Luo Xuan, the runner-up on the campus beauty ranking whom Yu Kexin had constantly nagged in her ear about. Tall and sweet-looking, she was a beautiful sight just standing there.","They were the only two girls; the rest were all tall, robust male students.","The chief instructor stood at the front and announced loudly, \"You are all the most outstanding students selected from various colleges and departments. You will take on an important task in the military training exhibition. Now, I announce that the flag-bearer is Rong Yu from the Tianxingjian Class. The flag escorts are Luo Xuan, Lei Zhan...\"","One flag-bearer, six flag escorts.","\"Report!\" a very tall and muscular boy shouted. \"Instructor, why is a girl the flag-bearer?\"","The chief instructor replied coldly, \"What, does gender affect one's ability to carry a flag?\"","\"Instructor, what I mean is...\" The boy, named Lei Zhan from the Sports College, continued, \"A flag-bearer doesn't just need to march well; they also need stamina. The national flag plus the pole weighs nearly twenty pounds. Not just anyone can carry it.\"","Rong Yu's expression remained indifferent. \"Thanks for the reminder, but I should be fine.\"","Lei Zhan choked for a moment, then raised his chin and said, \"Instructor, I believe the flag-bearer selection should consider overall strength. I request an open competition with student Rong Yu, and the instructor panel can judge who is more suitable to be the flag-bearer.\"","Without waiting for the instructor to respond, Rong Yu turned directly to Lei Zhan. \"What do you want to compete in?\"","Lei Zhan clearly hadn't expected Rong Yu to be so straightforward. He hesitated for a second. \"Goose-step, turning, and flag-holding endurance. A comprehensive test of all three.\"","Rong Yu nodded, then looked at the instructor. \"Instructor, I accept the challenge. This is fair to everyone.\"","A hint of appreciation flashed in the chief instructor's eyes, but he quickly returned to his serious demeanor. \"There's no need. Being a flag-bearer is not a sports competition. Aside from various physical qualities, what we need more is someone who can remain calm under pressure.\"","His sharp gaze swept over Lei Zhan. \"Lei Zhan, your abilities are very strong, but a flag-bearer needs an aura as steady as Mount Tai, not an aggressive edge that shows off. Choosing Rong Yu was a unanimous decision by all the instructors, and it will not be changed. The reason you are a flag escort is that escorts must be even more vigilant than the flag-bearer to protect the flag behind them. This is a sign of trust, not a waste of your talents.\"","Lei Zhan's face turned livid, but military orders were absolute. He could only grit his teeth and reply, \"Yes, Instructor.\"","\"Now, attention everyone! Right face! Double time, march! Let the training begin!\"","Once the training started, Rong Yu quickly grasped the essentials.","Although she had never been exposed to flag-bearer training before, her excellent physical coordination and observational skills allowed her to learn at a rapid pace.","When holding the flag, her arms were as steady as a rock, without the slightest tremble. When marching in a goose-step, her rhythm was precisely consistent, generating a breeze with every step.","The next day was the freshman camp military training exhibition.","The sun was blazing. The perimeter of the sports field was filled with teachers, students, and leaders who had come to watch the ceremony. On the rostrum, the university leaders sat upright and proper, while the formations of various colleges lined up neatly, waiting for inspection.","Rong Yu stood below and immediately spotted three particularly noticeable figures on the stands: her Yingbao, Hai Dadun, and Sima Gang. These three were truly eye-catching no matter where they went.","Old Master Ji looked displeased. \"What are you two doing here?\"","Old Sima replied, \"You made the news a few days ago for your lecture at Huaqing. Are we not allowed to come and join in the fun?\"","Old Hai chimed in, \"You were the one who dragged Old Sima and me into becoming Miss Rong's fans. Today is Miss Rong's exhibition, so of course I have to come and take some photos. You have no idea, but hundreds of thousands of fans are currently waiting for me, their top fansite manager, to take pictures so they can feast their eyes.\"","Old Master Ji said, \"Before you post them, let me review them. Don't go posting any messy or unflattering photos.\"","Old Hai retorted, \"Shut up. When it comes to photography, I'm way better than you.\"","The few of them continued their noisy banter.","The host's impassioned voice came over the broadcast: \"Next to enter the field will be the representative formations of the various colleges from the freshman camp. They will be led by the camp flag, showcasing the youthful elegance of Huaqing's students!\"","Old Master Ji craned his neck. \"Old Hai, get ready to take pictures. They're coming out soon. Rong Yu is the flag-bearer, so she'll be the very first one. Make sure you take good photos!\"","Old Master Sima looked forward. \"Where? Where? How come I don't see her...\"","In the stands, a large crowd of students, both boys and girls, also craned their necks to look down at the field. After all, she was the new campus beauty and an outstanding student from the Tianxingjian Class. Everyone wanted to catch a glimpse of her divine looks.","Rong Yu stood in the preparation area, wearing a crisp and straight military training uniform. With her back perfectly straight, she stood tall and proud like a pine tree. Her sharpness was restrained, yet impossible to ignore.","She gripped the flagpole, ready to step off in a goose-step.","Right at that moment.","Crack—","Rong Yu's brow darkened. She looked down, only to see that a crack had surprisingly split open at the base of the flagpole.","Luo Xuan's eyes widened. \"How did this happen?\"","\"The flagpole is actually broken?\" Lei Zhan said loudly. \"Rong Yu, you were responsible for the final inspection, right? You actually failed to spot such a massive problem. You don't deserve to be the flag-bearer at all!\"","Rong Yu looked at him coldly.","Ten minutes ago, when she did the final check, everything was perfectly fine.","To ensure the exhibition went smoothly, she had gone to the restroom and left the flagpole right at the front. The person who could have damaged the flagpole was right there on the scene.","Luo Xuan had little strength and couldn't lift the flagpole, so it was impossible for her to do such a thing.","The remaining four boys all diligently fulfilled their duties as flag escorts. Lei Zhan was the only exception; during practice, he was always looking for all sorts of excuses to carry the flag instead...","She gave a soft laugh. \"If I'm not fit to be the flag bearer, are you?\""]},{"number":309,"title":"Chapter 309: I hereby declare you disqualified as a flag bearer.","paragraphs":["Rong Yu's voice was neither light nor heavy, but it pierced straight through Lei Zhan's fury like a sharp knife.","Lei Zhan's face darkened as he took a sudden step forward. Rong Yu, stop changing the subject. The breaking of the flagpole is a major mistake. As the flag bearer, you couldn't even do the most basic inspection. What right do you have to stand here?","He deliberately raised his voice, drawing the attention of students from other academies who were waiting nearby.","Rong Yu ignored those gazes, the corners of her lips curling up slightly. You're right, the breaking of the flagpole is a major mistake.","She suddenly bent down, picked up a small metal fragment from the bottom of the broken flagpole, and held it up in front of Lei Zhan's eyes. So, I'm very curious, why are there fresh file marks on the broken surface?","Lei Zhan's pupils shrank.","Rong Yu sneered. If a metal fracture is due to natural aging, the cross-section should be evenly worn. But this mark was made by a file. It's artificial, and it's very fresh, no more than half an hour old.","The entire area instantly fell silent.","A large group of students leaned in and looked closely. It really is. It's definitely an artificial mark. Who did this? Who would do such a thing?","Rong Yu looked calmly at Lei Zhan.","Lei Zhan's expression changed, but he quickly sneered again. What do you mean? Are you trying to say I did it? Do you have any proof?","Proof?","Rong Yu chuckled lightly. She suddenly reached out, grabbed his wrist, and flipped his palm over. There, impressively, remained a few traces of fine powder.","Is this the flagpole's exterior paint?","Lei Zhan yanked his hand back, his face livid. I... I just helped check it!","Quibbling is meaningless because the surveillance cameras captured everything! The chief instructor walked over, his voice suddenly rising. Do you even know the severity of sabotaging the military training performance? Huaqing's sports students are supposed to be the chosen ones. How can there be a student with such low moral character!","Lei Zhan opened his mouth. I, I...","The music from the broadcast was rousing, and the chief instructor couldn't be bothered to listen to him anymore. Good, very good. I now announce that you have lost your qualification as a flag guard. Get out of the formation right now! After the performance, wait for the school's disciplinary action!","Lei Zhan's face was full of disbelief.","The chief instructor pointed at Luo Xuan. You take Lei Zhan's place. Stand in position and prepare to march!","The march reached its climax.","The flag guard formation was ready and slowly walked towards the sports field.","Rong Yu, carrying the bright red flag on her shoulder, strode onto the main track.","The sunlight spilled on her tall and straight figure. The red flag fluttered loudly behind her, as if cheering for her.","In the spectator stands, the crowd cheered.","The leading female flag bearer is our Huaqing's campus belle!","She can walk so effortlessly while carrying the flag. No wonder she made a name for herself across the whole school during military training!","This is the true demeanor of Huaqing students!","Rong Yu looked straight ahead without glancing sideways, walking past the rostrum step by step.","She could feel the weight of the flagpole on her shoulder, and even more so, the weight of this responsibility. When she reached the front of the rostrum, she forcefully raised the flag upwards. The bright red flag shone brilliantly in the sunlight, as if declaring to everyone: Huaqing freshmen are fearless!","Old Master Ji shouted loudly, Rong Yu! Rong Yu!","Old Master Si was extremely excited, his youthful passion also ignited. He stood up and yelled, Look here! Rong Yu! We are here!","Old Master Hai pushed him aside. You two are blocking the light. Stand aside!","Click, click, click, he kept taking photos.","Rong Yu finished her lap and then immediately met up with her classmates from the Tianxingjian class, joining the class formation to walk another lap around the field.","The class formation leaders were supposed to be one boy and one girl, but Xue Yun wasn't interested in these things, and Yu Kexin was too weak. Therefore, two boys were chosen: one was Sheng Ciyuan, and the other was Song Huai.","The host's voice rang out from the broadcast: Now walking towards us is Huaqing's Tianxingjian class. They take 'As heaven maintains vigor through movement, a gentleman should constantly strive for self-perfection' as their motto. Their steps are sonorous, their gazes like torches. The students in the formation are lined up like pines, shining like iron armor reflecting the sun...","The class stopped at the rostrum, and Sheng Ciyuan and Song Huai roared loudly, Our slogan is—","The whole class shouted in unison, Tread the mountains and rivers! Strive for self-perfection! Those of Tianxingjian! Never surrender!","Warm applause broke out.","The spirited formations performed one after another.","After the Tianxingjian class finished their performance, the class monitor Duan Fei waited for them at the end, handing out mineral water to them one by one.","Last time during the weighted cross-country run, he broke his leg and stayed in the hospital for a week before being discharged. He still hadn't fully recovered, but at such an important moment, as the class monitor, he had to be present.","Rong, you really stole the show today.","A voice speaking broken Chinese sounded.","Rong Yu looked up and saw Sato. She took a sip of mineral water and gave a fake smile. It's a pity that Sato-kun will never have the chance to steal such a show. Who told your Sakura Country not to have the qualification to organize university military training?","Sato's face stiffened.","In World War II, Sakura Country suffered a crushing defeat, so they were severely restricted in military aspects.","He took a breath and said, Rong, I genuinely want to be friends with you. I hope we can make progress together on the Huaqing campus.","After saying that, he suddenly took out a bouquet of flowers from behind his back. To the most beautiful female soldier in Huaqing.","Sheng Ciyuan quickly put down his mineral water, squeezed between the two, and said coldly, Sato, do you know how many people want to give flowers and love letters to Rong Yu every day? Go line up on the side first.","Sato asked, Alright, then I'll line up first. I hope to have the opportunity to have dinner with Rong.","Rong Yu was speechless.","She felt disgusted just seeing people from Sakura Country.","Just then, her phone rang. She answered the call while walking out.","Hello, may I ask if this is the guardian of student Ji Zhouye?","Rong Yu's brow furrowed, and she walked to a quiet place. I am. What happened to Ji Zhouye?","I am Ji Zhouye's university counselor. From the beginning of military training until now, Ji Zhouye has been late or left early without reason four times. Today is the school-wide military training performance, and he is the team leader, but he suddenly disappeared and can't be reached. The negative impact is a small matter, but I'm worried about his personal safety...","Okay, counselor. I'll contact him right away.","Rong Yu hung up the phone and immediately dialed Ji Zhouye's number, but it couldn't connect, constantly showing no answer.","She suddenly thought of something and went online to check the movements of the XY esports team. Sure enough, at nine o'clock this morning, the team captain Yaoyao arrived in the capital. The esports competition started at ten o'clock, and the winner still hadn't been decided.","This kid had been so infatuated with that Yaoyao recently. He posted about Yaoyao almost every day on his social media. He actually had the audacity to skip the military training performance to watch the esports competition. This kid's skin must be itching for a beating.","What's wrong? Old Master Ji ran over to the field to find her. Did something happen?","Rong Yu smiled and said, It's nothing serious. Let's go home first.","She sent a message to Butler Yu, arranging for people to wait outside the competition venue, making sure to bring Lao Wu home as soon as possible."]},{"number":310,"title":"Chapter 310: Don't Want to Miss the Game, but Missed Military Training","paragraphs":["When Rong Yu and Old Master Ji arrived home, Ji Jingchuan had also returned, and Tang Jin came back together with him.","The young couple was in the kitchen helping the chef cook dinner.","\"Grandpa Ji, Miss Rong.\" Tang Jin wiped her hands and came out of the kitchen. \"I came to the capital for a meeting and dropped by to visit Grandpa Ji on the way. This is your favorite tea.\"","Old Master Ji teased her on purpose, \"Are you here to visit me, or to see A'chuan?\"","Tang Jin blushed. \"Of course, it's mainly to visit Grandpa Ji.\"","Old Master Ji burst into laughter.","\"Dinner is almost ready,\" Ji Jingchuan walked out of the kitchen. \"It's already this time, why isn't Aye back yet?\"","Rong Yu sat down at the dining table. \"Don't worry about him, let's eat first. Little Jin, come sit next to me.\"","Tang Jin froze for a moment.","Miss Rong was only eighteen, much younger than her, yet she actually called her Little Jin.","The most crucial point was that being called Little Jin by Miss Rong didn't make her feel uncomfortable at all; it seemed as if it was meant to be that way.","She obediently sat beside Rong Yu.","After dinner, Ji Jingchuan and Tang Jin went out on a date.","Rong Yu and her old son played chess in the living room. After playing for over an hour, her old son kept yawning, so she sent him off to bed. It wasn't until ten o'clock at night that the sound of a car engine finally came from the courtyard.","\"I'm back!\"","Ji Zhouye walked in carelessly. When his eyes met Rong Yu's, he inexplicably felt a head shorter and shrank his neck as he walked over to the sofa.","He knelt on the sofa, massaging Rong Yu's shoulders, and said with a thick face, \"Why is Great-Grandma so good to me, even arranging a driver to pick me up? Today's e-sports match was so exciting. My goddess Yaoyao took first place again and finally secured her footing in the team. If I hadn't almost gotten into a car accident on the way back, today would have been such a perfect day.\"","Rong Yu frowned. \"A car accident?\"","\"Don't worry, Great-Grandma, I'm fine, and the driver is fine too.\" Ji Zhouye smiled playfully. \"I'm a bit tired, so I'll go upstairs to rest first.\"","\"Stop right there,\" Rong Yu said coldly. \"Being late, leaving early, and even missing the military training performance just to watch an e-sports match. Ji Zhouye, shouldn't you give me an explanation?\"","Ji Zhouye shook her arm. \"Great-Grandma, don't be so serious. It's just missing a military training performance, it's not a big deal.\"","Rong Yu didn't say a word, just looking at him quietly.","Ji Zhouye's smile gradually froze.","The corners of his mouth drooped, and he lowered his head. \"Yaoyao's match was too important, I didn't want to miss it...\"","\"You didn't want to miss the match, but you missed military training?\" Rong Yu laughed out of anger. \"You still want to start a company? With this attitude of yours, can you run a company well?\"","Ji Zhouye mumbled, \"Great-Grandma, I wasn't just watching the match. I'm also accumulating experience for starting a company. I am discussing a partnership with Yaoyao. As long as Yaoyao agrees to be the face of the company, the company will be secure.\"","\"You don't even have a basic sense of collective honor. Why should others trust you and be the face of your company?\" Rong Yu said coldly. \"Think it through yourself and see if you are wrong or not!\"","She turned and went upstairs.","Just after she finished washing up and lay in bed reading, there was a knock on the door.","Ji Zhouye stood at the bedroom door, head bowed, and said, \"I'm sorry, Great-Grandma, I know I was wrong. I shouldn't have started letting myself go just because I got into college. The company needs to be run steadily, and college needs to be attended properly. I will definitely coordinate my time well in the future. By the way, Great-Grandma, do you have time in a few days? I want to arrange for you to meet Yaoyao. I will only consider partnering with someone you think is suitable.\"","Rong Yu closed her book. \"It's best to arrange it around dinner time in the evening, so it doesn't interfere with evening self-study.\"","Ji Zhouye breathed a huge sigh of relief and quickly agreed.","Rong Yu happily spent the two-day weekend at home and returned to school on Monday.","The first major class was physics, and the one tasked with teaching physics was the newly appointed academician, Liu Jinyue.","\"Did you hear?\" Yu Kexin whispered. \"Song Huai is Academician Liu's inner disciple. He was taken in as a student by Academician Liu during his senior year of high school. Just how outstanding must he be.\"","Rong Yu smiled and said, \"You are also very outstanding; you just haven't met a suitable teacher yet.\"","Yu Kexin sighed, \"I used to think I was amazing. But ever since I came to Huaqing University and entered the Heaven's Movement class, I feel...\"","She was a person with a wide range of interests. In high school, she was keen on participating in various competitions. She didn't snag a single gold or silver medal, only winning bronze medals in math, physics, and chemistry. She also didn't get the top score in the college entrance examination, only placing a mere eighth in the province.","Now that she was here, she really became the bottom of the barrel.","Xue Yun spoke calmly, \"College is just the first step in life. Don't belittle yourself, hurry up and listen to the lecture.\"","She didn't even know what competitions were, yet wasn't she still sitting in the Heaven's Movement class? From now on, she stood on the same starting line as these top-tier students. As long as she studied hard and delved deep into her research, there would naturally come a day when she would astound everyone with a single brilliant feat.","During the ten-minute break, Song Huai and Liu Jinyue chatted happily.","Many people cast envious glances.","Only about a fifth of the class had acknowledged famous teachers in advance during high school due to competitions or their family's connections. However, most of those teachers were just professors, or even merely associate professors. Compared to an academician, the sense of disparity immediately set in.","Academicians had access to many resources and could easily grab a handful of projects. As a student of an academician, one possessed far more than others.","Duan Fei walked up to the podium with his physics book. \"Academician Liu, I have a few questions I'd like to ask...\"","Liu Jinyue explained them carefully and thoroughly.","\"Thank you, Academician Liu,\" Duan Fei said. \"I am the class monitor of the Heaven's Movement class. If Academician Liu has any task notifications in the future, you can contact me directly. This is my WeChat.\"","Song Huai pursed his lips.","He knew that the class monitor also wanted to acknowledge Liu Jinyue as a teacher.","He had seen the class monitor's high school resume; it was very rich. It could be said that the monitor was even more outstanding than him.","If he hadn't participated in the physics competition with Rong Yu and won the gold medal, he might not have entered Liu Jinyue's sights.","Now, with so many excellent students here, he was truly a bit afraid that Liu Jinyue would take on more students. If that happened, his resources would be squeezed...","It wasn't until Wednesday that Rong Yu finally met her teacher, Yun Xiaoyuan.","Yun Xiaoyuan had been an academician for quite a few years now. Teaching was no longer her main task, but because of regulations from above, she taught two classes a week: one for the Heaven's Movement class and one for the Mathematics Department.","As soon as she walked in, the classroom quieted down.","Yun Xiaoyuan, an academician of the Mathematics Department at the Central Research Institute and the deputy director of the National Mathematics Research Institute, was only forty-two years old when she was elected. Moreover, she was an internationally renowned mathematics expert, a specially invited judge for the Fields Medal committee, and the only mathematician in Asia to be invited for three consecutive terms. The Yun's Theorem she founded completely solved Keller's conjecture and was evaluated as the most stunning breakthrough in the field of mathematical analysis in the 21st century...","In short, Academician Yun had many halos of glory surrounding her."]},{"number":311,"title":"Chapter 311: Why are you all rushing to curry favor","paragraphs":["The students of the Tianxingjian class were thirsty for knowledge.","During Academician Yun's lecture, no one dared to lose focus for even a second. They scribbled furiously, diligently noting down every single detail in their notebooks, even his pauses.","Xue Yun pushed up her glasses and whispered, \"What kind of qualifications do you need to become Academician Yun's student?\"","Yu Kexin, who browsed the forums every day and knew all the gossip, replied in a low voice, \"Academician Yun pours all his heart and soul into mathematical research itself and isn't very keen on taking students. Look at his top disciple, Lin Rang. See how outstanding he is? If you can become like him, maybe Academician Yun will give you a second glance.\"","After reading Lin Rang's profile, Xue Yun instantly looked as if all the spirit had been drained out of her.","She lowered her head and went back to her books.","For students, studying was always the main theme of life, and the day's classes quickly came to an end.","After class in the evening, Rong Yu was called to her counselor Cheng Rui's office. \"Rong Yu, a senior is doing her graduation project and needs a student assistant. For a freshman, this is a great opportunity to gain experience. Once the project is completed, you can earn an extra credit. Are you interested?\"","Initially, Rong Yu wasn't very interested.","But the moment she heard about the extra credit, she nodded immediately.","She planned to complete all four years' worth of college credits within a single year. There was no precedent for this at Huaqing University, where the current record stood at nearly two years.","She needed to max out her core and elective courses as quickly as possible.","If she didn't learn as much as possible while she was young, was she supposed to just let her youth go to waste?","Cheng Rui took her to the laboratory.","The senior was named Zhai Weitong, a graduating fourth-year student who had won the National Scholarship three times in a row. She had been fiercely recruited by MIT and Stanford with full scholarships, but ultimately chose to stay at her current university for a direct Ph.D. program. This was Zhai Weitong's final project as an undergraduate—a highly creative endeavor fully supported by the school.","\"Thank you, Ms. Cheng, for recommending a junior to me,\" Zhai Weitong said with a smile. \"Let's add each other on WeChat first. Send me your class schedule, and I'll arrange the time.\"","Rong Yu nodded. \"I look forward to learning from you.\"","After chatting with the senior, Rong Yu received a call from Ji Zhouye. \"Great-Grandma, we're at the gates of Huaqing University. We're at a roadside barbecue stall, you'll see it as soon as you come over.\"","At dusk, many barbecue stalls opened for business along the snack street.","As soon as Rong Yu walked over, she saw a group of people sitting there: Ji Zhouye, Zhou Shiyu, Tang Mi, Si Lin, and Hai Chang'an. The whole gang of rich kids was present. Perhaps because it was their first time doing something major like starting a company, they were all dressed quite formally.","Among them, a girl in a tight black top stood out. She had straight black hair cascading over her shoulders, a tense expression, and a pair of cold eyes that continuously sized up Si Lin's group. Rong Yu couldn't read the meaning behind her gaze.","\"Miss Rong is here!\"","Zhou Shiyu was the first to spot Rong Yu. She stood up to greet her and naturally took Rong Yu's bag for her.","Tang Mi kicked Hai Chang'an aside. \"Move away, let Miss Rong sit next to me.\"","When Hai Chang'an stood up, he even wiped the chair clean.","Si Lin picked up the menu and handed it over. \"Miss Rong, see what you'd like to eat. Order whatever you want, it's my treat today.\"","Ji Zhouye rolled his eyes. \"Why are you all kissing up to her? Get lost!\"","He led Rong Yu over and assertively seated her right in the middle.","Yaoyao looked at the approaching girl in disbelief.","This girl was treated like the moon surrounded by stars—no, that was an understatement. It was more like an empress dowager arriving. These wealthy young masters and socialites didn't dare to neglect her in the slightest.","She stared at Rong Yu for quite a while, frowning slightly.","At the same time, she remembered that during her first official meeting with Ji Zhouye, this very girl had been by his side. Just like now, she was completely unreadable.","\"You must be Yaoyao, the one Ah Ye is always talking about,\" Rong Yu said, flashing a smile. \"I'm Rong Yu, Ah Ye's friend.\"","\"Hello, Miss Rong.\" Yaoyao reached out her hand. \"Nice to meet you.\"","Rong Yu shook her hand.","She felt the strength in Yaoyao's fingers as they pressed heavily against her palm, as if searching for something.","She quickly let go.","\"Our gang is finally all here,\" Hai Chang'an announced. \"Ah Ye is the founder. Ah Lin, Tang Mi, Shiyu, and I are the four investors, each putting in ten million. Yaoyao is our technical consultant and the face of the brand. Miss Rong, you're in charge of steering the company's direction. Now, I declare the first partners' meeting officially open!\"","Rong Yu was speechless.","When did she ever say she wanted to join?","Whatever.","She glanced at Yaoyao.","For some reason, she felt a little uneasy.","But she had checked Yaoyao's background, and nothing seemed out of the ordinary. Was she just overthinking things?","\"Yaoyao, we haven't exchanged contact info yet,\" Si Lin said, pulling out his phone. \"I have a few buddies who are also your fans. When do you think you could sign a few autographs for them?\"","Yaoyao smiled and added his contact. \"Anytime.\"","Her pinky seemed to unconsciously brush against the back of Si Lin's hand.","Si Lin frowned.","He dated frequently and flirted with all sorts of women. In his book, this kind of behavior was defined as seduction.","But...","He took a look at Yaoyao.","She looked completely righteous, her gaze sharp, showing absolutely no hint of such intentions.","Hai Chang'an and the others also took the initiative to add Yaoyao on WeChat.","Yaoyao bumped Hai Chang'an's shoulder, voluntarily threw an arm around Tang Mi, and helped Zhou Shiyu fix her hair.","These guys all loved playing video games and had almost zero resistance to Yaoyao. They chattered away, asking her all sorts of questions.","Suddenly!","\"Watch out!\"","A passerby's exclamation rang out from the side.","Rong Yu had been quietly observing Yaoyao the whole time, not immersing herself in the chat. The moment she heard the shout, she reacted swiftly, leaping to her feet. Looking up, she saw a waiter carrying a bucket of charcoal tripping over a beer bottle on the ground. A large bucket of glowing, red-hot charcoal was hurtling straight toward their table.","It was aimed directly at the backs of Si Lin and Ji Zhouye.","Rong Yu lunged forward and forcefully yanked off the tablecloth. The cups and plates on the table crashed to the floor, shattering into pieces. The tablecloth snapped in her hands, forming an iron-gray barrier that forcefully intercepted the trajectory of the flying charcoal in mid-air.","The red-hot embers smashed against the taut fabric, burning several large holes into it.","Tang Mi and Zhou Shiyu finally snapped back to reality. Seeing the burning charcoal scattered across the floor, their faces turned pale with fright.","\"You've got to be kidding me. We come out for barbecue and run into this crap?\" Ji Zhouye looked deeply distressed. \"My luck has been terrible lately. If it's not a light fixture falling from the ceiling, it's a random car accident. If that charcoal had landed on me today, my face would have been ruined!\"","Si Lin moved a little further away from him. \"It's one thing for you to have bad luck, but don't drag us down with you. I almost died here.\"","Hai Chang'an suggested, \"I recommend looking into some metaphysics. Go pray to the gods and ward off this bad juju.\"","Ji Zhouye wanted to say he didn't believe in that stuff.","But he glanced at Rong Yu.","If soul transmigration existed, what else was impossible?","\"I have some things to take care of,\" Yaoyao said, standing up. \"Let's chat later.\"","She picked up her bag and left without another word.","Ji Zhouye instinctively moved to walk her out, but Rong Yu grabbed him and held him back."]},{"number":312,"title":"Chapter 312: Think carefully, what could Yao Yao possibly gain from it","paragraphs":["Yaoyao's figure instantly disappeared down the snack street.","A waiter came over to change their table and served them a few fresh plates of barbecue.","Rong Yu said faintly, \"This Yaoyao isn't suitable.\"","Ji Zhouye swallowed the mutton skewer in his mouth. \"Why? Isn't Yaoyao pretty good?\"","\"Yes, Miss Rong,\" Hai Chang'an said. \"Team XY currently has the highest popularity in the country, and Yaoyao's competitive level is beyond doubt. Having her join us would bring nothing but benefits.\"","Zhou Shiyu: \"Yaoyao's makeup is so beautiful, and she has such a powerful aura. I even want to learn a trick or two from her.\"","Tang Mi: \"Her fingers are long and slender. They look beautiful even without a manicure. I'll have to ask her how she takes care of them later.\"","Si Lin: \"Women are so superficial. Yaoyao is so skilled, yet is that all you two can see?\"","Tang Mi and Zhou Shiyu each gave him a punch.","Rong Yu looked up at them.","Enveloped by her faint gaze, the group instantly quieted down, sitting obediently to listen to her speak.","\"Aye,\" she began, \"how many times have you met Yaoyao? What is your current relationship, and how far has it progressed?\"","Ji Zhouye's face suddenly turned red. \"We haven't met that many times, she's too busy. Currently, our relationship is that of a fan and an idol. I'm trying hard to turn her into a partner. If there's a chance, developing into a boyfriend and girlfriend wouldn't be out of the question...\"","Si Lin rolled his eyes. \"You? Worthy of Yaoyao?\"","Ji Zhouye stood up, ready to curse at him.","\"Let me ask you again, why would Yaoyao agree to meet a fan like you? In other words, what is her motive?\" Rong Yu looked at him. \"Building relationships between people always has an underlying logic, which is mutual need. For example, you admire Yaoyao, but what about her? I can't see that she likes you. Think carefully, what could she be after?\"","The others beside them also helped ponder this logic.","Zhou Shiyu: \"Is Yaoyao very short of money? Is she with you for the money?\"","Ji Zhouye: \"She doesn't know I'm the fifth young master of the Ji family. How could it be for money? Don't think of Yaoyao as so vain.\"","Tang Mi: \"You look okay. Maybe she covets your body?\"","Ji Zhouye: \"Bullshit.\"","Hai Chang'an: \"Don't girls nowadays always emphasize emotional value? Can you provide good emotional support?\"","Ji Zhouye: \"What is emotional value?\"","Si Lin: \"Could she be after our yet-to-be-established company?\"","Ji Zhouye: \"When we first met, she didn't even know I was going to start a company.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","Rong Yu also had no clue.","She spoke up, \"Anyway, I don't really approve of you cooperating with Yaoyao. Of course, this is a company you guys are investing in, so the final decision is in your hands.\"","Zhou Shiyu: \"Since Miss Rong has said so, we definitely have to listen.\"","Tang Mi: \"Exactly. She's just a figurehead anyway. We'll just replace her.\"","Si Lin: \"I agree to replace her.\"","Hai Chang'an: \"If there are no objections, then it's settled.\"","Ji Zhouye scratched his head. \"Then how should I tell Yaoyao? I racked my brains trying to win her over before, and after just one meal, I suddenly terminate the cooperation. What will she think of me...\"","\"You should be glad you haven't signed a contract yet.\" Rong Yu stood up. \"I still have evening self-study. I'll head back to school first.\"","\"Hey, wait for me.\" Zhou Shiyu chased after her. \"Since we're already at the gates of Huaqing University, I might as well go on a date with my little puppy dog. Miss Rong, look, is my makeup flawless? Do I need to touch up my lipstick?\"","Rong Yu said seriously, \"You look beautiful, very pretty. No need for a touch-up.\"","Zhou Shiyu suddenly felt shy.","The two walked into Huaqing University together.","Rong Yu asked her, \"Which college is your boyfriend in? I'll take you there first.\"","Zhou Shiyu scratched her head. \"I'm not sure either. We usually don't talk about this. Miss Rong, don't worry about me. I'll just send him a message and wait here.\"","Rong Yu nodded and walked toward the teaching building for self-study.","Just as she arrived at the door, she happened to see Duan Fei walking out of the classroom.","The management of evening self-study for university students wasn't as strict as in high school. Some had elective courses, some participated in projects, and some joined various club activities. Overall, there was a lot of autonomy.","Rong Yu was researching the project she would be working on tomorrow.","It was a numerical simulation of a cosmic expansion model, combining several disciplines. If the project succeeded, they could even apply for a patent.","The most troublesome part of this project was the massive amount of calculations required. The senior student was looking for help mainly to share the calculation workload. For students in the Tianxingjian class, it wasn't too difficult, and for Rong Yu, it was even simpler.","The next morning, she only had one class. At ten o'clock, she went to the senior's laboratory.","\"Junior Rong, I'm sorry.\" Zhai Weitong suddenly looked at her apologetically. \"You were recommended by Professor Cheng. Logically, I shouldn't go back on my word, but I have no choice. This task is too heavy. All the calculations must be finished within a week. It requires pulling all-nighters and working around the clock. For a girl, the body won't be able to handle it, so...\"","Rong Yu's face showed no fluctuation. \"Did you find a male classmate instead, Senior?\"","Zhai Weitong felt even more guilty. \"Junior Rong, you are very excellent, but my project really isn't suitable for you. I can recommend another senior's project to you. It also gives credits, though only zero point five...\"","\"No need.\" Rong Yu said with a smile. \"Thank you, Senior, for teaching me something.\"","Rather than participating in someone else's project and doing trivial calculation work, it would be better to take the lead and start a project herself.","However, Huaqing University encouraged freshmen to first solidly grasp the knowledge of basic courses. Only after their sophomore or junior year could they apply for research projects, so as to avoid occupying laboratories and wasting research funds.","She currently didn't meet the conditions to start a project.","But there was also a rule that students participating in major projects could earn credits. She would ask her senior brother to help calculate later and see which major projects currently had her name on them...","Rong Yu turned around and went downstairs. At the corner of the stairs, she ran into Duan Fei.","Her fingers paused. \"So, Class Monitor, you were the one who took my spot?\"","A flash of unease crossed Duan Fei's face. \"There's no such thing as taking your spot, right? The senior was still looking for candidates anyway, and I just happened to be suitable. I was also forced by circumstances... I got injured during military training and stayed in the hospital for over a week, so I couldn't get the military literacy credits. I have to make them up elsewhere. Rong Yu, we are classmates. I hope you can understand.\"","Rong Yu shrugged and returned to her dorm.","\"Did you guys hear?\" As soon as she entered the door, Yu Kexin's little mouth started chattering. \"The class monitor is dating a senior. The most outstanding senior of that year, the daughter of Academician Zhai, the dean of the physics department. She has amazing talent and all her projects are heavily supported by the school. Guess what? Duan Fei actually joined the senior's graduation project. Isn't that crazy?\"","Rong Yu froze for a moment. \"Are you saying that Duan Fei and Senior Zhai Weitong are dating?\"","Yu Kexin nodded. \"Many people saw them holding hands and strolling around the campus.\"","Rong Yu curled her lips.","The senior choosing Duan Fei—she had actually thought it was out of other considerations.","Who would have thought it was because of this connection?","To think that the absolute best and brightest at Huaqing University could be so hopelessly love-struck. She truly couldn't understand it."]},{"number":313,"title":"Chapter 313: She had an absolutely absurd and outrageous guess in her mind.","paragraphs":["There was no evening self-study class on Friday night.","Rong Yu, Ji Zhouye, and the others agreed to go check out their company.","The company was located on the Third Ring Road. They had rented an office of about a hundred square meters, which was currently under renovation.","\"Although it looks a bit small, the company is just starting out. We'll take it step by step,\" Hai Chang'an said. \"This area is the partners' office; the few of us will share one room for now. Over here is for game planning, here's for tech, and here's for operations... We also partitioned a small, separate office right here so Miss Rong has a place to rest when she comes over.\"","Rong Yu: \"...\"","In such a small office space, there was really no need to reserve a special spot just for her.","After thinking for a moment, she said, \"Let's turn this into a pantry. It would be nice for the employees to have a place to rest and chat.\"","Si Lin took out a small notebook and jotted it down.","Tang Mi said, \"We've already chosen our new face of the team. He's the captain of another equally matched team, a guy. Here are his photos and resume, take a look, Miss Rong.\"","Zhou Shiyu chimed in, \"Ji Zhouye went to pick him up. Once he's here, Miss Rong can evaluate him. We won't sign the contract unless he gets Miss Rong's nod of approval.\"","Just as they were talking.","Ji Zhouye returned, but he was alone.","Si Lin asked anxiously, \"Where is our new face of the team? Where is the guy you were supposed to pick up?\"","Rong Yu's brow darkened. \"What happened to your arm? Did you get into a fight?\"","\"I...\" Ji Zhouye scratched his head. \"I went to pick that guy up, but then I heard him and his teammates badmouthing Yaoyao. If they were just criticizing Yaoyao's esports skills, I could have tolerated it. But those guys were actually spreading dirty rumors about Yaoyao! What they said was absolutely disgusting. I couldn't hold back, so I fought them. I took on three of them at once. Pretty impressive, right?\"","Hai Chang'an looked at him in disbelief. \"You're an adult. You are an adult now! Why are you still using violence to solve problems? Because you fought him, our deal for the face of the team has fallen through again?\"","\"No, seriously, Hai Chang'an, are your morals messed up?\" Tang Mi slapped the back of his head. \"They were spreading dirty sexual rumors about a girl! Does that kind of person deserve to be our partner, huh?\"","Rong Yu took out a band-aid, applied it to Ji Zhouye's arm, and asked coldly, \"Does Yaoyao know you got into a fight for her?\"","\"Of course she knows,\" Ji Zhouye smiled. \"She happens to be here for a competition and watched the whole thing. After the fight, she even gave me a hug. We hugged for a whole minute, hehehe.\"","\"What...\"","Rong Yu instinctively felt something was wrong.","But she couldn't pinpoint exactly what it was.","Just then.","A cracking sound echoed.","She looked up in disbelief and saw the newly installed suspended ceiling crashing down. In a split second, she only had enough time to drag Tang Mi and Si Lin, who were closest to her, out of the way.","\"Ah!\"","\"It hurts so much! My arm got hit.\"","\"Damn it, why are we so unlucky? Ji Zhouye, what evil deeds did you do to get punished by God like this!\"","\"...\"","The renovation workers were terrified and scrambled to pull them out of the debris.","Si Lin only had superficial wounds.","Zhou Shiyu's arm was pierced by a nail and bleeding.","Ji Zhouye had it the worst; his head was smashed open, leaving a bloody gash.","Rong Yu immediately rushed them to the hospital.","The doctors treated their wounds accordingly.","Ji Zhouye was howling in pain when his phone suddenly buzzed. He hurriedly checked it and instantly jumped up from the bed in excitement. \"Yaoyao just advanced in the World Esports Championship! She's currently the only female captain in Asia to make it to the finals. Oh my god, Yaoyao is too amazing... I need to call Yaoyao to congratulate her!\"","Even though his head was still hurting, he couldn't wait to make a video call, but suddenly he froze. \"What's going on? I'm not her friend anymore?\"","Si Lin leaned in. \"You've been blocked and deleted.\"","\"What? Yaoyao blocked me?\" Ji Zhouye was stunned again. \"How is that possible? She just gave me a hug when we met earlier. There's no way she would block me!\"","Hai Chang'an took out his phone and sent a message to Yaoyao. \"I've been blocked too.\"","Zhou Shiyu, Tang Mi, and Si Lin all checked their phones. They had all been blocked.","Ji Zhouye muttered, \"Is it because I didn't let her be a partner? Is she mad? But I explained it clearly to her, and she didn't seem to mind. Why would she block me? Did she accidentally click the wrong button... No, I have to go find her and ask her clearly.\"","\"Stop right there!\"","Rong Yu's voice was very cold.","She pushed Ji Zhouye back down. \"Stay honestly in the hospital. I'll come talk to you after I look into some things.\"","She walked into the corridor and made a call. \"Chuan, I had you look into Yaoyao last time, right?\"","Ji Jingchuan said, \"Yes, Great-Grandma. Yaoyao's real name is Zhao Yaomei. She's from the south and started emerging in the esports industry three years ago. She's a gifted esports player. What else do you need me to investigate, Great-Grandma?\"","Rong Yu said slowly, \"Investigate her family, especially around the three-year mark. Also, look closely into which fans Yaoyao has interacted with, how those fans met Yaoyao, how far their relationships developed, and what their current situations are. I want all the information. If you run into any difficulties, you can ask Secretary Jiang for help. The sooner, the better.\"","\"Understood, Great-Grandma!\"","After hanging up, Rong Yu stood in the corridor, her brows tightly furrowed as various thoughts raced through her mind.","She had a very absurd and outrageous speculation in her heart.","Although it was absurd.","She didn't dare dismiss it.","She had to cross-check it against the facts to confirm.","If it were true.","Then this Yaoyao was truly terrifying.","As she looked up, she saw a figure flash by at the end of the corridor. It looked a bit familiar. Was it Duan Fei?","But upon closer inspection, the figure was gone.","Duan Fei froze in place, then quickly hid behind a pillar.","Rong Yu?","Why was she also at the hospital?","He spoke to the person on the phone, \"I've already arrived at the hospital. Wait for me for five minutes.\"","He stood there waiting for a good while. Once he no longer saw Rong Yu, he stepped out and walked towards the hospital room. Just as he reached the door and was about to knock, he looked through the glass and saw Rong Yu sitting right next to Zhou Shiyu's bed.","Rong Yu and Zhou Shiyu knew each other?","He turned around and left immediately.","Zhou Shiyu waited for a long time but no one came. She made another call. \"Hello, Baby, why aren't you here yet? Did you get lost or... What? A sudden meeting? Okay, then you go do your work, your studies are important.\"","\"You're injured, what kind of meeting is your boyfriend attending? He doesn't care about you at all,\" Si Lin rolled his eyes.","Zhou Shiyu said, \"He's the class monitor. The semester just started, so there are a lot of things to do. What's wrong with having a meeting? You haven't attended Huaqing University, so you wouldn't understand.\"","Tang Mi peeled an apple for her. \"Tsk, a little puppy boyfriend isn't all that great anyway. You might as well just get an arranged marriage. At least you'd have someone around to run errands for you, and spending his money wouldn't give you any psychological burden.\""]},{"number":314,"title":"Chapter 314: After Meeting Yaoyao, I Started Having Constant Bad Luck","paragraphs":["Ji Zhouye was severely injured and had been receiving IV fluids.","In the evening, when the IV drip finished, Ji Jingchuan brought dinner into the ward and handed Rong Yu a stack of documents.","Rong Yu flipped them open.","Three years ago, the Zhao family had indeed undergone earth-shattering changes.","Father Zhao had an accident at a construction site, leaving both of his legs crippled.","Mother Zhao made a critical mistake at work, and all the family's savings went into compensating the factory.","The eldest son of the Zhao family was hit by a car and became paralyzed from the waist down.","And Zhao Yaomei began her streak of incredible luck right around that time. She was scouted by an esports company, became an overnight sensation, and entered the esports circle, enjoying smooth sailing ever since.","Rong Yu looked at another pile of documents. They contained the profiles of the fans Yaoyao had interacted with over the past three years.","Number one: a male college student. After interacting with Yaoyao, he was expelled from his university within a week and had accomplished nothing since.","Number two: a high school student. After he started following Yaoyao's offline matches, he suffered frequent accidents. To ensure he could safely take his college entrance exams, his family had to move to a different city before his life returned to normal.","Number three: a newlywed girl. Within a single month, she experienced her husband's infidelity, a miscarriage, and the siphoning off of her assets... Her originally happy life was left in ruins.","Number four...","Rong Yu frowned deeper the more she read.","Over the past few years, Yaoyao had interacted with over thirty fans in total, and every single one of them had ended up in miserable circumstances.","\"Look for yourself.\"","She tossed the documents onto Ji Zhouye.","Ji Zhouye flipped through the pages one by one, looking as if he had been struck by lightning. \"H-how is this possible? This is too absurd. It's a coincidence, it has to be a coincidence.\"","\"I don't think it's a coincidence,\" Rong Yu said, looking at him. \"Think about it carefully. Did you start experiencing frequent bad luck right after you met Yaoyao?\"","Ji Zhouye nodded blankly.","Rong Yu pressed on, \"Then try to recall, right before each stroke of bad luck, did Yaoyao do anything unusual?\"","Ji Zhouye grabbed his hair, trying hard to remember, but he couldn't come up with anything.","His eyes were a little red. \"Great-grandmother, are you saying that Yaoyao makes people unlucky? Why? That's not scientific.\"","\"The fact that Great-grandmother can undergo soul transmigration is proof enough that many things in this world cannot be explained by science,\" Ji Jingchuan said, his brow furrowed. \"The fans Yaoyao has interacted with share another common trait: their original lives were remarkably fortunate. Whether in terms of family, career, or academics, they were doing much better than ordinary people. It seems she can accurately identify this specific group of people.\"","Rong Yu knit her brows. \"How does she manage to transfer other people's luck onto herself?\"","This was a metaphysical paradox.","She couldn't see through it.","The three of them fell silent, lost in their own thoughts.","After a long while, Ji Jingchuan spoke slowly, \"Actually, I've always felt that I am incredibly lucky. How many people, after being switched at birth, manage to return to their blood relatives? And how many people, after being forced to drop out of school, can return to a high school classroom and get accepted into one of the top universities in the country?\"","\"Therefore, Chuan, you should cherish this luck,\" Rong Yu looked at him, \"instead of taking risks.\"","Ji Jingchuan replied, \"Great-grandmother, you are a researcher. Don't you want to figure out exactly what this energy is?\"","Rong Yu closed her eyes.","The memory of her first meeting with Yaoyao flashed through her mind.","That day, she had sensed that something was off about Yaoyao, so as soon as she returned, she asked Chuan to investigate.","By the same token, Yaoyao should also be able to sense her uniqueness.","She opened her clear eyes. \"I will go with you to meet this Yaoyao.\"","Ji Zhouye propped himself up and got out of bed. \"I-I'm going too. I want to ask her face-to-face why she blocked me.\"","\"Shut up.\" Rong Yu pushed him back down and shouted, \"Si Lin, Hai Chang'an!\"","The two of them were in Zhou Shiyu's ward next door. Upon hearing the summons, they scurried over in a flash.","Si Lin: \"Miss Rong, I'm here!\"","Hai Chang'an: \"Miss Rong, what are your orders?\"","Rong Yu said coldly, \"Keep an eye on this kid, Aye. Do not allow him to leave the hospital for even a single step. Can you do that?\"","\"Yes!\"","Rong Yu felt reassured and left with Ji Jingchuan.","After driving for over twenty minutes, they arrived at the esports building where Team XY was located. The lobby was incredibly lively; it turned out they were celebrating Yaoyao's advancement to the Global Esports Tournament.","Yaoyao sat on the sofa, holding a glass of dark burgundy wine, looking languid as she enjoyed the attention.","Just then, a staff member walked over and said, \"There's someone outside who wants to see you, Sister Yaoyao.\"","Yaoyao set down her wine glass. \"Is it a fan?\"","The staff member shook his head. \"Doesn't look like it.\"","Normal fans would have fanaticism in their eyes and carry gifts, but the man outside had a very cold expression.","Yaoyao assumed it was someone from her hometown coming to look for her.","She walked outside with a look of displeasure. Pushing open the glass doors, her eyes immediately landed on Ji Jingchuan standing there.","Her displeased features instantly smoothed out, and her eyes lit up. Stepping in her high heels, she quickly walked over and held out her hand. \"Hello, I'm Yaoyao.\"","Ji Jingchuan's gaze fell on her hand.","Great-grandmother had specifically instructed him to absolutely never have any physical contact with Yaoyao.","He spoke in an indifferent tone, \"I am Ji Zhouye's older brother.\"","\"Oh?\" Yaoyao crossed her arms over her chest, her eyes filled with amusement. \"What are you here to do on his behalf?\"","Ji Jingchuan stared at her. \"Why did you block him?\"","\"I accidentally clicked the wrong button. I'll just add him back.\" Yaoyao shrugged and took out her phone. \"You're Ji Zhouye's brother. Why don't we add each other as friends too?\"","Ji Jingchuan took a step back. \"No need.\"","Yaoyao smiled. \"If you don't want to, that's fine. By the way, the Global Esports Tournament will be held in the capital in a few days. Tickets are hard to come by. I'll give two tickets to Ji Zhouye, and you can come along with him.\"","Before she even finished speaking, Ji Jingchuan had already turned around and walked away.","She stood rooted to the spot, staring intently at his retreating back, her eyes filled with a sense of inevitable conquest.","Rong Yu had been standing at the staircase the whole time. Only after Yaoyao went back inside did she retract her gaze, her voice deep. \"Chuan, you have become her prey.\"","\"Great-grandmother is wrong.\" A smile curled the corners of Ji Jingchuan's lips. \"We are the hunters. She is the prey.\"","He took out his phone and checked. \"The Global Esports Finals are being held in five days. We don't have much time left.\"","Rong Yu already had a preliminary plan.","She had Si Lin and Hai Chang'an stay at the hospital to keep a close watch on Ji Zhouye, and she confiscated Ji Zhouye's phone.","Sure enough.","Yaoyao, who had previously blocked Ji Zhouye, started initiating contact after meeting Ji Jingchuan.","\"Aye, you have an older brother, right? What's your brother's name?\"","\"Aye, your brother seems to have some issues with me. Is there some misunderstanding?\"","\"Aye, I hope you can come to the esports finals in five days. It would be great if your brother could come too. I've specially prepared gifts for you both.\"","\"Aye, if you really like me, you absolutely must bring your brother along.\"","Rong Yu replied with three words: \"Got it.\"","The next day, when she returned to school for classes, she was cornered by Duan Fei at the classroom door. \"Rong Yu, let's talk.\"","Rong Yu thought it was about some class activity. \"Talk about what?\"","\"Come over here.\" Duan Fei walked to a deserted corner. \"I wanted to explain things clearly to you. My senior, Zhai Weitong, and I are not boyfriend and girlfriend. Please don't misunderstand.\"","Rong Yu frowned. \"No, why are you explaining this to me?\"","Duan Fei's face was taut. \"Anyway, just don't go talking nonsense to anyone.\"","Finding him utterly baffling, Rong Yu simply turned around and walked away."]},{"number":315,"title":"Chapter 315: Could Rong Yu Actually Be a Student of Academician Yun","paragraphs":["Rong Yu returned to the classroom and sat down.","She sent a message to her teacher, Academician Yun: \"Teacher, I have a few questions I'd like to ask. Could we have dinner together tonight? It would be even better if you could also invite Academician Min, Academician Lin, Academician Zhai, Academician Zhou, and Academician Tian...\"","Yun Xiaoyuan replied: \"I'm actually a bit curious about what you want to ask, little girl. Don't worry, I'll bring everyone who is free.\"","The last class of the afternoon was physics. Liu Jinyue, who was in his forties, was youthful and humorous. His lectures were incredibly engaging, turning dull physics concepts into fascinating topics. The students of the Tianxingjian Class were completely captivated.","As the dismissal bell rang, Rong Yu was the first to stand up. \"Academician Liu, please wait a moment.\"","She quickly walked up to the podium. \"Are you free tonight, Academician Liu?\"","Liu Jinyue smiled and said, \"It's for the dinner gathering, right? Academician Yun already messaged me... By the way, regarding this week's group assignment, there are a few things your group needs to pay attention to...\"","The topic suddenly shifted to physics.","Rong Yu listened attentively.","Sitting below, Duan Fei looked up.","He saw Rong Yu and Academician Liu engaged in a heated debate over a physics concept.","He wondered if someone like Rong Yu, who was so entirely devoted to her studies, would actually pay attention to the school's gossip forum.","Therefore, Rong Yu probably didn't know about the situation between him and Zhai Weitong.","No wonder she had looked so baffled when he tried to explain himself earlier.","Duan Fei felt an inexplicable sense of relief.","However, Song Huai, who was sitting by the window, felt his heart leap into his throat.","In the past, he had always wanted to introduce Rong Yu to Academician Liu.","But now, seeing Rong Yu and Academician Liu conversing so happily, a strong sense of crisis inexplicably welled up in his heart.","After finishing his chat with Rong Yu, Liu Jinyue waved at Song Huai. \"There's a dinner gathering tonight. Get ready, you're coming with me.\"","Song Huai's spirits lifted. \"Okay, Teacher.\"","He guessed that his teacher was taking him to an academic dinner.","Sure enough, when evening came and he entered the private room, he saw several academicians: the mathematics giant Academician Yun, applied mathematics expert Academician Min, molecular physics heavyweight Academician Lin, mechanics expert Academician Tian, and electromagnetics expert Academician Zhai... all of them were resounding leading figures in their respective fields.","Liu Jinyue introduced him to the crowd: \"This is my student, Song Huai. He's a very outstanding young man.\"","Min Shenyan nodded. \"I saw him at the last dinner. He is indeed excellent, with a very sharp mind. I have to say, why are you all so quick to act? Taking them in as students before they even start college, you really don't leave any chances for the rest of us.\"","Yun Xiaoyuan retorted in annoyance: \"You already have over thirty direct disciples under your name, what more do you want?\"","\"You can never have too many good students.\" Min Shenyan rubbed his hands together. \"Say, Lao Yun, let's make a deal. If you give your newly accepted student to me, I'll apply to transfer all my research funding for next year under your name. How about it?\"","Academician Lin immediately chimed in: \"Then I'll offer all my research funding for the next three years. Academician Yun, care to consider?\"","\"Are you two running an auction here?\" Yun Xiaoyuan sneered. \"I accepted my student through my own ability. Why should I give them up to you boors!\"","Song Huai's eyes flickered with surprise and uncertainty.","As far as he knew, didn't Academician Yun only have one student? When did she accept a new one?","For these academicians to cast aside their images and fight over them, this student must be exceptionally outstanding. Who could it be?","At this moment.","The door to the private room was pushed open.","\"Apologies for keeping you all waiting, Academicians. I'm sorry I'm late.\"","A clear voice rang out.","Song Huai's pupils contracted sharply. He whipped his head around and saw Rong Yu standing there.","Yun Xiaoyuan glanced at her wristwatch. \"There are still ten minutes until our agreed time. You're not late; we all just arrived early.\"","Min Shenyan chuckled heartily. \"It's rare for you to initiate a dinner gathering, little girl. I finished my work early and rushed over. Hurry up and take a seat so we can have a good chat.\"","Rong Yu walked in and sat between Yun Xiaoyuan and Min Shenyan.","Song Huai's mouth fell open in sheer astonishment.","Tonight's dinner was initiated by Rong Yu?","A mere college freshman managed to invite so many academicians to a gathering?","Yun Xiaoyuan handed the menu over. \"Xiao Yu, we saved three dishes for you to order. Take a look and see what you'd like to eat.\"","Rong Yu smiled and said, \"Anything is fine, whatever you like.\"","\"My daughter is about the same age as Rong Yu, let me order.\"","There were only two female academicians present; one was Yun Xiaoyuan, and the other was surnamed Zhai, Academician Zhai, who was in her fifties.","She took the menu and said to the waiter, \"One cola chicken wings, one sweet and sour pork ribs, and add a garlic mashed pork knuckle. Rong Yu, does that sound good to you?\"","Rong Yu nodded. \"Thank you for the trouble, Academician Zhai.\"","Song Huai's eyes widened in disbelief.","Academician Zhai was actually ordering food for a junior herself?","In front of these academicians, he was always so cautious and meticulous, playing the role of someone who poured tea and served water. He didn't even dare to interject, terrified of saying the wrong thing.","Yet Rong Yu was being pampered and doted on like this.","Why?","\"Come on, Xiao Yu, show everyone the processing speed of your super brain first,\" Yun Xiaoyuan said with a proud face. \"Let them see how amazing my student is.\"","Rong Yu: \"...\"","She knew this would happen.","But, since she was the one asking them for a favor, she might as well show off a bit.","Song Huai froze once again.","The student of Academician Yun that all the academicians were fighting over was Rong Yu?","Rong Yu was actually Academician Yun's student?","Listening to their conversation, Rong Yu had already taken Academician Yun as her teacher last year...","Yet she had remained completely silent about it, never showing off, keeping such an incredibly low profile.","Meanwhile, he couldn't wait to tell his roommates that he was Academician Liu's direct disciple right after taking his very first class.","By comparison, he looked like an absolute clown.","After finishing her super brain demonstration, Rong Yu immediately got to the point: \"I invited you all to dinner today because I've encountered a major problem, and I'm hoping to get some guidance from everyone.\"","Min Shenyan was highly intrigued. \"Tell us quickly.\"","Rong Yu spoke slowly: \"If, and I mean hypothetically if, there existed a phenomenon of luck transfer, meaning that an increase in one person's luck comes at the cost of a decrease in another person's luck, how might this be explained scientifically?\"","Yun Xiaoyuan asked curiously, \"Why would you ask such a thing?\"","\"I recently watched a movie,\" Rong Yu explained. \"The movie depicted this interesting phenomenon, but the plot linked it to metaphysics. Since we are all scientific researchers, I prefer to think about this matter from a scientific perspective.\"","Song Huai was in disbelief.","Just because she watched a movie, she invited so many academicians over to explain its plot? Wasn't this absurd?","Since when were academicians so easy to invite?","He thought everyone would fiercely reprimand Rong Yu for such behavior.","Instead, he saw all the academicians furrowing their brows, actually pondering this hypothesis with utmost seriousness.","Academician Zhai was the first to speak: \"From the perspective of quantum physics, if luck is a measurable form of energy, then its transfer must be accompanied by the collapse and reconstruction of quantum states. Theoretically, this energy transfer would produce detectable quantum fluctuations, especially when the giver and receiver are in close contact.\"","Academician Lin continued, \"According to the second law of thermodynamics, any energy transfer process results in an increase in the system's entropy. If this kind of luck transfer truly exists, the surrounding environment would definitely display anomalous thermodynamic signatures.\"","Min Shenyan said, \"If luck is indeed being transferred, we might be able to detect anomalous patterns in brainwaves or biomagnetic fields.\""]},{"number":316,"title":"Chapter 316: Whether it is prejudice, time will tell.","paragraphs":["The discussion grew increasingly heated.","Every academician proposed methods from their respective fields to detect and verify the possibility of luck transfer.","Rong Yu took notes earnestly, a clear experimental plan gradually forming in her mind.","\"Wait,\" Yun Xiaoyuan frowned, \"Xiao Yu, are you saying that in the movie, there's a person who always has explosive good luck, while at the same time, the people who come into contact with her suffer misfortune?\"","Rong Yu nodded. \"Moreover, the people whose luck she steals all have social ties to her. They are either blood relatives or adoring fans.\"","\"That sounds exactly like...\" Yun Xiaoyuan exchanged a glance with the others, \"A localized quantum tunneling effect superimposed with a process of entropy reduction.\"","Rong Yu sat up straight. \"Could you elaborate?\"","Yun Xiaoyuan said, \"If there really is this ability to transfer another person's luck, regardless of the nature of this ability, it must follow basic physical laws. Based on today's discussion, we could even design an experiment to detect and verify this phenomenon.\"","\"Start with quantum fluctuation monitoring,\" Academician Zhai pondered. \"If there is an energy transfer, the quantum entangled state will definitely leave a trace.\"","Liu Jinyue added, \"Simultaneously monitor microenvironmental temperature changes and entropy flow. This is an inevitable requirement of energy conservation.\"","Min Shenyan raised his hand. \"Wait a minute. Listening to you all, why does it sound like you're actually going to conduct an experiment?\"","\"Isn't this topic very interesting?\" Yun Xiaoyuan said with a smile. \"Since we have an idea, let's do it. Xiao Yu, the Beijing Quantum Research Center just received a new batch of German-made quantum state sensitive detectors. Their sensitivity is a thousand times that of conventional equipment. If you want to research this further, I can put in a word there and arrange a private laboratory for you.\"","Rong Yu immediately nodded. \"Thank you, Professor.\"","The dinner gradually drew to a close.","When Rong Yu went to pay, the waiter informed her that the bill had already been settled.","She was just about to thank Yun Xiaoyuan.","Min Shenyan hurriedly said, \"It was me, I paid the bill. Xiao Yu, the men of our Min family all have manners; we couldn't possibly let a woman pay. I am like this, and my son, Min Jianshen, is the same. By the way, have you two met up recently?\"","Rong Yu covered her face.","Why was he still dwelling on this?","She coughed and said softly, \"Um, Academician Min, I already have a boyfriend. I'm sorry.\"","\"What?\"","Min Shenyan was stunned.","She couldn't be his student, and she couldn't be his daughter-in-law either. Had his plans completely fallen through just like that?","\"No, I mean, Xiao Yu...\" He swallowed and said, \"You are at most nineteen this year. At such a young age, why are you talking about boyfriends? You should be studying hard...\"","\"Oh, shut up.\" Yun Xiaoyuan rolled her eyes inelegantly. \"Last year, you arranged a blind date for Xiao Yu when she was only eighteen. Do you think that was glorious?\"","Min Shenyan successfully shut up.","As the group walked outside, Academician Zhai saw a familiar car parked by the road and smiled. \"My daughter is here to pick me up. This child is facing graduation and is busy with her projects, yet she still made time to pick me up. I'll take my leave first.\"","The other academicians expressed their envy of her having such a caring daughter.","Just as Academician Zhai walked over, the car door opened. Besides her daughter, Zhai Weitong, a young man also stepped out of the car, respectfully opening the door for her.","\"Mom, let me introduce you,\" Zhai Weitong said. \"This is Duan Fei, a freshman in the Tianxingjian class this year. He is currently assisting me with my project.\"","Duan Fei stepped forward. \"Hello, Academician Zhai. My name is Duan Fei.\"","Academician Zhai looked him up and down, her gaze carrying a hint of scrutiny.","Zhai Weitong took a step forward, standing shoulder to shoulder with Duan Fei. \"Mom, aren't you planning to take on another student? I think Duan Fei is very good. He participated in many major projects during high school and published heavyweight papers. He is currently the class monitor of the Tianxingjian class and is the top student in his class.\"","\"I understand,\" Academician Zhai said with a faint expression. \"I will consider it and give a reply later.\"","She got straight into the car.","Zhai Weitong whispered to Duan Fei, \"My mom just looks cold on the outside but is warm on the inside. Don't worry, this will definitely work out.\"","She followed and got into the car.","The car started moving, and only when Duan Fei's figure could no longer be seen did Zhai Weitong withdraw her gaze.","Academician Zhai said indifferently, \"That male student is not suitable.\"","Zhai Weitong frowned. \"Mom, you haven't even looked at Duan Fei's file. How do you know he's not suitable? Didn't you teach me not to judge and reject someone based on their appearance?\"","\"Your relationship with him goes beyond that of mere classmates, doesn't it?\" Seeing her daughter blush, Academician Zhai knew she had guessed right. She sighed, \"That boy has too many hidden motives. He is neither suitable to be your boyfriend nor to be my student.\"","Zhai Weitong bit her lip. \"Mom, this is prejudice. Just because my relationship with him is out of the ordinary, you've developed a severe bias against him!\"","\"Whether it is prejudice or not, time will tell.\" Academician Zhai shook her head. \"I won't stop you from dating. After all, you are grown up and should learn how to see men for who they really are.\"","The car sped away.","Duan Fei waited anxiously for news. Half an hour later, Zhai Weitong sent a WeChat message.","\"My mom has a major project to participate in next, so she doesn't have time to take on students for now. But it's okay, I can recommend you to another academician.\"","Duan Fei's face immediately turned a bit ugly.","He had made ample preparations for tonight's meeting, yet unexpectedly, he was still rejected.","When he was in high school, many professors competed to take him as a student, but he rejected them all. He wanted to be the student of an academician, not a mere professor.","However, upon entering university, he realized that becoming an academician's student was incredibly difficult.","Because academicians rarely appeared on campus, it was hard to even meet them once...","As he was pondering, his phone vibrated. He glanced at it and saw it was Zhou Shiyu. A faint look of disgust immediately appeared on his face, and he hung up directly.","Just after he hung up, the phone rang again.","He answered with a look of impatience. \"I'm very busy right now. What exactly do you want?\"","\"I...\" Zhou Shiyu choked up. It took her a long while to find her voice. \"I'm at the gate of Huaqing University. I bought a gift for you. Hurry up and come out to get it.\"","Duan Fei originally wanted to say he didn't need it.","But when his gaze fell upon his expensive wristwatch, he pursed his lips and said, \"Wait for me for twenty minutes.\"","Rong Yu was driven back to school by her professor.","As soon as she got out of the car and walked to the school gate, she saw Zhou Shiyu.","Zhou Shiyu, dressed in a fiery red miniskirt, was leaning against a brand-new sports car, toying with a bunch of keys in her hand.","Rong Yu walked over. \"What are you doing here?\"","Zhou Shiyu smiled shyly. \"Waiting for my boyfriend. Miss Rong, quickly help me take a look. What do you think of this car? Will a guy like it?\""]},{"number":317,"title":"Chapter 317: You Can Fool Yourself Like This","paragraphs":["Rong Yu looked at the car.","There was Lao Wu in her family, who loved studying all kinds of cars. Aye had mentioned the car in front of her; it was an electric vehicle worth over a million.","To a wealthy and powerful family, a million was naturally nothing.","But, as a gift for a boyfriend?","Then that million could be considered a massive expense.","Rong Yu asked her, \"What kind of relationship are you in that actually has you gifting a car?\"","\"I offered to give it to him,\" Zhou Shiyu quickly explained. \"He hasn't been in a good mood lately due to heavy academic pressure, so I bought a car to cheer him up.\"","\"Tsk, your little boy toy doesn't seem that great,\" Rong Yu shrugged. \"Take your time waiting, I'm heading in first.\"","Feeling somewhat despised, Zhou Shiyu hurriedly tried to save face, \"Miss Rong, don't go yet. My boyfriend is incredibly handsome. Let me show you a picture, and you'll understand why I bought a gift to coax him. His smile is especially healing...\"","She took out her phone, pulled up a photo, and handed it over.","Rong Yu: \"?\"","She saw Duan Fei on Zhou Shiyu's phone?","Duan Fei was Zhou Shiyu's boyfriend?","Incredible!","Truly incredible.","\"I won't make a subjective judgment on whether his smile is healing or not,\" Rong Yu said. \"Let me show you something.\"","She never looked at the campus forum.","But she couldn't help it when she had a chatterbox for a roommate. Whenever the girl, Yu Kexin, saw something on the forum, she would blabber about it and share it.","She quickly scrolled through the posts and finally found it.","Post title: Campus Legend: A two-way romance between the top senior girl and the standout of the Tianxingjian Class, composing the most beautiful equation.","Below it were a dozen pictures posted in a row.","Hugging.","Holding hands.","Gazing affectionately at each other.","\"How is this possible?\" Zhou Shiyu was completely stunned. \"Is it a camera angle issue? A misunderstanding?\"","Rong Yu twitched her lips. \"You can keep deceiving yourself like that.\"","She patted Zhou Shiyu on the shoulder. \"It won't be too late to gift the car after you investigate and clear things up, right?\"","Zhou Shiyu said in a muffled voice, \"I know.\"","Rong Yu had other matters to attend to, so she entered the school first.","A short while later, Duan Fei walked over. At a glance, he saw the car parked by the road. He had seen this car on the news a long time ago and had even deliberately mentioned it in front of Zhou Shiyu last month.","He didn't expect that she actually bought it.","Over a million, bought just like that.","He quickly suppressed the eagerness in his eyes and said with a plain expression, \"I've been really busy lately. What do you need me for?\"","Zhou Shiyu suppressed her emotions. \"I just picked up a rock. It's really pretty, so I wanted to give it to you.\"","Looking at the dusty gray rock handed to him, Duan Fei's face darkened.","Wasn't she giving him a car?","What the hell was up with the rock?","Moreover, the rock was way too dirty. Why did it feel like it was picked up from the ground just seconds ago and hadn't even been washed clean?","He wanted to ask about the car.","But that wouldn't fit his persona.","After all, in the few months they had been together, he never had to ask for anything; Zhou Shiyu always took the initiative to present things to him.","He looked Zhou Shiyu up and down. \"Your makeup looks beautiful today.\"","In the past, as long as he sweet-talked her, Zhou Shiyu's brain would turn to mush, and she would give him whatever he wanted.","Zhou Shiyu lowered her eyes. \"By the way, you're in the Tianxingjian Class, right? I have a friend who is also in the Tianxingjian Class. Her name is Rong Yu.\"","\"This friend of yours is really not that great.\" Duan Fei's expression changed, and he clenched his fists. \"She aims too high and is eager to show off. She has a pretty bad reputation in class. If she said anything to you, you absolutely must not believe her.\"","Zhou Shiyu looked at him in disbelief.","She had originally harbored a tiny bit of doubt about the truth of the matter.","But now, it was confirmed.","What kind of good person would talk bad about Miss Rong behind her back?","Her face instantly turned cold. \"It's getting late. I'm leaving!\"","She had to go back and figure out what exactly was going on.","The car door slammed shut, and the vehicle instantly disappeared down the street.","Duan Fei looked astonished.","In all their previous dates, Zhou Shiyu would cling to him endlessly. Today, they had barely just met, and she left?","At this moment, he received a message on his phone from Zhai Weitong: \"Duan Fei, I've arranged for Academician Tian to listen to our project. Prepare well tonight. Tomorrow morning, you will present to Academician Tian. If you perform well, Academician Tian will take you on as a student.\"","Duan Fei was extremely thrilled.","He returned to his dorm and stayed up all night.","The next morning, he met up with Zhai Weitong, full of energy.","Zhai Weitong reminded him, \"Academician Tian is very busy. This opportunity is incredibly rare. Just perform normally and don't drop the ball... Wait, why is your face so pale? Did something happen?\"","She noticed Duan Fei staring blankly.","She quickly followed his gaze and saw a girl standing under a large tree not far away.","She frowned. \"What's wrong?\"","Duan Fei's soul was nearly scared out of his body.","He took a deep breath. \"She's a high school classmate of mine. She probably needs me for something. You go into the classroom first; I'll go chat with her. Just give me three minutes.\"","Zhai Weitong didn't suspect anything and turned to go inside.","Duan Fei dashed over, his face livid. \"How many times have I told you not to come into Huaqing? This is the number one university in the country. Not just anyone can wander in here. Can you stop causing trouble for me!\"","Zhou Shiyu tilted her head and looked at him. \"Why do I feel like you're afraid of something?\"","Duan Fei's lips stiffened. \"Today is extremely important to me. You leave first. I'll contact you after I'm done.\"","\"How can I not participate in my boyfriend's important moment?\" Zhou Shiyu hugged his arm. \"I'll just watch and then leave.\"","Duan Fei shook her off. \"Stop joking around. Can a graduate from a third-rate university like you even understand it?\"","Zhou Shiyu clenched her fingers slightly.","Actually, Duan Fei had always looked down on her, disdaining her for being superficial, having a low educational background, and only knowing how to spend money...","How could she have only realized it now?","The two were confronting each other.","Someone walking by recognized her. \"Hey, isn't that the really popular internet streamer? Why is she at our school...\"","Afraid of causing a scene, Duan Fei said with a gloomy face, \"Later, you sit in the very back row and listen quietly. You are not allowed to make a single sound, do you hear me!\"","Zhou Shiyu nodded.","The two walked in one after the other.","This was a project presentation room. There were seven or eight groups present, with two to four people per project. One representative was arranged to speak on stage, while four or five teachers below would ask questions and give critiques.","Soon it was Zhai Weitong's turn.","She had her assistant, Duan Fei, go on stage to give the presentation.","\"Hello everyone, I am a freshman from the Tianxingjian Class. My name is Duan Fei. I am very honored to have participated in Senior Zhai's project...\" Duan Fei stood on stage, looking radiant and confident. \"From these perspectives, I will first introduce the specific direction of the project to the teachers, as well as what work we have done over this period of time...\"","Zhai Weitong sat in the audience, looking at Duan Fei with a face full of admiration.","After entering college, she had always focused on her studies and had never been in a relationship. First, she didn't want to; second, she looked too ordinary, so no boys pursued her.","And with her personality, she couldn't bring herself to pursue anyone else either.","Duan Fei appeared at the perfect time and pursued her relentlessly. With graduation drawing near, she happened to be yearning for a passionate romance, so she said yes.","She had not chosen the wrong man.","Because she saw the look of approval in Academician Tian's eyes."]},{"number":318,"title":"Chapter 318: What exactly is your relationship with Zhou Shiyu","paragraphs":["Duan Fei stood at the podium, his posture calm and confident. His speech was well-organized, with a tightly knit logic that maintained academic rigor while carrying a captivating rhythm.","Academician Tian nodded frequently.","Zhai Weitong and Duan Fei exchanged a smile.","This smile felt like a knife plunging into Zhou Shiyu's chest.","She had been with Duan Fei for nearly half a year, and she had never seen such a genuine, radiant smile on his face.","Half a year ago, she went on a business trip and arranged to dine with a client at a restaurant. When the client was late, she looked around out of boredom and saw Duan Fei working there as a waiter.","He accidentally broke a plate and was demanded to pay for it by the manager.","She still remembered him crying and begging the manager: \"I'm a high school student, I don't have money. My father is still waiting for me to raise his surgery fees. Please, manager, let me off this time. When I have money later...\"","Of course, the manager didn't let him off, pointing at his nose and swearing at him.","Having nothing better to do, she helped Duan Fei out. She saw him smile, a very beautiful smile.","She wondered now if that smile from their first meeting was actually sincere.","She even paid for his father's medical expenses.","She took the initiative to give him ten thousand a month, telling him to focus on his college entrance exams and not worry about money.","He said he wanted to repay her.","And so, they ended up in bed together and became boyfriend and girlfriend.","When he got into Huaqing University, she was genuinely happy for him. But less than a month after starting college, he openly got another girlfriend.","No wonder he forbade her from stepping foot in Huaqing.","\"Very good, you are quite an excellent student,\" Academician Tian said with a look of appreciation. \"Duan Fei from the Tianxingjian Class, right?\"","Duan Fei's hands trembled slightly with excitement.","This was an academician, a leading figure in domestic physical mechanics who hadn't taken a student in three or four years. If he could become Academician Tian's student, he couldn't even imagine how bright his future would be...","Academician Tian spoke, just as he had hoped: \"I'm short of a student assistant over here. What do you think...\"","Before the sentence could even finish.","A harsh sound of a chair dragging suddenly rang out.","Duan Fei sharply looked up at the back row, only to see Zhou Shiyu standing up.","Dressed like someone from outside the university, her makeup was exceptionally exquisite, and her large wavy hair cascaded over her shoulders. In this academic classroom, she stood out completely.","Zhou Shiyu walked toward the front row.","Duan Fei's eyes held a heavy warning.","Zhai Weitong stepped forward quickly, blocking Zhou Shiyu, and whispered, \"Whatever it is, talk to Duan Fei later.\"","\"Do you even know what kind of person he is? You're defending him and paving the way for him just like that?\" Zhou Shiyu looked toward the podium and raised her voice. \"Does Academician Tian just accept any student?\"","Academician Tian frowned. \"You aren't a student of this university, are you? May I ask what your business is?\"","\"Him!\" Zhou Shiyu pointed at Duan Fei, emphasizing every word. \"His morals are corrupt, and his private life is a mess. Does a person like him deserve to be the student of a dignified academician?\"","Duan Fei's expression changed drastically.","His previously calm demeanor instantly sank. He slammed his hand on the desk, took a deep breath, and said, \"Zhou Shiyu! You're making baseless accusations!\"","His voice rose in anger, almost cracking. \"Where is the security? Throw this rumor-mongering outsider out!\"","No matter what.","He had to secure Academician Tian as his mentor first.","As for Zhou Shiyu, he had plenty of ways to coax her. Wasn't it just selling smiles and flesh?","The classroom broke into an uproar.","Some frowned and whispered, some looked suspicious, and even more looked back and forth between Duan Fei and Zhou Shiyu in shock. The scene descended into chaos.","Zhou Shiyu's heart twisted in pain, but her face slowly calmed down. She let out a cold laugh. \"Throw me out? What's wrong, Duan Fei, guilty conscience?\"","She directly pulled a stack of photos from her bag and slammed them onto the table. \"Duan Fei, do you dare say these photos are fake? Do you dare say you weren't dating me and Zhai Weitong at the same time?\"","The photos scattered, and everyone looked over. They were intimate photos of Duan Fei with Zhou Shiyu and Zhai Weitong respectively.","Zhai Weitong, who had been standing to the side, turned deathly pale. She picked up a photo in disbelief, her fingers trembling slightly. \"Duan Fei... what is this?\"","Duan Fei's expression nearly shattered.","He absolutely couldn't believe that Zhou Shiyu, who normally loved him as much as her own life, would go to such extremes.","This bitch was trying to ruin him.","He forced a scoff, trying hard to pretend he didn't care. \"Who doesn't know how to Photoshop? Zhou Shiyu, aren't you just an influencer who lives off internet traffic? Using such despicable tricks just to get famous?\"","He turned to the surrounding teachers and students, looking righteous. \"Can the words of an influencer be trusted? Isn't she just trying to chase clout?\"","His words were highly inflammatory, and immediately several students showed looks of disdain and began whispering.","\"Influencers these days will do anything for attention...\"","\"Exactly, daring to cause a scene in an academic setting. They have no bottom line.\"","\"She isn't secretly live streaming right now, is she...\"","Zhou Shiyu's eyes instantly turned red. She clenched her fists, her voice choking with emotion. \"Duan Fei, I really never thought you were this kind of person. Daring to do it but not daring to admit it, deceiving the feelings of two girls. You will face retribution!\"","Duan Fei sneered, glaring down at her condescendingly. \"Deceive you? Are you even worthy? An influencer who relies on her looks to eat, what do you have that's worth my deceiving?\"","He turned to Zhai Weitong, his tone gentle. \"Senior, don't be fooled by her. She just wants to ruin my reputation.\"","Zhai Weitong bit her lip, remaining silent.","The surrounding students had already found Zhou Shiyu's social media account.","\"Wow, she's that female influencer who gains followers by spreading wealthy family gossip. She'll do anything for traffic.\"","\"Don't trust an influencer's words, just throw her out.\"","\"How can Huaqing University be tainted by an influencer? Truly no bottom line...\"","Zhou Shiyu's lips tightened.","She was telling the truth, so why wouldn't these people believe her?","Why was she, the victim, being pointed at, while the instigator was about to take an academician as his mentor and have a smooth future from then on?","\"May I say a few words?\"","A clear voice suddenly rang out.","Zhou Shiyu looked up and saw a girl standing at the classroom door. She wore simple clothes, yet her whole body radiated a powerful aura.","\"Woo, Miss Rong.\"","With a cry, Zhou Shiyu threw herself over. The tears she had held back for so long flowed down like an open faucet.","\"Academician Tian, Professor Zhou, Professor Li...\" Rong Yu patted Zhou Shiyu before stepping inside. She first greeted the teachers, then looked at Duan Fei. \"I will only ask you once. What exactly is your relationship with Zhou Shiyu?\"","The aura she released made Duan Fei feel inexplicably afraid, and he couldn't help but take a step back.","He knew he absolutely couldn't admit it.","Otherwise, his life would be over.","He gritted his teeth and said, \"Zhou Shiyu and I are, at most, opposite-sex friends who are somewhat close.\"","\"Alright.\" Rong Yu pulled a long list from her backpack. \"Since you are just ordinary friends, then pay back the money. Over the past half year, Zhou Shiyu paid for your father's medical bills, lent you ten thousand a month for living expenses, bought you watches, electronics, and luxury goods... The total comes to 4.026 million. Let's round it down to 4 million. Pay your debt right now.\""]},{"number":319,"title":"Chapter 319: Your boyfriend fell into a cesspool, and you still want him","paragraphs":["The scene suddenly froze.","Even Zhou Shiyu was stunned.","Where did Rong Yu get these lists?","\"It was me.\" Tang Mi also appeared at the door and sighed. \"Last night you told me Duan Fei was cheating and you wanted to break up with him. I was afraid you'd be taken advantage of, so I made this list. I was going to send it to you, but I worried you'd let your feelings get the better of you and let him off easy, so I had to ask Miss Rong to step in.\"","Duan Fei's face instantly turned deathly pale.","He stared fixedly at the long list, his lips trembling, and it took him a long time to squeeze out a sentence: \"This list is forged!\"","He took a deep breath and glared at Rong Yu. \"Just because I took the senior's project from you, you teamed up with an internet celebrity to slander me? With such a petty mindset, do you even deserve to be in Huaqing University's Tianxingjian Class?\"","\"Smack!\" Academician Tian, whose face had been livid, slammed the table and stood up. \"Rong Yu can have any project she wants. Why would she slander you over such a trivial project? This is absolute nonsense!\"","He had an excellent relationship with Yun Xiaoyuan and was also involved in the Hawkeye project.","Rong Yu was the chief designer of this project. Even academicians like them had to follow her arrangements.","Would such an outstanding child stoop to slandering someone over such a tiny, insignificant matter?","\"Here,\" Academician Tian slowly looked at Duan Fei, \"I do not tolerate people with misconduct. Please find yourself another mentor.\"","Duan Fei was struck as if by lightning. He staggered forward a couple of steps. \"Academician Tian, I'm truly being framed. I didn't do it, I really didn't...\"","Academician Tian walked to the classroom door, gently patted Rong Yu's shoulder, and smiled warmly, \"Next time there's a dinner gathering, don't forget to invite me.\"","As soon as the academician left, the discussions in the classroom grew louder.","\"Two-timing like that, how did a guy like him even get into Huaqing?\"","\"Academic ability and moral character are two completely different things, okay? The college entrance exam only filters out poor students, not scumbags. Having a rich girlfriend on one side and deceiving a senior with academic resources on the other, leeching off women like a parasite... That's so disgusting.\"","\"And he's supposed to be in the Tianxingjian Class? I heard he's even the class monitor.\"","\"Tsk tsk.\"","Various voices rang in his ears, making Duan Fei's face turn completely white.","He grabbed Zhai Weitong's arm. \"Tongtong, it's not what they say. I didn't... I didn't lie to you. You have to believe me.\"","Zhai Weitong pushed him away and took a step back, her voice strained. \"It's not that I don't believe you, but I believe Rong Yu more.\"","Her mother, Academician Zhai, had also attended the dinner last night. At home, she had highly praised Rong Yu's talent, wishing she could take her on as a student.","A student her mother favored would never have any issues, whether in talent or character.","Since Rong Yu chose to stand with the internet celebrity, it meant the internet celebrity wasn't just slinging mud.","\"Duan Fei, we are done.\" Zhai Weitong raised her chin. \"I'm removing you from the research group. You're on your own now.\"","She walked up to Rong Yu, her voice lowering a bit. \"Junior Rong, I'm sorry. I let my emotions cloud my judgment before and chose the wrong person. I don't have the face to invite you to join my project anymore. If you ever need help with anything at school in the future, you can come straight to me.\"","She turned and walked away.","Duan Fei couldn't stand steadily anymore, tottering and nearly fainting.","Like grasping at a final straw, he looked at Zhou Shiyu. \"Xiaoyu, we...\"","\"Ignore him, let's go!\" Tang Mi, afraid her best friend would be bewitched again, pulled Zhou Shiyu toward the door. But Zhou Shiyu didn't move. Tang Mi looked at her in disbelief. \"No way, Zhou Shiyu, are you crazy? Your boyfriend fell into a cesspool, and you still want to wash him off and keep him?\"","Zhou Shiyu took a step forward.","Under Duan Fei's hopeful gaze, she raised her hand and slapped him hard across the face. \"This is the price for playing with my feelings. I'll give you one month. If you don't pay back the four million, I'll sue you in court!\"","She turned around and marched out.","Rong Yu gave Duan Fei a glance and walked out as well.","Once outside, in a secluded spot, Zhou Shiyu hugged Tang Mi and broke down crying. \"I was so good to him. I gave him whatever he wanted. Why did he betray me? Why did he treat me like this? What did I do wrong? Boohoo...\"","\"He's just a pretty boy living off women, is he worth crying over like this?\" Tang Mi was speechless. \"I'll call Si Lin and have him set up a party. We'll go to a club and order a couple of male models for you. Hey, Miss Rong, do you want to come hang out with us?\"","Rong Yu: \"No thanks, I have things to do.\"","After the morning classes ended, she had to go to the Quantum Research Center for some serious study.","She also called Ji Mohan to be her assistant.","The Beijing Quantum Research Center was located on the Fourth Ring Road, not far from the university. Armed with a joint recommendation letter from seven or eight academicians, Rong Yu received a warm reception. She was assigned a very spacious laboratory and granted the highest clearance to use all the equipment.","\"My god, so many precision instruments!\"","Walking into the equipment room, Ji Mohan was completely stunned.","He was currently only a mid-level researcher. With insufficient clearance at the materials institute, he simply couldn't access these top-tier devices worth tens or even hundreds of millions.","\"Fourth-generation helium spin quantum interferometer.\"","\"Neuromorphic quantum entropy change monitoring tower.\"","\"Biological quantum tunneling imaging machine...\"","Every single piece of equipment was a cutting-edge product from the past two years, opening Ji Mohan's eyes to a whole new world.","Over the next four or five days, Rong Yu and Ji Mohan threw themselves wholeheartedly into the laboratory.","The whiteboards in the lab were covered with complex equations, and several quantum devices emitted a rhythmic humming sound.","Rong Yu stared at the continuously jumping data on the screen, her brows furrowed tightly.","After twenty-four hours of continuous experimentation, all the results pointed to the same conclusion: traditional quantum measurement theory simply could not explain the phenomenon of luck transference.","\"Failed again.\" Ji Mohan pinched the bridge of his nose wearily. \"Great-grandma, isn't this hypothesis a bit too far ahead of its time?\"","Rong Yu shook her head. \"Perhaps this isn't the traditional quantum tunneling effect at all. I need to change my approach.\"","Ji Mohan went out to buy coffee, placed it on the table, and helped Rong Yu organize the various data.","Suddenly, he paused. \"Great-grandma, look at this...\"","Rong Yu drank more than half of her coffee and looked over with furrowed brows. Instantly, her eyes lit up. \"The fluctuation here exactly matches the vibrational energy level of chiral molecules. So this isn't quantum transmission, but topological quantum field resonance... The so-called luck quantum is very likely some kind of chiral boson condensate. We need to break both P-symmetry and T-symmetry simultaneously to observe it...\"","Ji Mohan's spirits lifted. \"In other words, Yaoyao itself might be a topological defect generator. If this hypothesis holds, what we need isn't a filter, but...\"","Rong Yu finished his sentence: \"A quantum state holographic monitoring network. Using a diamond NV center array as the sensor substrate, combined with metasurface surface plasmon polaritons, as long as it covers the 0.1-100 THz frequency band, it can capture any form of quantum correlation distortion...\"","The two became instantly excited.","For several consecutive days and nights, they took short naps when tired and continued their experiments as soon as they woke up. Finally...","Looking at the silver bracelet before him, Rong Yu let out a heavy sigh of relief.","Although he had not discovered anything concrete just yet, the arduous first step was finally over. As long as he could absorb even the tiniest trace of the original quantum form of good luck from Yaoyao, the experiment could proceed."]},{"number":320,"title":"Chapter 320: YiYi will surely win, our Huaxia esports is invincible","paragraphs":["The Global Esports Finals were held in the capital.","Even before the event began, the area outside the sports plaza was packed with young crowds of esports enthusiasts.","A low-key yet luxurious car pulled up across from the plaza, and Ji Jingchuan and Ji Zhouye stepped out together.","In the past, Ji Zhouye loved such occasions. However, over the last few days, he had been constantly recalling every detail of his interactions with Yaoyao. The more he thought about it, the more terrified he became. Now, he only wanted to escape from this competition venue.","He scratched his head. \"Fourth Brother, why would Great-Grandma suddenly ask me to come watch Yaoyao's esports match?\"","Ji Jingchuan said calmly, \"Someone has to contact Yaoyao. You ask her to come out.\"","Holding his recovered phone, Ji Zhouye opened his chat with Yaoyao: \"My fourth brother and I are at the entrance. Where are you? Can we meet before you go on stage?\"","Yaoyao: \"Turn left into the lounge. I'll wait for you here.\"","Ji Zhouye: \"Okay.\"","He put away his phone, his expression solemn. \"Fourth Brother, maybe you shouldn't meet Yaoyao. If you want to get any information from her, let me go. I've been blocked by her before, so I probably have no use value to her anymore. I won't be in danger...\"","\"It's exactly because you have no use value anymore that I must go.\" Ji Jingchuan pulled down his sleeve, hiding the silver bracelet on his wrist. \"Great-Grandma has prepared thoroughly. Don't worry, nothing will happen.\"","Ji Zhouye led the way toward the lounge.","The two made their way through the crowd. Gradually, the number of people dwindled. When they pushed open the door to the lounge, they saw Yaoyao sitting there in her signature black leather jacket.","The moment he saw her, Ji Zhouye took a fearful step back.","But remembering that they still had business to attend to, he adjusted his mindset and put on a fanatic expression, saying, \"Yaoyao, you're the first female captain in Asia to make it to the Global Finals. Whether our country's esports can dominate the world depends entirely on you!\"","Yaoyao did not even spare Ji Zhouye a glance.","Her gaze fell entirely on Ji Jingchuan, and her crimson lips slowly curved into a smile.","She stood up and walked toward Ji Jingchuan step by step.","A burning sensation emanated from Ji Jingchuan's wrist.","\"I'm so happy you could come to watch my match,\" Yaoyao said, opening her arms. \"Can I get a hug?\"","Alarm bells rang wildly in Ji Zhouye's head.","Last time, he had merely been hugged by Yaoyao, which caused the ceiling of his company to collapse, smashing his head and landing him in the hospital for four days.","Ji Jingchuan's expression remained indifferent. \"I don't really like hugging women. A handshake is the furthest I can accept.\"","Yaoyao let out a soft chuckle.","She extended her slender, fair fingers, her fingertips tilting slightly upward.","Slowly, Ji Jingchuan grasped her fingertips.","The moment they touched, the quantum well inside the bracelet suddenly activated. His wrist grew so hot it was almost unbearable.","Yaoyao's pupils suddenly contracted.","She could clearly feel as though she had crashed into an invisible wall.","At the same time, a powerful suction force from within the wall pulled at her in reverse. The energy within her body poured out like a ruptured dam, completely out of her control.","\"Ugh!\"","A muffled groan escaped her throat. Her chest felt as if it had suffered a heavy blow, and the metallic taste of blood rushed straight up to her throat.","Having obtained the original-form quantum energy, Ji Jingchuan abruptly let go of her. \"Is Miss Yaoyao feeling unwell? Do you need a doctor?\"","\"N-no need.\"","Yaoyao wiped the blood seeping from the corner of her lips.","Could it be that she was too eager for quick success and had demanded too much energy at once, causing a backlash?","Her eyes darkened. Suddenly, her heel twisted, and she fell toward Ji Jingchuan's embrace.","Ji Jingchuan coldly dodged her. \"If there's nothing else, we'll be leaving now. Wishing you victory from the start.\"","\"Wait!\" Yaoyao tried to grab him.","But she was stopped by Ji Zhouye. \"The match starts in two minutes. Yaoyao, you should hurry up and get ready. Don't delay the match; your fans are all looking forward to it.\"","The two men quickly left the lounge.","Yaoyao had no chance to chase after them because her assistant had already arrived, calling her to head to the competition room.","This was a globally broadcasted esports match. As soon as the match began, the number of viewers in the live stream broke a million, with bullet comments flying across the screen.","\"Yaoyao, we love you!\"","\"With Yaoyao holding the fort, we are invincible!\"","\"Yaoyao will definitely win! Our country's esports is unmatched!\"","\"...\"","Yaoyao's earlier panic was completely smoothed over by the waves of cheers from her fans. She calmly sat down in her gaming chair.","The match officially began.","Yaoyao controlled her character with nimble movements, but during the first crucial team fight, her fingers suddenly stiffened. The character on the screen deviated from what she had envisioned in her mind. Her fingers could not keep up with her thoughts... This was a nightmare she frequently experienced three years ago when she first entered the esports industry.","\"First Blood!\"","The announcer's cold notification rang out. The character Yaoyao controlled crashed to the ground, and her screen turned gray.","The entire audience went into an uproar.","\"What's going on? Is Yaoyao sleepwalking?\"","\"This gameplay is so bad it makes my scalp tingle. How is her finger dexterity this poor?\"","\"It shouldn't be like this, how could this happen? Goddess Yaoyao, pull yourself together!\"","In the following parts of the match, Yaoyao made mistake after mistake.","She walked into walls, cast skills in the wrong direction, and even recalled to base right in the middle of a fight for the boss monster!","Her teammates' faces grew increasingly ugly.","During the final team fight, Yaoyao was supposed to flank and clean up, but as if possessed, she charged straight into a five-man enemy encirclement and died instantly.","\"Defeat!\"","The moment the crystal exploded, a teammate's furious roar came through Yaoyao's headset:","\"Yaoyao, are you possessed?!\"","\"Were you bought out by the other team? You messed up on purpose, didn't you!\"","\"You've completely humiliated all of our country's esports players!\"","Yaoyao sat blankly in her chair, her ears buzzing.","The camera focused on her pale face, and the live stream's bullet comments completely exploded.","\"That's it? The country's number one female captain? Was it all just luck?\"","\"Hilarious. The harder she was hyped up before, the harder she falls now.\"","\"I suggest she retires. Stop making a fool of yourself.\"","\"Investigate her, we must investigate this thoroughly...\"","Her fans all turned against her. The name Yaoyao was sent to the top of the trending topics, and the comment sections became a bloodbath.","When Yaoyao left the esports arena, she was cornered in the underground parking lot. Her car windows were smashed, and she was almost dragged out...","Ji Jingchuan drove, taking the still-burning silver bracelet to the Quantum Research Center.","Even though he was not a researcher, he could feel the violently fluctuating quantum elements inside it, let alone Rong Yu.","Rong Yu's eyes lit up. He took out the silver bracelet and placed it into the equipment.","Something interesting happened..."]},{"number":321,"title":"Chapter 321: The Original Life Trajectory of the Ji Family","paragraphs":["It was exactly the National Day holiday.","For six whole days, Rong Yu and Ji Mohan were holed up in the lab, finally coming up with a result.","She leaned back on the sofa, took a sip of coffee, and pulled out her phone to search for Yaoyao’s name.","A week ago, at the international e-sports competition, Yaoyao’s frequent mistakes had led to a crushing defeat, turning Chinese e-sports into a global laughingstock. As a result, Yaoyao was fired by her e-sports company and hit with a massive compensation claim.","Yaoyao became the target of public outrage, branded as the disgrace of the e-sports industry.","But even so, she still had a few die-hard fans. These fans banded together, hanging banners outside Yaoyao’s residence, calling for her return to the e-sports arena.","Yaoyao kept a low profile and met with about forty of these devoted fans privately.","Then disaster struck quickly.","One fan suffered an asthma attack on the spot and was hanging by a thread.","Three other fans, while taking the elevator, had an accident when the lift malfunctioned and plummeted from the sixth floor to the first, leaving all three with varying degrees of injury.","Another four fans were attacked by large dogs in the neighborhood as they left...","In short, accidents kept happening one after another.","“How terrifying—this woman is absolutely terrifying,” Ji Mohan said, shuddering at the thought. “Those fans probably never dreamed that they got hurt because their luck was drained by their idol, Yaoyao... If we don’t stop her, who knows how many more victims there will be.”","Rong Yu stood up. “Get a few people to move the experimental results from these past few days back to the Ji mansion.”","She dialed a number. “Aye, arrange for Yaoyao to come to the Ji residence.”","Yaoyao received a WeChat message from Ji Zhouye and trembled all over.","In the span of a single night, she had fallen from grace—from an e-sports goddess to the shame of the industry. How dazzling she had once been at the peak, and how wretched she had become after crashing to the bottom.","She had met privately with many fans.","But those fans had far too little luck on them to change anything substantial.","She desperately needed an overwhelming wave of luck to help her claw her way back to the top.","Yaoyao pulled herself together, put on a flawless makeup look, changed into a long dress, slipped on high heels, and drove to the Ji family’s grand villa.","As her car entered the villa district, surrounded by one ultra-luxurious mansion after another, she was stunned.","The Ji family—were actually living in the capital’s wealthiest neighborhood?","This place was home to nothing less than top-tier billionaires!","She had known Ji Zhouye and his group were rich, but she hadn’t expected they were wealthy to this degree.","Just as her car pulled up to the villa entrance, Steward Yu came out to greet her. “Miss Yaoyao, I presume? Hello, I’m the steward of the Ji residence. Please, follow me.”","Yaoyao glanced at the steward.","She paused again, startled.","How could a mere steward have such an abundant amount of luck on him?","She probed deeper.","This steward’s original life path had been to die on the way to the hospital while driving his employer, both killed instantly in a car crash.","But somehow, fate had twisted around—he ended up living to ninety-one, surrounded by children and grandchildren, passing away peacefully.","Yaoyao lowered her eyes.","This steward could be added to her list of candidates.","“Miss Yaoyao has arrived.”","Steward Yu led her through the entrance.","As soon as she stepped inside, Yaoyao froze. The living room was packed with people.","Rong Yu felt a headache coming on.","Originally, she hadn’t planned for the whole family to be here.","But somehow, Yingbao found out about it, and then the entire family knew. Except for Duoduo, everyone had shown up in full force.","Ji Zhiyuan stepped forward first. “I’m the president of the Ji Corporation, Aye’s eldest brother. A pleasure to meet you.”","He was the Ji family eldest grandson, the eldest brother, the pillar of the clan, and he intended to stand before all his family and shield them from this unknown storm. He hoped to draw all of Yaoyao’s attention to himself.","And Yaoyao’s attention was indeed captured.","She widened her eyes in disbelief.","This eldest Ji brother—his original life had been tragically bleak. His first wife had died from a difficult childbirth. Later, he married the youthful love of his life, one he had harbored feelings for since they were young. But before three months had passed, his beloved daughter was lost, and one night, as he drowned his sorrows at a bar, he was kidnapped by unknown assailants. By the time the police found him, what they recovered was only a corpse—with his kidneys missing.","But now—his entire life had been rewritten...","“Elder Ji Brother, it’s nice to meet you.”","Yaoyao extended her hand to shake his.","From the side, Ji Yanting strode over quickly, pushing Ji Zhiyuan aside. “Miss Yaoyao, I’m Aye’s second brother. I love games too—so happy to meet you.”","Yaoyao stared at him, dazed.","The acclaimed actor Yan Ting—was actually Ji Zhouye’s second brother... and his luck was also immense.","His original life, too, had ended in violent death... He had married his agent, but less than two weeks after the wedding, the ex-husband had shown up and stabbed him to death. The darling actor had thus bowed out on that shockingly absurd note.","“Second Ji Brother, it’s a pleasure to meet you.”","Before Yaoyao could say more, Ji Mohan could no longer hold back and hurried over.","Over the past half month, as he helped Granny Rong research that intangible thing called luck, he had become intensely curious about Yaoyao.","If he could witness it firsthand, it might bring even more breakthroughs to their research.","He grinned. “Miss Yaoyao, I’m Aye’s third brother. He talks about you all the time. Welcome to our home.”","Yaoyao looked at him.","This one, too, had been marked by tragedy—a fate that stirred deep sighs.","He was a gifted researcher who should have become famous early on, but because his savior was also a researcher, he gave up all his credits to her, later marrying his lifesaver woman, becoming the man behind that female researcher. Every breakthrough he made helped her climb higher and farther.","But no secrets can stay hidden forever. Once the truth came to light, the couple was locked behind bars together. Humbled to the bone by guilt, he committed suicide in prison.","But now—his life had changed utterly. Somewhere down the line, he would actually become an academician...","“Miss Yaoyao, we’ve met before,” Ji Jingchuan said, walking toward her. “I’ve seen the news about you over the past few days. A single setback proves nothing. I’m waiting to see you reclaim your peak in the e-sports world.”","When their eyes met, Yaoyao felt an inexplicable trace of fear.","That day on the e-sports stage, she had merely brushed hands with Ji Jingchuan, and then she had spun out of control, spitting blood, and committing one clumsy mistake after another.","This man was far too unsettling.","But his luck—it was all too tempting.","Of all the Jis, his original life might have been the most wretched.","As a child, he was secretly swapped by a nanny, going from a rich young heir to a \"little orphan\" in some gritty countryside. Not an orphan in the strict sense, but with parents who couldn’t be bothered, he might as well have been one. After scraping by to grow up, his foster mother forced him to become live-in son-in-law to a rich family. He fled the arranged marriage, ran off to another city, and started from nothing, carving his way to build a company of his own.","When he was in his thirties, he finally learned the truth—that he wasn’t his adopted parents’ biological child—and began searching for his real family.","But just as his family was about to find him, he was pushed from a tall building by the fake young master who had lived his life in his stead, plummeting to his death.","He landed straight at his kin’s feet, staining the ground with blood.","And those relatives, who had come to seek him out, were the last descendants of the Ji family—one of whom was the first person he had gotten close to: Ji Zhouye.","She had held back a little toward Ji Zhouye.","Having absorbed only seventy percent of his good fortune was enough to ensure Ji Zhouye would live to an old age in peace and safety... though his life would be somewhat riddled with hardships.","Perhaps it was because she had harbored good intentions that Ji Zhouye had invited her to the Ji residence, where she encountered so many people bursting with luck.","If she could absorb all this luck completely, she would not only return to her peak—but surely, she would become an unprecedented legend in the esports scene, an unparalleled myth who would usher in a new era..."]},{"number":322,"title":"Chapter 322: They all deserve to die, die","paragraphs":["\"Alright, everyone's standing around. Have a seat.\"","Old Master Ji's voice rang out slowly, drawing Yaoyao's attention.","She looked at the elderly man before her in disbelief.","This old gentleman had the highest fortune value of anyone present.","He was destined to be isolated from his kin.","He lost his father while still in the womb.","At eight years old, he watched his mother die with his own eyes.","In his twenties, he bid farewell to his beloved wife.","In his sixties, his son and daughter-in-law both died unexpectedly in an accident.","He suffered from psychological illness, plagued by pain in his later years. One rainy night, he suddenly fell ill and was rushed to the hospital for emergency treatment. On the way, a car crash killed him instantly. He was seventy-eight years old.","But now, his fate had completely changed.","It changed at the age of seventy-eight—when his life was supposed to end, it suddenly took a sharp turn upward...","How strange—how could someone destined to be kinless have both parents alive in their old age?","In the end, he passed away peacefully with his parents by his side, at the age of one hundred and three.","\"Why is Miss Yaoyao staring at an old man like me?\"","Old Master Ji felt a little unnerved by her gaze and showed displeasure. When a person of authority frowns, the presence is undeniable.","Yaoyao quickly explained, \"Sorry, I was rude. I was reminded of my grandfather. My apologies, sir.\"","She then noticed Rong Yu, who had been sitting on the sofa all along.","That woman—she couldn't read her at all.","Ever since she got the fortune-transfer system three years ago, she had been able to see everyone's fortune value and take it for herself.","But why couldn't she see Rong Yu's fortune?","What was different about Rong Yu?","Still, this wasn't the time to figure that out.","Who should she target first among the Ji family?","She would start with the old man.","Older people had weaker control—taking their good fortune would be easy.","Yaoyao smiled and stepped forward quickly. \"Grandpa Ji, let me help you sit down.\"","She reached out to take Old Master Ji's arm.","\"Miss Yaoyao!\"","Ji Mohan grabbed her abruptly.","Yaoyao didn't mind. Her fingertips tightened, firmly clasping Ji Mohan's hand. Her red lips curled slightly. \"Thank you...\"","In an instant, the energy field inside her activated. Invisible quantum tendrils wormed through the skin where they touched, burrowing into Ji Mohan's body. But just as she was about to seize his fortune—","Buzz!","The quantum protective wall that had been set up in the Ji family living room suddenly lit up with a chilling blue glow. The nano-scale superconducting coils instantly formed a closed-loop magnetic field.","The moment Yaoyao's energy extended outward, it disappeared as if swallowed by the vast ocean—sucked away by an even larger, more precise force.","\"What...?\"","Her pupils contracted sharply, and her face turned deathly pale.","The energy was flowing backward!","The system inside her let out a sharp alarm. The originally stable quantum state began to collapse. Countless fortune quanta she had stolen over the years gushed out of her like a bursting dam, draining away endlessly.","\"No... stop!\"","Yaoyao tried desperately to flee, but Ji Mohan held her wrist firmly in return. The grip was gentle, but she couldn't break free.","He smiled. \"Miss Yaoyao, quantum entanglement has a very interesting property: the force is always mutual.\"","Yaoyao trembled all over. She could clearly feel her internal system collapsing. The nano-scale quantum nodes inside her body went dark one by one, like candles being snuffed out.","She lost all her strength and collapsed to the ground.","Ji Zhiyuan's hand remained pressed against his lower back, where he hid a gun he had bought abroad, ready at any moment to send a bullet into Yaoyao.","Ji Yanting blocked the main entrance, determined not to let Yaoyao escape.","Ji Jingchuan stood behind Yaoyao, prepared to take over from Ji Mohan at any moment and restrain her.","But Yaoyao was already unable to resist.","\"System, my system...\"","She cried out in panic.","An even more terrifying transformation followed... Her long, jet-black hair, from the roots, visibly began to lose its color, and in the blink of an eye, it turned into a glaring expanse of white.","Yaoyao raised a trembling hand and grabbed a strand of white hair, her entire body struck as if by lightning.","When the energy collapsed, the youth, luck, and life force she had plundered... all of it backfired...","Rong Yu stared at the data screen, her face full of shock.","The quanta extracted from Yaoyao's body, the life force was wild, actively devouring the surrounding quanta, growing stronger on its own... This was a miracle in the history of scientific research, something that should not exist.","\"You, all of you...\" Blood seeped from Yaoyao's lips, her eyes bloodshot as she looked up at the group before her. \"You took my system away from me. Give it back, give it back!\"","Ji Mohan crouched down: \"What is this 'system'? Explain it to me properly.\"","He even pulled out a notebook and began to write carefully.","Yaoyao's throat turned bitter and metallic, a mouthful of blood spraying out: \"So from the competition day on, your whole family was scheming against me, huh. Hmph, the system only recognizes me as its true master. You've taken it, but you can't make it work...\"","Ji Mohan wrote quickly: \"The system has a master-bonding mechanism. The energy will backfire...\"","\"Interesting.\" Rong Yu approached, looking down at Yaoyao. \"I'm curious, where did this so-called system come from?\"","\"You, you...\" Yaoyao stared at her. \"Do you have a system too? Is that why I can't detect your luck value?\"","She suddenly grabbed Rong Yu's leg. \"Miss Rong, we can cooperate. My system can steal everyone's luck and convert it into system energy. If you help me take these people's fortune, I'll give you all the converted energy. Help me, help me, please...\"","Ji Mohan was shocked, writing furiously: \"The system can convert luck into energy and transfer it to others...\"","\"Are other people just supposed to be your energy bank?\" Rong Yu's voice was icy. \"Your family had their luck stolen by you. Your father fell from a high-rise construction site, both legs permanently disabled. Your mother made a work mistake, and all your family's savings became compensation. Your brother was hit by a truck, left half-paralyzed...\"","\"What do you know? You don't understand anything!\" Yaoyao screamed. \"They deserved it, they deserved it! Who told them to favor sons over daughters, always only thinking about my brother, forcing me to drop out of school to work, forcing me to marry for a bride price so they could build my brother a house and get him married. They all deserved to die, deserved to die!\"","Her stubbornness made Rong Yu shake her head. \"And what about the fans? Did they deserve to die too?\"","\"They got emotional value from me. Taking just a little bit of their luck—what's wrong with that?\" Yaoyao said slowly. \"Besides, their original lives were all miserable. It was because luck favored them that they got smooth lives. I just... put them back on their original path. What did I do wrong? What exactly did I do wrong that made so many of you band together to target me!\""]},{"number":323,"title":"Chapter 323: The Youngest Chief Designer in Aerospace History","paragraphs":["Yaoyao kept vomiting blood.","Her face was gradually covered with wrinkles, making her look nothing like a twenty-year-old girl, as if she had suddenly aged to fifty.","She grabbed her head of white hair, touched the ravines on her face, and collapsed on the ground laughing bitterly, as if she had gone mad.","Rongyu spoke, \"Send her to the hospital.\"","Ji Mohan was stunned, \"Aren't we handing her over to the research institute for further study?\"","Rongyu took the notebook from his hand, her gaze firm, \"If A controls the B fusion system, absorbs C's luck, converts it into energy and transmits it to A, in the end, C dies tragically, B suffers backlash and ages, while A gets everything without paying any price...\"","\"A is a ruler, a tycoon, a celebrity... B is a pawn, a chess piece, C is every possible ordinary person... If this system is exploited by those with ill intentions, there could be countless victims.\"","\"This kind of research that goes against humanity doesn't need to continue, because, in the end, the result will never benefit all of humanity.\"","Ji Mohan trembled all over.","He immediately tore up the notebook and threw it into the shredder.","Ji Zhiyuan called for the steward and had the blood-soaked Yaoyao sent to a private hospital friendly with the Ji family.","Ji Zhouye said with tearful eyes, \"I never thought Yaoyao actually had a system. I almost got our whole family killed. I, I...\"","\"It's over, it's in the past.\" Old Master Ji spoke, \"As long as our family is together, no difficulty is too great.\"","Rongyu ruffled Ji Zhouye's head, \"You still have a company to run, perk up and work hard. Don't let Simin and the others' investments go down the drain.\"","Ji Zhouye straightened his back, \"Yes, Great-grandmother!\"","The National Day holiday passed in a flash. Just as Rongyu was about to return to school, she received a call from her assistant, Wang Xiaoli.","\"Engineer Rong, the final phase of the Eagle Eye project testing, would you like to come?\" Wang Xiaoli asked, \"The data team has some quantum regulation parameters that need your confirmation.\"","Rongyu nodded, \"Okay, I'll head over tomorrow.\"","She called her academic advisor, Cheng Rui, to request leave, then asked Steward Yu to book a flight ticket, taking the first flight the next day to Base Four.","Wang Xiaoli picked her up at the airport, driving a dedicated car to take her to the testing ground at the base.","The massive hangar door of the test center slowly opened before Rongyu. Under the cold white light, the Eagle Eye aircraft rested like a dormant silver-winged mecha. Its fuselage had sharp lines, and its surface was covered with a special quantum coating, giving off a dazzling gleam under the lights.","Many colleagues from the Fourth Aerospace Institute were present. Lin Rang sat in a wheelchair at the very front, smiling as he said, \"Junior sister, this project of yours went from its inception last October to this October, exactly one year, and now we're at the testing phase. It's the fastest progressing project in the history of Chinese aerospace, and you are also the youngest chief designer in aerospace history.\"","Rongyu looked embarrassed, \"Actually, I didn't do much. Senior brother, you were the one mainly overseeing things...\"","\"Don't be modest.\" Lin Rang smiled and said, \"The test is about to begin. Come on, go inside first.\"","They walked into the test chamber.","Rongyu first confirmed the final parameters:","Quantum radar array.","Plasma capture net.","Artificial intelligence navigation system.","After checking everything meticulously, she gave the order: \"Begin the test!\"","- First phase: Static ignition. As the countdown ended, the ion thrusters at the rear of the aircraft suddenly lit up with a deep blue glow.","- Second phase: Dynamic capture. Dozens of high-speed moving targets rose in the center of the test field. Titanium alloy spheres simulating space debris were randomly launched at supersonic speeds. The Eagle Eye suddenly activated, its wings folding and deforming, revealing the internal gravitational trap generator.","\"Locking on to targets!\"","The aircraft swept past at high speed. The targets decelerated suddenly ten meters from the fuselage. Immediately after, a giant net woven from plasma beams precisely enveloped all the targets.","\"Capture success rate: 100%!\"","- Third phase: Extreme load capacity. The top of the test chamber opened. When strong electromagnetic pulses simulating solar flares impacted, the aircraft's navigation system remained completely undisturbed. The chaos algorithm developed by Rongyu was predicting and evading all interference at tens of millions of calculations per second.","\"Perfect!\" Chief Engineer Cui of the base was full of admiration, \"All parameters exceed expectations by 20%. If the subsequent simulated orbit tests go smoothly, the first flight can take place in a month.\"","Cheers erupted throughout the control room.","Chief Engineer Cui looked at Rongyu, \"On the day of the first flight, your name will spread to every corner of the world. Are you mentally prepared, young genius?\"","Rongyu smiled, \"I've been ready for a long time.\"","\"The state will arrange security personnel to be hidden along your main routes for daily life and study, so don't worry too much.\" Chief Engineer Cui's expression suddenly became more interested, \"It's meal time now; under normal circumstances, I should tell you all to go eat first. But, Engineer Rong, I suggest you head to the military district... During his time in the military district, Captain Sheng has earned one first-class merit, three second-class merits, and seven third-class merits. He's been transferred to a special operations unit, and today is his last day at the base.\"","Rongyu took off her work coat, \"Thank you for the reminder, Chief Engineer Cui. I'll head over then.\"","After she left, Chief Engineer Cui couldn't help but laugh, \"This girl, she really doesn't beat around the bush.\"","Lin Rang frowned, \"Chief Engineer Cui, what kind of person is that Sheng Qingyan?\"","\"If Engineeer Rong is a once-in-a-century genius in the aerospace field, then Sheng Qingyan is a once-in-a-millennium sharpshooter in the military.\" Chief Engineer Cui said in a low voice, \"He entered the military district less than half a year ago, yet he has repeatedly made outstanding contributions and was spotted by the special forces. But the base refused to let him go. The special forces side insisted on taking him, and it even escalated to the top leadership. In the end, the top leader personally came to our base, held a coordination meeting, promised to compensate with military supplies, and only then did the base military district agree to release him...\"","Lin Rang was immediately stunned.","Being able to be called a \"top leader\" by Chief Engineer Cui, there were only a handful of such people in the country.","It seemed this Sheng Qingyan indeed had real skills. He should be worthy of junior sister.","Rongyu drove an off-road vehicle to the military district entrance.","As soon as she got out of the car, a young soldier at the gate recognized her, \"Are you Captain Sheng's family?\"","Rongyu smiled and asked, \"Is he here?\"","\"Yes, yes, yes. Verify your identity first, then go straight in. Captain Sheng should be in the dormitory packing his luggage.\"","Rongyu underwent facial recognition, card check, and fingerprint scanning. After all identity verifications, she headed towards the military dormitory building.","She stood out greatly. As soon as she appeared there, many people recognized her and enthusiastically pointed her in the right direction.","Sheng Qingyan was quietly packing his few pieces of clothing.","He had once drifted through life aimlessly, but only after joining the military camp did his life truly begin to burn.","These past few months, he had crawled through mud, tempered himself into steel on the shooting range, and pushed beyond his limits in extreme training... When sweat soaked through his camouflage uniform, when scars became medals, his life finally seemed to find its most valuable purpose: to fight for his country, to burn for his people.","He loved it here.","Knock, knock.","The sound of knocking came. He turned around and met a bright, smiling face.","All the blood rushed to his head, and his body reacted before his reason could catch up. In a single swift stride, he pulled the one he had been longing for day and night into his embrace."]},{"number":324,"title":"Chapter 324: As if an extra memory that doesn't belong to me has appeared out of nowhere","paragraphs":["A smile curved on Rong Yu’s lips.","After all this time, the guy had finally taken the initiative.","She reached out and wrapped her arms around his waist. It had been a while, and his waist had grown even leaner.","Just as she pinched the soft flesh at his side, a series of whistles erupted from the corridor outside.","“Ooh la la—”","“So sweet, so sweet, I’m shipping this first.”","“So she really is the missus—beautiful missus, hehehe.”","“...”","Five or six sunburned new recruits were pressed against the doorframe, winking and craning their necks to get a better look.","Sheng Qingyan’s face instantly darkened. He pulled Rong Yu behind him and barked, “Got nothing better to do, do you? I haven’t officially left base yet. You lot—ten-kilometer loaded march, starting now!”","The recruits groaned in unison.","One bold kid still grinned. “Report, Captain Sheng! You’re just using your authority to get back at us...”","“Twenty kilometers.” Sheng Qingyan kept a straight face. “One more word, and it’s thirty.”","The young soldiers scattered like startled birds, their footsteps thudding heavily against the ground.","Rong Yu buried her face in his shoulder, stifling her laughter. She could clearly feel the tight muscles of his waist tremble slightly beneath her palm.","This man—his ears were burning red, yet he insisted on putting on that stone-cold face.","She teased him deliberately. “Quite the display of authority, Captain Sheng.”","Sheng Qingyan cleared his throat. “Then let me take you to meet someone with even more authority. Let’s go.”","Rong Yu was curious. “Who?”","“My superior.” He straightened his collar. “I’m being transferred to the Northern Special Forces unit. I need to say goodbye to the leadership, and—introduce you while I’m at it.”","Rong Yu thought back. His superior should be Commissar Li, whom she already knew.","Dropping by to say hello wouldn’t hurt.","She followed Sheng Qingyan downstairs to the administrative building.","“Qingyan, you’re here. I was just about to send for you,” Commissar Li said, pulling an envelope out of his drawer. “This is your allowance and bonus for the past few months. I’ve processed it all at once—take it.”","“Thank you, Commissar Li.” Sheng Qingyan’s face suddenly flushed an odd shade of red. “Commissar, let me introduce someone.”","Only then did Commissar Li notice that someone else had come in. He broke into a smile. “Engineer Rong, when did you arrive at the base?”","“Just today,” Sheng Qingyan answered for her, coughing awkwardly. “Uh, Commissar, you didn’t believe me before when I said I had a girlfriend. Well, she’s my girlfriend.”","Commissar Li froze for a moment, then burst into laughter. “Qingyan, don’t joke around. Engineer Rong is still a teenager, in school. How could she be your girlfriend? Don’t tell me you dragged this young lady into playing a part just to reject my matchmaking.”","Rong Yu understood immediately. She spoke up firmly. “Commissar, Sheng Qingyan and I really are in a romantic relationship.”","“What?” Commissar Li was stunned for a few seconds. “How old are you? Why are you dating already...”","And of all people, she was dating Sheng Qingyan.","Sheng Qingyan—the young man he had his eye on as a son-in-law.","His daughter had visited the military district a while ago and had fallen for Sheng Qingyan at first sight, begging him to set them up.","He had been quite satisfied with the young man himself and had even offered to arrange a meeting. But Sheng Qingyan had turned him down flat, saying he already had a girlfriend. He hadn’t believed it at first. Yet now, the two standing together—handsome man, beautiful woman, a perfect match—made his daughter seem hardly in the same league.","He shook his head regretfully. “I was too presumptuous. Sheng Qingyan, attention!”","“Yes, Commissar!”","Sheng Qingyan immediately snapped to attention, standing at the ready.","“Your final order!” Commissar Li boomed. “Escort Engineer Rong back to Beijing safely. Can you do that?”","Sheng Qingyan looked slightly surprised, then promptly replied, “Understood!”","Commissar Li tapped him on the head. “What, did you think I’d order you to go on a blind date? I’m not the kind of unreasonable person who meddles in other people’s relationships. Breaking up a couple brings bad karma—I wouldn’t do such a thing. All right, you two get out of here, before I can’t resist poaching you myself.”","Sheng Qingyan saluted, took Rong Yu by the hand, and led her out.","Rong Yu’s work at the base had come to an end for now, and Sheng Qingyan was due to leave that day as well. By evening, they had bought the last two tickets for a flight to the airport.","As soon as they entered the terminal, an announcement came over the intercom: their flight had been delayed by three hours due to uncontrollable factors.","Rong Yu glanced at her watch. “Want to take a walk outside?”","The night wind swept in, carrying fine grit. Rong Yu squinted instinctively.","Sheng Qingyan silently shifted half a step closer, his tall frame perfectly blocking the wind. In the distance, the lights of a night market flickered in the dusk, and the air was thick with the charred fragrance of baked naan and the smell of cumin.","Hand in hand, the two strolled through the market.","For them, this was an incredibly rare moment of peaceful leisure.","Rong Yu spotted a row of handmade copper items. A woman at the stall smiled and handed her a handcrafted copper whistle. “Young lady, this whistle is cheap—twenty yuan each. Want one?”","Rong Yu paid for it.","She blew it lightly—the sound was quite clear and pleasant.","Sheng Qingyan reached out. “Let me try?”","They had wandered to the far end of the market, a quiet spot with only poplar trees around. Taking the whistle, he leaned against a tree and pressed it to his lips, playing a melody from “In That Distant Place.”","That piece of music made Rong Yu feel a sudden sense of disorientation.","It was like a key, unexpectedly unlocking the floodgates of memory.","The salty sea breeze seemed to rush back over her. She remembered standing by the railing of a cruise ship over seventy years ago, Ji Zheng leaning casually against the gunwale, an old copper whistle glinting at his lips as he played the same melody, rising and falling with the waves.","The moonlight had been just as cold and clear back then, casting a soft silver glow over his gentle features.","She stretched out her hand as if possessed.","Her fingertips touched his brow bone.","Sheng Qingyan’s breath caught, but he stood still, letting her trace his face.","Her fingers slid down his high nose bridge—a different shape from Ji Zheng’s, yet under the moonlight, it cast the same heart-stirring shadow.","Suddenly, she stood on her tiptoes.","Her warm lips pressed against his thin ones.","Boom—!","Sheng Qingyan’s mind practically exploded.","He hesitated for only a second before taking charge. One hand cupped the back of her head, the other wrapped around her waist, pulling her completely into his embrace.","The clamor of the distant market seemed to fade away, leaving only the sound of their interlaced breaths.","Sheng Qingyan’s kiss carried the scent of gunpowder and raw masculinity, blending in her mind with Ji Zheng’s salty, sea-laced kiss from memory. Time twisted strangely in that moment, and she could no longer tell whether the heartbeat she felt was from the past or the present.","They kissed for what felt like an eternity before finally parting.","A trace of confusion lingered in Sheng Qingyan’s eyes.","Rong Yu’s voice was hoarse. “What’s wrong?”","“I feel like...” He pressed his temple. “Like I’ve suddenly gained a memory that isn’t mine—a cruise ship, the sea...”","Rong Yu was startled. “Then what else? What else do you remember?”","Sheng Qingyan tried hard to recall. “There were many people... gunfire... a battle had started... so many dead...”","His head throbbed with pain, and his face turned pale."]},{"number":325,"title":"Chapter 325: Do you believe in past lives and reincarnation","paragraphs":["“I've seen a cruise ship before, it looked exactly like that photo...”","“There was a woman, a pregnant woman. Who is she, and why...”","Sheng Qingyan clutched his head, beads of sweat the size of beans rolling down continuously.","“Stop thinking, stop thinking,” Rong Yu held his hand. “Those are all things of the past. It’s okay if you can’t remember. Sheng Qingyan, I told you to stop thinking!”","Bright red blood vessels crawled across Sheng Qingyan’s pupils. He grasped Rong Yu’s hand back. “What do you mean, ‘things of the past’? What past events? A-Yu, what do you know?”","Rong Yu looked at him. “Do you believe in past lives?”","Sheng Qingyan fell silent.","He did not believe in them.","But clearly, she did.","So, he found it difficult to answer.","“Perhaps those images that just appeared in your mind are experiences from a past life,” Rong Yu said slowly. “Since they belong to a previous life, there’s no need to dwell on them. It’s almost time; let’s board the plane first.”","Sheng Qingyan took a sip of water, washing away those chaotic images.","The two returned to the airport. After boarding and settling into their seats, perhaps because of the intense mental shock from the flood of sudden memories, Sheng Qingyan’s brain was extremely exhausted. He fell asleep almost as soon as he sat down.","It seemed he had a dream.","But when he woke up, he couldn’t remember anything.","It was as if something was missing.","What was missing?","The plane cut through the clouds and landed at the Capital City Airport. Due to the delay, it was already past 7 AM when they disembarked. Sheng Qingyan escorted Rong Yu to the gate of Qinghua University. It was exactly the time for classes, and students were everywhere.","“Alright, I’ll head in now,” Rong Yu said with a smile. “Oh, by the way, I heard from Ciyuan that your uncle, Sheng Yun, is getting married soon. Will you attend the wedding?”","Sheng Qingyan replied, “Not sure yet, but I’ll try to make time.”","Rong Yu waved. “Okay, then... see you.”","She turned around first and walked into the campus.","Not until her figure disappeared from sight did Sheng Qingyan take out his phone and make a call. “Ciyuan, those historical artifacts I’ve unconsciously collected over the years, which museum were they donated to?”","Sheng Ciyuan asked, puzzled, “Brother, why are you asking about that? You’re not thinking of getting them back, are you?”","“No,” Sheng Qingyan said flatly. “I want to go see them, to immerse myself in the history of that era.”","Sheng Ciyuan sent him the address.","Rong Yu had been on the plane all night and hadn’t rested much. She returned to the dormitory, slept first, and only went to class in the afternoon.","She had just finished one class when she received a message from her senior fellow apprentice, Lin Rang.","Since her senior year of high school, she had participated in three major projects at the Fourth Institute of Aerospace, all classified as national-level major projects. Qinghua’s regulations stipulated that school-level major projects could earn two credits, provincial-level five credits, and national-level ten credits. If a student was the project leader, they would receive an additional twenty percent.","A freshman was required to complete thirty-two credits.","Her senior, being considerate, had compiled all this into a Qinghua University document. She just needed to send it directly to her academic advisor.","Cheng Rui stared at this file, falling into a long half-hour of silence.","She knew that among the students of this year’s Tianxingjian class, Rong Yu was the most outstanding, but she had never imagined she was this exceptional.","She was only in her senior year of high school back then and was already participating in so many heavyweight projects?","This clearly went against regulations.","Yet, she had done it.","The data showed that Rong Yu had also been involved in a super-secret major project as the chief designer, with seals of approval from various national departments—there was no mistaking its authenticity.","Cheng Rui let out a soft breath and sent a message to Rong Yu: “I’ve approved your materials here and will submit them to the school. However, research project bonus credits are supplementary. If you can fulfill all your credit requirements solely through project rewards, it would undermine the integrity of the course system. So, I hope you still focus on solidifying your fundamental knowledge.”","Rong Yu replied: “I understand, Teacher.”","She was even thinking about what new project to start during evening study.","“You two bookworms, can you please stop burying yourselves in studying? You’re stressing me out!” Yu Kexin closed the math books of Rong Yu and Xue Yun. “Tonight’s the welcome party. Come on, let’s go watch some performances and take a break from the pressure.”","Xue Yun shrugged. “I’m not interested.”","“You’re going even if you’re not interested,” Yu Kexin said, pulling them both up. “Some people from our class are performing. At least go to support Sheng Ciyuan and Song Huai, okay?”","Rong Yu looked up. “What is Sheng Ciyuan performing?”","Was she too busy even to know that guy had signed up for a show?","“A singing act,” Yu Kexin said. “Hurry up and grab some seats; if we go late, we’ll only get back rows and won’t see anything.”","Qinghua University’s welcome party kicked off grandly on the wide sports field.","Night fell, and the sports field was dazzling with lights. The stage was surrounded by colorful neon lights, illuminating half the night sky. Students from various departments gathered in small groups, some waving glow sticks, others holding departmental flags, creating a lively and exuberant atmosphere.","By the time the three arrived hurriedly, the front rows were already packed, and even the grassy edges were filled with sitting students.","They had to find a spot at the back, spread out their coats as a seat. Although they were far from the stage, the massive high-hanging screen clearly broadcast the performances on stage, and the sound system was excellent, so it wasn’t much of a loss.","The night breeze was slightly chilly. The distant singing on stage merged with the cheers of nearby classmates, immersing the entire campus in a festive mood.","“The hosts are senior Zhai Weitong, and freshman Luo Xuan. The other two guys—one is another senior who has already advanced directly to a doctoral program—super accomplished, named Jiang Dai. The other is the newly elected top school heartthrob from the Computer Science department...” Yu Kexin paused. “Rong Yu, you’re number one on the school beauty list. Why weren’t you chosen as a host?”","Rong Yu vaguely remembered that a while back, someone claiming to be the student council president had called her, inviting her to the student council office for a chat. Her schedule was too full, so she declined.","And it was a good thing she did; otherwise, she’d have to be a host.","Hosts had to have sweet smiles and strong rapport, which were too difficult for her.","Programs came and went one by one, and soon it was Sheng Ciyuan and Song Huai’s turn. The two performed a duet.","Rong Yu was a bit surprised.","They were singing the very song she had performed for the mainstream movie.","During the National Day holiday, the movie was released, and this song became a smash hit across the country. The moment Sheng Ciyuan sang the first line, over half the crowd on the sports field started singing along.","“In the smoke of war, you planted the first spark.”","“On the wasteland, iron tracks pierced the harsh winter.”","“...”","“The mountains know, the rivers know, every inch of this soil remembers your faces.”","“Grinding youth into gravel, letting the future glow hot in our palms.”","“...”"]},{"number":326,"title":"Chapter 326: Would you please accept my pursuit, classmate Rong Yu","paragraphs":["A song ended.","The whole venue erupted in thunderous, prolonged applause.","Host Zhai Weitong walked onto the stage, her voice full of emotion: \"Thank you to the two students from Tianxingjian Class for that wonderful performance. Next, let's welcome student Sato and the international student group from Sakura Country to perform a traditional Sakura dance. Let's give them a warm welcome.\"","The Sakura Country student group led by Sato performed a traditional dance full of Eastern charm. Paper umbrellas spun lightly, the rhythm of the wadaiko drums was powerful, and sakura petals scattered with their steps, drawing another round of thunderous applause from the audience.","As the performance ended, Sato did not immediately leave the stage. Instead, he suddenly took the microphone from Zhai Weitong's hand, walked to the center of the stage, took a deep breath, and suddenly spoke in fluent Chinese: \"Before I leave the stage, there's something important I want to say.\"","Given the occasion and the atmosphere, the young people in the audience immediately caught on.","The crowd instantly erupted in cheers.","\"Confession! Confession!\"","\"Brave people, confess and enjoy love now!\"","Sato looked toward the audience and spoke loudly: \"I do want to confess. From the first time I saw you, I was deeply attracted. Your talent, your beauty, your pride—I couldn't take my eyes off you. Today, I want to express my feelings in front of the whole school. I like you. Please accept my pursuit, Rong Yu!\"","The entire venue was in an uproar, with cheers rising from all sides.","\"Did I hear that wrong? He dares to confess to the number one on the campus beauty list!\"","\"That's insane. I respect him, that's truly bold!\"","\"Is the campus beauty here? Is she at the scene?\"","\"Yes, here! The campus beauty is here!\"","A spotlight suddenly swept across the audience, locking precisely onto Rong Yu, who was sitting in the back row. Her cold expression appeared on the big screen.","\"Student Rong Yu, this is a sakura necklace I designed myself, symbolizing my most sincere feelings,\" Sato said, opening a gift box to reveal an exquisite necklace. \"Please accept my pursuit!\"","The whole venue erupted once again.","\"Oh my god! This is so romantic!\"","\"Say yes! Say yes!\"","\"How could anyone not say yes?\"","The waves of cheers grew louder. Several Sakura Country international students even pulled out a banner that read in Chinese: \"Please let Rong Yu accept Sato-kun.\"","Rong Yu curled her lips.","This Sato was like a fly, appearing everywhere she went. It was disgusting.","If she didn't fight back, he would really think she was a pushover.","She stood up and walked toward the stage.","The students in the audience immediately parted to make way for her.","She walked straight onto the stage.","Zhai Weitong, standing on the stage, grabbed her and whispered, \"Junior Rong, don't let the public pressure get to you. I can...\"","\"Thank you, senior,\" Rong Yu said, gently squeezing Zhai Weitong's hand before stepping directly in front of Sato. She slightly raised her lips. \"Student Sato, are you putting on a show of emotional blackmail?\"","Sato was taken aback, clearly not expecting such a response.","Rong Yu let out a cold laugh and continued: \"In a public setting, using the crowd's cheers to pressure someone into responding to your feelings—is this what you people from Sakura Country call sincerity?\"","The crowd that had been cheering fell silent instantly.","Sato's expression changed slightly: \"Rong, I truly like you. I just wanted to express my genuine feelings. Don't be so cold-hearted...\"","\"Genuine feelings?\" Rong Yu sneered. \"Your genuine feelings mean putting a girl in an awkward position in front of everyone? Or do you think that as long as it's romantic enough, the girl should be moved and accept?\"","She was firm in her heart. This incident wouldn't bring any negative impact on her.","But if it were Yu Kexin, she would definitely have succumbed to the crowd's pressure and agreed inexplicably.","And if it were Xue Yun, even if she could refuse, she might endlessly beat herself up over it afterward.","She looked around, her gaze sweeping over those who had just been cheering: \"Since when did confessions become tools to force others? And when did rejection become heartlessness?\"","The noise from the audience stopped abruptly.","Rong Yu stared coldly at Sato: \"I only have one request for you: from now on, don't appear within my sight. I hope you can make that happen. Otherwise, I will report you to the school for sexually harassing a female student, and they will take disciplinary action against you!\"","She turned and walked off the stage.","Some in the audience began to cheer.","\"Some little guy from a small country dares to dream about the campus beauty? What a pipe dream!\"","\"We young people today don't do ethnic discrimination, but this behavior is truly worth condemning.\"","\"Guys who confess in public deserve to be dealt with like this. Don't ruin the atmosphere at Huaqing University!\"","\"Shouldn't the guy on stage get lost?\"","\"...\"","Sato stood there dumbfounded, threw the microphone back into the host's hands, and slinked offstage in shame.","Zhai Weitong quickly regained her sweet smile: \"Thank you, student Rong Yu, for giving us the most shocking lesson of the night. In my view, when a girl stands in the spotlight, what deserves praise is not someone confessing to her, but her courage to say no. We girls are always told that being liked is lucky, that public confessions are romantic—but who ever asks the person being confessed to whether she wants to be the protagonist of this romance?\"","\"Tonight, student Rong Yu has shown us through her actions that a woman's will should not be kidnapped by applause...\"","Rong Yu, who had just walked off the stage, stopped in her tracks.","This senior, aside from being a bit of a hopeless romantic, was truly excellent in other ways. In less than a minute, she had put together such a powerful string of words that struck straight to the heart and resonated deeply.","\"True respect is not about piling up flowers and gifts to create a spectacle. If the person confessing can't even give that basic respect, then what right do they have to demand acceptance... So, let's give another round of applause to Rong Yu, thanking her for teaching us how to beautifully defend our boundaries...\"","Rong Yu raised her hand to clap.","Suddenly!","She froze!","A screw rolled to her feet.","She was standing at the edge of the stage, only a few meters away from Zhai Weitong. She clearly saw screws one by one falling from the massive electronic screen stand behind the stage.","Zhai Weitong was unaware, about to invite the next group of students to perform.","\"Watch out!\"","Without a moment to think, Rong Yu shot onto the stage like an arrow from a bow. In the nick of time, she violently shoved Zhai Weitong to the side.","\"Boom!\"","The half-ton display screen crashed down onto the spot where they had been standing half a second earlier, shards flying everywhere.","Screams erupted throughout the venue.","In the dust, Rong Yu supported herself with one hand on the ground, the other still protecting the senior's head. Panting, she asked, \"Senior, are you okay?\"","Zhai Weitong was in severe pain all over.","After dazed for a while, she spoke hoarsely, \"Thank you, junior Rong, but... my leg hurts so much...\"","Rong Yu looked down. The broken glass from the screen had pierced into Zhai Weitong's calves and thighs, leaving seven or eight wounds.","Many students in the front rows had also been scratched by the fragments.","The welcome party ended because of the accident.","\"Rong Yu, you're hurt too!\" Sheng Ciyuan rushed over in a flash. \"The back of your neck—there's such a big gash. Can't you feel it yourself?\"","He forcefully helped Rong Yu to her feet. \"You need to go to the hospital too.\"","Rong Yu wiped her hand across her face—it came back covered in blood. She really was injured.","She looked up at the fallen screen, her brows furrowing. Somehow, it didn't seem like an accident."]},{"number":327,"title":"Chapter 327: Being Roommates with Someone Like This Will Make Her Miserable","paragraphs":["\"Rong, are you okay!\"","Sato had just gotten off the stage, still at the edge of it, and rushed over with a panicked expression.","\"What business is it of yours?\" Sheng Ciyuan said coldly. \"Move aside, don't block the way!\"","A group of injured students were being sent to the hospital one after another.","Yu Kexin watched the departing ambulance, her face full of guilt: \"It's all my fault. If I hadn’t insisted on dragging you all to the show, none of this would have happened...\"","\"You should be glad we came. If Rong Yu hadn't been right there, Senior Zhai Weitong might have been in danger of her life.\" Xue Yun changed the subject. \"It's still early. I’m going to the library. Want to come?\"","Yu Kexin shook her head. \"You go ahead.\"","As Xue Yun walked away, mentally sorting through her book list, she had just left the sports field when a voice sounded behind her: \"Xue Yun, wait a moment.\"","Xue Yun turned around and saw Sato, who exuded an aura of Japanese culture.","Sato smiled humbly. \"Xue, could I ask you for a favor?\"","Xue Yun stared at him coldly. \"How do you know my name?\"","\"I, well, I admire Rong Yu. Asking about her roommate’s name is quite reasonable, isn’t it?\" Sato pulled a small velvet box from his backpack. \"This gift is something I specially customized for Rong Yu. It has to be delivered to her personally. Xue, please help me, okay?\"","Xue Yun turned away. \"I can’t help.\"","\"I, I’ll pay you.\" Sato blocked her path. \"Ten thousand RMB. Is that enough to get your help?\"","Xue Yun’s expression turned icy.","\"Thirty thousand.\" Sato held up three fingers. \"That’s the highest I can offer.\"","Xue Yun opened her mouth as if to say something but held back. She looked at the box and said coldly, \"One hundred thousand. Otherwise, no deal.\"","\"You, you...\" Sato fumed, but in the end, he relented. \"Fine, one hundred thousand it is. I’ll transfer it after it’s done.\"","Xue Yun put the velvet box into her backpack.","She was usually calm and composed, but now she didn’t feel like going to the library anymore. She headed straight back to the dormitory.","When she returned, Yu Kexin was video-calling with her parents. Seeing Xue Yun come in, she hung up and asked curiously, \"Why are you back so early? Was the library too crowded?\"","Xue Yun shook her head.","She sat down, took out the velvet box from her backpack, and opened it directly.","She was genuinely curious about why Sato would pay her one hundred thousand just to pass along a gift.","\"Hey, isn’t this the necklace Sato used to confess to Rong Yu tonight?\" Yu Kexin leaned in. \"Wow, it’s so beautiful up close. It even has fire, this must be a real pink diamond. That’s probably worth tens of thousands. Sato is really going all out to pursue Rong Yu... Wait, no, Xue Yun, how did you get this? Why did you bring it back to the dorm?\"","Yu Kexin had been curious at first, but now her expression changed.","She didn’t think much of Sato.","But if Xue Yun had accepted a gift originally meant for Rong Yu, she’d think even less of Xue Yun.","Being roommates with someone like that would be unbearable.","She looked at Xue Yun accusingly.","But Xue Yun didn’t seem bothered at all.","She picked up the necklace, turning it over and examining it closely, as her brows furrowed deeper.","\"Xue Yun, you shouldn’t have accepted...\"","Yu Kexin couldn’t hold back anymore and started again, but Xue Yun made a shushing gesture and beckoned her closer.","Confused, she came over.","Xue Yun flipped the pink necklace over and pointed at the exact center on the back of the pendant.","\"Oh my, that’s...\" Yu Kexin’s mouth was covered, swallowing all her words. She pried Xue Yun’s hand away and said in a loud voice, \"Wow, what a gorgeous necklace! How could Rong Yu refuse this? When she puts it on and sees how pretty it is, she’ll definitely say yes to Sato. Then we’ll make him treat us to a five-star hotel dinner!\"","As the two were exchanging frantic glances, the dorm door swung open and Rong Yu stepped in.","The back of her neck had been scratched by a piece of debris, but it wasn’t serious. After disinfecting and applying ointment, she just needed to keep it dry for a day.","\"Rong Yu, take a look at this.\" Xue Yun, usually a woman of few words, was now unusually chatty. \"This is the gift Sato asked me to give you. Actually, Sato’s not a bad guy. He’s top of his class, valued by Japan, and studying here on a government scholarship. His family is quite well-off, part of the nobility back home. You...\"","As Xue Yun spoke, she pointed subtly at the back of the necklace.","Rong Yu’s face darkened.","This was an ultra-miniature listening device.","Sato was bugging her?","What was he planning?","Xue Yun sent a message in the dorm group chat to explain: \"The fact that he paid me one hundred thousand for this means it’s not just a simple gift. If I refused, I was afraid he’d find someone else to plant something in our dorm, so I accepted.\"","Rong Yu stepped forward and hugged her.","Xue Yun was the type to keep to herself—quiet, introverted, and not keen on talking to people. In today’s terms, she was an extreme social phobic. Deigning to deal with Sato must have taken a lot of effort.","Xue Yun looked a little embarrassed. \"I’m going to shower first.\"","Yu Kexin mouthed silently, \"What do we do with this thing? Smash it? Throw it away? Report it?\"","Rong Yu whispered, \"Let’s turn the tables on him.\"","The three of them took turns showering.","Afterward, Rong Yu fiddled with the necklace and said aloud, \"I can start an independent research project now. My advisor has a project on fuel coating tests for the space launch base.\"","She paused deliberately. \"I heard it’s made from the same batch of materials as the military’s next-generation stealth fighters.\"","Xue Yun thought Rong Yu was just feeding false info to the listening device for Sato’s benefit, but then Rong Yu pulled actual project documents out of her backpack.","Xue Yun was incredulous. \"You can start a research project as a freshman?\"","\"And it’s this kind of project...\" Yu Kexin swallowed hard. \"It involves classified material. Can Xue Yun and I handle it?\"","\"It’s military-related, so of course we need confidentiality. You’ll sign a non-disclosure agreement tomorrow,\" Rong Yu said. \"We only have one class in the morning tomorrow. Let’s go check out the lab first.\"","The next day, after class ended that morning, Rong Yu led her two roommates toward the laboratory building.","This project was a sub-branch of a larger initiative under Academician Lin—a national-level confidential project. Naturally, it was assigned to a top-tier lab.","As the lab door closed behind them, Yu Kexin and Xue Yun looked around like country bumpkins who had just entered a big city, full of curiosity and bewilderment, too afraid to touch anything.","Rong Yu handed them two sets of protective gear. \"Put these on first. This lab is special. Don’t touch anything without asking me. Today, we’ll get familiar with the project and sort through the relevant historical data...\"","Yu Kexin and Xue Yun, both new to this kind of project, were so fired up they worked like they’d just drunk rocket fuel.","After the official work was done, Rong Yu took out two documents.","Yu Kexin flipped through one and gasped in surprise. \"These... the data are exactly the same!\"","The experimental parameters, charts, and even the references in both reports were identical. The only differences were the titles and some subject-verb phrasing within the text.","A document cover read: \"Tsinghua University · Cafeteria Counter Heat-Resistant Tray Performance Optimization Experimental Data.\"","Another document read: \"Base Four Aerospace Fuel Coating Heat Resistance Experimental Data.\"","Xue Yun immediately understood: \"If this document were stolen, it would be sufficient evidence of the wolfish ambitions of the Cherry Blossom Country.\""]},{"number":328,"title":"Chapter 328: When has there ever been such a precedent","paragraphs":["Ten o'clock at night.","Rong Yu and her two roommates finally returned to the dorm after finishing their work.","The pink diamond necklace was lying on the desk. When the lights came on, its brilliance shimmered and scattered, breathtakingly beautiful.","Yu Kexin closed the dorm door, tossed her backpack onto the bed, and sighed dramatically: \"Ugh, I'm so exhausted from the lab today!\"","The corner of Rong Yu's mouth lifted slightly. \"Tired, sure, but it was interesting, wasn't it?\"","Xue Yun immediately played along, pushing up her glasses and lowering her voice: \"Hey, tell me... that coating, can it really withstand the high temperatures of space?\"","Yu Kexin flipped open her notebook and read with exaggerated seriousness: \"The sample held out for over an hour under an oxyacetylene flame before cracking. If this data gets out, the international community will be buzzing.\"","Xue Yun nodded. \"If this research succeeds, it should be even better than the coating on the Long March 9.\"","Rong Yu said lightly, \"Mm, and the cost has been cut to a tenth.\"","\"By the way,\" Yu Kexin lowered her voice again, \"Is the military really going to use this coating? For real?\"","\"Shh!\" Xue Yun said. \"This is a confidential project. Watch what you say.\"","Yu Kexin shrugged. \"It's just us three here. What's the harm in talking about it? Right, Rong Yu?\"","Rong Yu glanced at the necklace. \"Let's talk about it tomorrow in the lab. By the way, we need to finish organizing the data in the morning and send it over. The lab will wipe all backups afterward. You two get some rest early...\"","In the international student dormitory building.","Sato abruptly stood up from his chair.","Long March 9, military-grade coating, confidential project...","These keywords kept hammering into his brain.","He already knew Rong Yu wasn't ordinary.","But he never imagined she was this extraordinary—a freshman, yet already involved in a project of this classified level.","If he could get his hands on that data file, the aerospace industry of Sakura Country would surely leap forward by a huge margin.","With that thought, Sato threw on a black jacket, put on a cap, grabbed his laptop, and headed out.","Darkness blanketed the campus.","When morning radio exercises blared across the campus, Rong Yu and her two roommates were already up. They only had one class in the morning: English.","English posed absolutely no challenge for Rong Yu. While the teacher lectured at the front, she was busy writing formulas and data down below. She didn't even hear the bell ring for the end of class.","Suddenly.","A hand reached out in front of her. The project document she had tucked under her textbook was snatched away.","She looked up and saw Duan Fei.","Ever since Duan Fei's two-timing scandal broke out half a month ago, it had caused an uproar on the forums. But since it was a personal matter among students and hadn't led to any serious consequences, the school only issued a warning and didn't impose any formal disciplinary action.","Duan Fei acted as if nothing had happened, going to class as usual.","But many people on the forum had been tracking his movements. They said he had sold everything he could, was taking on part-time jobs everywhere, scrambling to scrape money together, looking utterly pathetic.","Rong Yu could clearly feel the hostility in Duan Fei's eyes when he looked at her now.","Even though he was the one who had done wrong.","He insisted on believing that she had exposed him, ruining his reputation and drowning him in debt.","Duan Fei quickly scanned the document in his hand, then raised his voice: \"Everyone, take a look! A freshman, barely in university, gets to lead an independent project? With S-level lab access? In over a hundred years of Tsinghua's history, has there ever been such a precedent?\"","The classroom fell silent instantly.","All eyes fixed on Rong Yu.","Only Song Huai curled his lips slightly.","For someone who could summon a gathering of academicians with a single word, a mere project was nothing to Rong Yu.","Duan Fei's eyes were dark.","Yesterday, he had heard that Rong Yu had spent the entire day in the lab.","At first, he thought Zhai Weitong had hired Rong Yu as an assistant again. But after digging around, he found out that Rong Yu was the project initiator—a completely independent project.","How did a freshman deserve that?","\"I checked. The project was approved by Professor Lin from the Physics Department.\" Duan Fei gritted his teeth. \"Someone saw you meeting privately with Professor Lin. So, is there some shady deal between you and him that got a freshman approved as a project lead?\"","Rong Yu stared at him coldly. \"Do you know the consequences of slandering a nationally awarded academician?\"","\"What do the consequences matter?\" Duan Fei gritted out. \"The real question is: how did you get this project? Everyone else follows the rules, so why are you the exception?\"","\"Duan Fei!\"","At the classroom door, Counselor Cheng Rui strode in, holding a stack of documents. Usually smiling warmly, her face was now icy.","\"Spreading rumors about a professor is enough to get you disciplinary action.\"","Duan Fei's expression shifted slightly, but he quickly stiffened his neck. \"Then, Teacher Cheng, explain to me how a freshman qualifies to start a research project.\"","Cheng Rui walked straight to the podium, pulled a document from her folder, and projected it onto the screen.","\"Freshmen are required to complete thirty-two credits. Rong Yu currently has forty-nine credits,\" Cheng Rui said coldly. \"According to school regulations, she is already classified as a sophomore. Sophomores are eligible to apply for projects. It just so happens that Professor Lin was the one reviewing her application. How did that become a 'shady deal' in your mouth?\"","The classroom erupted.","\"What? Forty-nine credits?\"","\"School's only been going for less than two months. How did she manage that?\"","\"Look at the screen. It says she worked on several national-level projects and got bonus points, so...\"","\"Oh my God, national-level projects...\"","Cheng Rui turned to the class. \"I know you all have doubts, but Tsinghua's rule is simple: if you have the ability, you move up. Rong Yu completed her freshman credits ahead of schedule. Classmates, take her as an example, work hard, and live up to the Tianxingjian class...\"","Duan Fei's face was as dark as a storm cloud. He grabbed his bag and stormed out of the classroom.","The rest of the students, as if injected with adrenaline, flipped open their books and frantically began studying and solving problems.","After the first class ended, Rong Yu and her roommates headed to the lab.","Rong Yu swiped her access card. The metal door slid open. As she stepped inside, she nearly collided with a tall figure.","\"Sorry, this lab is already occupied,\" said a warm, gentle male voice.","Yu Kexin recognized him immediately. \"Senior Jiang Dai!\"","Rong Yu also recognized him—he had been one of the male hosts at the welcome party. Word had it he was Tsinghua's top senior.","Jiang Dai stood in front of the lab bench, his white lab coat buttoned neatly all the way up. He said flatly, \"I've reserved this lab. Find another one.\"","Rong Yu's voice was even cooler. \"I've reserved this lab for five consecutive days, from ten in the morning to nine at night. May I ask how Senior Jiang Dai managed to book it? Or did you just decide to take it over because you couldn't get a reservation?\"","\"Little sister, you're only a freshman, yet you have the clearance to book an S-level lab. I'll give you credit for that.\" Jiang Dai adjusted his thick glasses. \"But the projects a freshman can initiate are limited. You don't really need precision instruments like these. So why waste resources? Let's compromise. I'll book another lab for you. How about that?\""]},{"number":329,"title":"Chapter 329: Rong Yu, you deliberately set me up—I was played by you.","paragraphs":["Rong Yu frowned slightly.","She spoke coldly, \"Senior, the labs at Huaqing have never been assigned by year level. The lab management regulations clearly state that all faculty and students must use the equipment on a first-come, first-served basis according to their scheduled appointments, and no one is allowed to forcibly occupy it based on academic seniority.\"","The curvature of Jiang Dai’s lips remained unchanged. \"Junior, you managed to get S-level lab permissions. Are you saying you’ve followed the rules completely?\"","As soon as he finished speaking, a figure appeared in the hallway.","\"Jiang Dai, you’re ridiculous, trying to take over a freshman’s lab!\" Zhai Weitong, also wearing a research coat, strode over. \"Let me give you some inside info—Rong Yu’s project is personally approved and monitored by Academician Lin. If you mess with Academician Lin’s project, you won’t be able to handle the consequences!\"","Jiang Dai’s expression finally shifted.","A sneer appeared on his face.","A resource benefactor, another resource benefactor.","Zhai Weitong had a mother who was an academician, and this junior probably had some family connection to Academician Lin too. Otherwise, how could she have gotten lab permissions as a freshman?","He pressed his lips together. \"I see. Well, then, I wish you success with your experiments, junior.\"","He turned around, entered the lab to pack up the various documents he had just taken out, stacking them one by one into his file bag before walking out.","The moment he stepped out, a scream rang out from inside the lab: \"Oh no, our experiment data is gone! The drawer shows signs of being pried open—it’s been stolen!\"","Zhai Weitong immediately grabbed Jiang Dai by the shoulder. \"Did you take it?\"","Jiang Dai violently shook off Zhai Weitong’s hand, his usually gentle voice suddenly sharp. \"I’ve only been in the lab for half an hour—I haven’t even done anything yet! I never saw any experiment data! You’re deliberately framing me!\"","Xue Yun rushed to the workbench, rummaging through the drawers. \"It was right here! It’s key data for the aerospace material coating! If this data were just lost, it might not be a big deal, but if it’s stolen and leaked, we’re done for! Senior Jiang Dai, you—\"","\"I said I didn’t take it!\" Jiang Dai fumed. \"Check the surveillance footage. We have to check the surveillance!\"","Zhai Weitong immediately pulled up the footage. But the screen showed nothing but static noise.","For the first time in his life, Jiang Dai understood what it meant to be unable to defend himself no matter what he said.","---","Inside the international student dormitory,","a paper document lay before Sato. His fingers trembled as he frantically typed, entering the stolen data item by item into an analysis system.","\"High-temperature resistance test... 300 degrees Celsius?\" He stared at the screen, frowning deeply. \"How could an aerospace thermal barrier coating have performance this low?\"","He flipped quickly to the next page, his face growing increasingly grim.","\"Impact resistance test... withstands force of 50N? That’s worse than ordinary aluminum alloy!\"","\"Did I grab the wrong file? But the cover is correct—it says ‘Aerospace Coating Test Data.’ Why is it like this...\"","The blue light from the computer screen reflected off his pale face. Sweat beads rolled down his temples. He grabbed a cup of water and gulped it down, only to choke and start coughing violently.","\"Knock, knock, knock!\"","A sudden knock on the dorm room door.","He scrambled to close the laptop and stuffed the stolen file into a bookshelf before standing up to open the door.","As the door swung open, he saw a large crowd standing outside. Nearly ten people flooded in.","His face changed. \"Counselor, you all...\"","Among the group weren’t just faculty members, but also several students, including all three of Rong Yu’s suitemates.","\"Sato,\" the counselor said coldly, \"at 11:53 p.m. last night, did you go to the lab building?\"","Sato adjusted his glasses and put on a warm smile. \"No, I was in my dormitory all last night reviewing my studies.\"","\"Is that so?\" Yu Kexin suddenly raised her phone. \"Then who is this person?\"","On the screen, a clear video captured Sato’s figure, sneaking into the lab. Shortly after, he tucked something away and hurried off.","Sato froze completely.","He had made sure to temporarily disable all surveillance before entering the lab last night and had checked that no one was around before using a duplicated keycard to stealthily slip in. The whole process had gone smoothly.","Why had someone caught this on film?","Yu Kexin smirked.","They had already anticipated that this little Japanese guy might sneak into the lab late at night, so they had installed a hidden, offline surveillance camera in a dark corner.","\"Sato Kenichi!\" the counselor barked angrily. \"What were you doing at the lab in the middle of the night? You’re not involved in any projects, you don’t have lab access—tell me, what were you doing in there!\"","\"I, I...\"","Faced with irrefutable evidence, Sato was dumbfounded.","Rong Yu looked over his desk and deftly pulled out the file he had hidden. \"Aerospace fuel coating heat-resistance experiment data from Base 4. Sato, do you know what this file means?\"","\"It’s a misunderstanding. You’ve all misunderstood,\" Sato said, swallowing hard. \"I just really admire Rong Yu. I wanted to help share some of your burden. I had no other intentions, really, none at all...\"","\"Sato, Huaqing gave you the highest level of treatment as an international student, allocated the best teaching resources—and this is how you repay us? By stealing classified documents?\" The counselor’s voice was icy. \"Your actions violate the principles of international academic exchange. The school will hand you over to the National Security Bureau for investigation...\"","\"No! I didn’t! I didn’t do anything! On what grounds!\" Sato rambled, mixing Chinese and Japanese incoherently. \"This document isn’t top-secret material at all! Absolutely not! Rong Yu, you set me up! I’ve been played by you! You Chinese are just cunning and treacherous... I won’t go to the National Security Bureau! I won’t!\"","\"You duplicated a lab keycard, snuck into the lab late at night, and stole a classified document. You’ve severely violated international regulations. Confess honestly to the National Security Bureau!\" Rong Yu smirked. \"Decades ago, your people coveted China’s territory. Decades later, young people from your Sakura country are coveting China’s technology. If you lack skill, just practice more. Stop resorting to theft—or are you too weak to keep up?\"","Sato howled, \"I’m an international student! I’m a noble from Sakura Country! I have diplomatic immunity!\"","But no one paid him any attention.","---","Three days later, the school issued a notice. Sato Kenichi was expelled from Huaqing University for espionage-related activities. Furthermore, the university would re-examine the qualifications of all international students, especially those from the Sakura Country.","As soon as the notice was released, countless international students erupted in outrage.","An American student: \"On what grounds are you reviewing our files? This is a violation of human rights! An affront to dignity! We American students are doing you a favor by coming to Huaqing!\"","A Korean student: \"We Korean students have always followed the rules! We’re being dragged down by those Sakura Country people this time!\"","A Russian student: \"Our KGB warned you long ago that Sakura Country people can’t be trusted.\"","An African student: \"We Tanzanians are poor but proud. We’re grateful to China for this opportunity to study! Check us—we have nothing to hide!\"","Other Sakura Country students: \"Sato is a disgrace! But reviewing all international students is discrimination...\""]},{"number":330,"title":"Chapter 330: Kenichi Sato Has Been Disowned by His Family","paragraphs":["On Rong Yu's side, even more information came in.","It turned out that Sato was indeed a noble of Cherry Blossom Nation, extremely wealthy, and had long since bribed several staff members of Huaqing University.","The surveillance was sabotaged by these staff members.","Moreover, there was partial evidence suggesting that the incident where the big screen suddenly crashed down during the welcome party might also have been Sato's doing.","No wonder Sato had suddenly confessed that night—it was deliberately to lure her onto the stage. Senior Zhai Weitong nearly got hurt because of her...","The president of Huaqing University had no intention of sweeping this under the rug. He personally issued a statement: \"...Huaqing University expresses the strongest indignation at any act attempting to harm our faculty and students! Sato Kenichi and the forces behind him persecuting our outstanding student constitute a blatant provocation against the entire global academic community... Our university reserves the right to take further measures, including but not limited to terminating all cooperative projects with Cherry Blossom Nation's universities...\"","After the official statement from Huaqing's president was released, a huge uproar erupted in the global academic world.","The Russian Federation was the first to respond: \"Due to a crisis of integrity, we will immediately terminate all joint aerospace materials research with Cherry Blossom Nation!\"","Germany: \"All universities in our country must reexamine all documents of Cherry Blossom Nation's international students!\"","France: \"...\"","The international outcry was too loud.","Cherry Blossom Nation had no choice but to respond.","A diplomat from Cherry Blossom Nation bowed ninety degrees in front of the press, using unprecedented humility: \"The student involved acted purely on personal behalf. Our country has always upheld the purity of academic exchange...\"","The head of the Sato family stepped forward: \"A thousand apologies! Sato Kenichi has been disowned by the family. His actions have nothing to do with the Cherry Blossom Nation government or the Sato Group...\"","Deprived of the protection of both his country and his family, Sato was sent to the National Security Bureau and would face the sanctions of Huaxia Nation.","Yun Xiaoyuan found Rong Yu, his brows deeply furrowed: \"It seems Cherry Blossom Nation already knows your identity, hence why they sent Sato to get close to you. They wanted to nip our country's genius student in the bud. We had originally planned to apply for security personnel for you after the launch of Eagle Eye One, but we can't wait any longer.\"","Rong Yu replied, \"Alright, I'll follow the teacher's arrangements.\"","As the teacher and student were chatting,","Suddenly a voice sounded.","\"Academician Yun!\"","Rong Yu looked up and saw Senior Jiang Dai, a fourth-year student, jogging over from a distance.","Jiang Dai said excitedly, \"Academician Yun, my name is Jiang Dai. I'm a senior and I've passed the direct PhD application. Last year, I had a research topic that you personally guided me on. I felt immensely honored and have always wanted to acknowledge you as my mentor. I earnestly ask you to consider me!\"","Having finally run into Academician Yun at the university, he had to seize this opportunity.","With Academician Yun guiding him, his path to direct PhD admission would be much smoother.","\"I remember you.\" Yun Xiaoyuan said with a smile. \"You are indeed very outstanding, but I don't plan to take on any new students at this stage.\"","Jiang Dai's smile froze on his face, but he persisted: \"I heard that Academician Yun has only one student beside you, and that person is far away in Haicheng. You don't even have any student to help with chores like sorting documents, organizing data, or running errands. I, I can...\"","\"Jiang, you are mistaken.\" Yun Xiaoyuan said plainly. \"Organizing data is the assistant's job; running errands is for the staff. I take on students never for such tasks. As a teacher, I impart knowledge, resolve doubts, and guide the way. When I choose a student, it is to pass on everything I have learned, to find someone who can carry the torch of scientific research. If you truly want to walk this path, you are always welcome to attend my lectures. The doors of science are forever open to those who sincerely seek the truth.\"","Jiang Dai forced out a reply: \"Yes, thank you for your guidance, Academician Yun.\"","Yun Xiaoyuan patted him on the shoulder and walked away from Huaqing.","Before the personnel arranged by the state could arrive at Huaqing, Grandpa Ji had already hired a professional team of bodyguards to lurk along the paths Rong Yu took to and from class.","Before anyone knew it, it was the weekend at the end of November, the day of the grand wedding of Sheng Yun, the young uncle of the Sheng family.","A month before the wedding, Rong Yu had already received the invitation.","The groom: Sheng Yun.","The bride: An Nuo.","Rong Yu knew the name An Nuo—she was a very well-known central television journalist. A few months ago, at Base Four, Rong Yu had briefly met her.","She still remembered that, back then, Sheng Yun was utterly impatient with An Nuo.","Who would have thought they would end up getting married just like that.","Grandpa Ji and Rong Yu attended together in formal attire. Ji Mohan happened to have the day off and was called in to act as their driver.","The Sheng family ranked among the top noble families in the capital. Sheng Yun, that unruly fellow, was finally getting married at the age of thirty-four. The old Madam Sheng had invited nearly half the prominent families in the capital.","\"Great-grandmother, Grandpa, we've arrived.\"","Ji Mohan parked the car and opened the doors for the two elders.","\"Rong Yu, you're here!\" Sheng Ciyuan came running over from a distance to greet them. \"Grandpa Ji is looking so sharp today—looks at least ten years younger!\"","Grandpa Ji straightened his back: \"Of course! I picked this outfit carefully. How about it? Matches Rong Yu's dress nicely, doesn't it?\"","Sheng Ciyuan gave a thumbs-up: \"You two look just like grandfather and granddaughter—closer than blood relatives!\"","Grandpa Ji rolled his eyes.","Grandfather and granddaughter, my foot. It's mother and son.","Ah, forget it. It's impossible to explain things to an idiot!","Rong Yu asked, \"Will your eldest brother come back for the wedding banquet?\"","\"Hard to say,\" Sheng Ciyuan replied. \"If he can finish his mission early, he might make it back.\"","Rong Yu nodded and followed the others inside.","Grandpa Ji pursed his lips.","His mother was too concerned about that Sheng Qingyan fellow. Sigh, when it rains, the mother wants to marry again—there's no stopping it.","He had to start thinking carefully. If his mother really did marry Sheng Qingyan, how would he get along with his future stepfather, and where should he live... Ah, what a worry.","At the Sheng family's entrance, guests were exchanging pleasantries everywhere.","As soon as she walked in, Rong Yu spotted a familiar face—that Lu Jiaojiao, who had once faked being Ah Mo's lifesaver.","Subconsciously, she looked toward Ji Mohan.","Ji Mohan also saw Lu Jiaojiao. He raised both hands in defense: \"I cut ties with her ages ago. Don't look at me...\"","Lu Jiaojiao glared at the woman in front of her, her lips curling in ridicule: \"I say, Ye Weiwana, do you even know what kind of place this is? The Sheng family wedding banquet. A low-life from the bottom of society like you—how dare you show up at an occasion like this?\"","Ye Weiwana stared at Lu Jiaojiao with anger in her eyes.","She and Lu Jiaojiao were both students at Huaqing. Years ago, they had both participated in a host competition. However, just minutes before going on stage, a jade pendant of hers had gone missing. She searched everywhere for it, was delayed, and lost her chance to compete.","Later, some classmates told her they had seen Lu Jiaojiao rifling through her backpack. She went to confront Lu Jiaojiao, but Lu Jiaojiao denied it to her dying breath.","That jade pendant was the only keepsake left by her biological sister. Now it was gone forever.","\"What are you staring at me like that for?\" Lu Jiaojiao lifted Ye Weiwana's skirt hem contemptuously and let out a snort. \"Look at these rough stitches, this cheap synthetic fabric. Wearing street-stall rags, and you still dare to come to a Sheng family banquet?\"","\"Oh, street-stall rags?\"","Rong Yu's voice rang out calmly.","She recognized this girl. Wasn't she the young lady who had saved someone at her old son's birthday banquet a few months ago?","This dress was given to Ye Weiwan by her.","A nude-colored long dress, with no adornments or embellishments on the fabric—at first glance, it indeed seemed unremarkable.","\"This is Balenciaga's haute couture collection from last winter. Only three pieces exist worldwide, priced at four hundred and eighty-seven thousand yuan including tax.\" Rong Yu smiled. \"Whether the dress looks like a street stall item matters little; some people, even wrapped in expensive luxury goods, are nothing but a heap of rotting cotton inside.\"","Lu Jiaojiao looked up.","First she saw Rong Yu, then Ji Mohan. The humiliating memories from half a year ago instantly surged back to her mind. She turned on her heel and walked away."]},{"number":331,"title":"Chapter 331: What other relationships can exist between men and women","paragraphs":["Ye Weiwan looked up and saw Rong Yu and Ji Mohan.","She remembered that last time in Haicheng, she didn’t even have an invitation but still sneaked into the Ji family’s cruise banquet.","She quickly explained, “Miss Rong, Third Master Ji, I really did receive an invitation this time. I happened to meet Madam Sheng by accident, and she warmly invited me. I couldn’t refuse, so I agreed to come along and join in the fun.”","“So you’re Miss Ye.” Sheng Ciyuan shook hands with Ye Weiwan and formally introduced, “Half a month ago, my mother’s car drove into the river. It so happened that Miss Ye was passing by. Without regard for her own safety, she jumped into the river and pulled my mother out of the car. By then, my mother had already lost consciousness. If it weren’t for Miss Ye, my mother might have...”","Ye Weiwan smiled sheepishly. “It was nothing, just a small effort. No need to thank me too much.”","Sheng Ciyuan looked at her with great admiration.","This girl had left immediately after saving his mother. Later, when they reviewed the surveillance footage, it took all the Sheng family’s connections to find out who she was.","He had gone to her home personally to thank her, but she wasn’t there.","Later, his father went there again and brought thank-you gifts, but Ye Weiwan returned them all untouched.","To her, it was simply about saving a life—she didn’t want anything in return.","Sheng Ciyuan said, “Don’t just stand at the door chatting. Let’s go inside.”","Ji Mohan walked up to Ye Weiwan and gave her a thumbs-up. “Miss Ye’s character is truly admirable.”","“I’ve saved at least twenty or so people who fell into water, most of them children,” Ye Weiwan said with a frown. “Especially in the summer—lots of kids go swimming together in the river with no adults around. The accident rate is as high as seventy percent. Schools and society really need to do more water-safety education...”","Ji Mohan nodded in agreement.","He paused, then asked curiously, “I saw you talking to Lu Jiaojiao just now. Do you know each other?”","Ye Weiwan’s voice grew a little colder. “She and I were college classmates.”","“College classmates?” Ji Mohan said in surprise. “Are you also a graduate of Tsinghua?”","Ye Weiwan looked up at him. “Are you, too?”","More and more guests arrived at the Sheng residence, and their conversation deepened.","Rong Yu and the old man were led by Sheng Ciyuan into the living room.","As soon as she walked in, Old Madam Sheng stood up and firmly clasped Rong Yu’s hand. “Miss Rong, the Sheng residence isn’t far from Tsinghua University. Do come visit us when you have time...”","Madam Sheng, Xu Lu, laughed and said, “That’s right, Miss Rong. Old Madam talks about you all the time.”","“Xiao Yu has just started university and is very busy,” Old Master Ji said, changing the subject lightly. “Speaking of which, I heard Madam Sheng was in a car accident recently. How are you feeling these days?”","“Just a bit shaken, nothing serious,” Xu Lu sighed. “But it’s a pity—I had gone to the An family that day to pick something up. Because of the accident, a set of bridal headpieces and jewelry that the An family had passed down since the Qing dynasty was completely crushed. They’re beyond repair. Still, An Nuo didn’t seem to mind.”","Rong Yu asked curiously, “Why did Madam Sheng have to go get the items personally?”","Xu Lu was about to answer.","Suddenly, the courtyard echoed with the sound of gongs and drums.","Old Madam Sheng stood up with her cane. “The bridal party is back! Let’s go to the banquet hall!”","Sheng Ciyuan quickly helped the old lady, and the group walked toward the front courtyard.","A line of wedding cars stopped at the entrance of the Sheng family’s courtyard house. Sheng Yun was the first to step out, wearing a dark red Mandarin suit tailored by hand from an Italian master—a design that preserved the charm of traditional Chinese formalwear while incorporating the clean lines of modern tailoring.","He bent down and carefully helped Anuo out of the car. She was also dressed in a completely handmade Chinese-style wedding gown. The Suzhou embroidery of a phoenix on her skirt seemed ready to take flight with every step, and the pearls and gold ornaments on her headdress complemented each other brilliantly.","Holding Anuo’s hand, Sheng Yun walked down the red carpet and entered the courtyard surrounded by a crowd of guests.","“First bow to Heaven and Earth!”","“Second bow to parents!”","Sheng’s elderly grandmother accepted the tea and suddenly burst into tears.","This youngest son of hers had worried her to no end. He hadn’t studied well as a child, couldn’t hold down a job as an adult, lazed around even during his time in the military, and his love life was a complete mess. By his mid-thirties, he still had no plans to settle down.","She had once thought she might never live to see her youngest son get married.","But unexpectedly, the day had come so soon—and he had married such an outstanding wife.","After the wedding ceremony, the banquet began.","Sheng Yun took Anuo around to toast each table of guests, introducing her to every member of the Sheng family.","Rong Yu was pulled over by Sheng’s grandmother to sit beside her.","Anuo smiled and said, “Miss Rong, we seem to have met before at Base Four, remember?”","“Of course I remember.” Rong Yu raised her glass. “Wishing you a happy marriage.”","Sheng Yun laughed heartily. “Miss Rong, please enjoy the feast. Don’t rush off when the banquet ends—Qingyan will be back later, so you two can meet up.”","Grandpa Ji curled his lips. “We’ve got things to do later...”","Anuo pulled Sheng Yun aside and asked in a low voice, “What’s the relationship between Miss Rong and Qingyan?”","“What else could it be between a man and a woman?” Sheng Yun took her hand. “Come on, let’s keep toasting. This table is for guests on my grandmother’s side...”","After the toasts, Anuo went to change into another gown.","As she passed the Sheng family study, she suddenly paused. Inside the study, Sheng Dian was chatting with a few military and political officials. These high-ranking figures casually exchanged remarks, each one revealing information far beyond what ordinary people could ever access.","Anuo stood at the doorway for about five or six minutes before heading to the bridal chamber.","She wasn’t in a hurry to change clothes. Instead, she pulled out her phone and made a call, chatting for four full minutes before hanging up.","Standing by the window lost in thought, she suddenly heard a noise from outside.","Pulling back the curtain, she saw an elderly man crouched by the wall, feeding a fat cat a fish as long as an arm. The cat had already eaten more than half of it. She had no idea how long the old man had been there.","“Anuo! Are you ready yet?”","A knock at the door came with Sheng Yun’s impatient calls.","Flustered, she changed clothes in a hurry and returned to the banquet with Sheng Yun.","In the Sheng family courtyard, Grandpa Ji was still feeding the cat. The cat was incredibly fat—he could barely lift it. A fish that big would be plenty for a person to eat, yet this cat could devour it in one meal.","Suddenly, he missed Pinecone.","“Mr. Ji, what are you doing out here?” The Sheng family butler came looking for him. “There’s fine tea prepared in the tearoom—shall I take you there?”","Grandpa Ji didn’t refuse and followed him.","The banquet lasted until three in the afternoon. Rong Yu had planned to stay a little longer to wait for Sheng Qingyan.","But when she looked, her younger son was slouched on the sofa, looking exhausted and fast asleep.","She walked over and said softly, “Yingbao, wake up. Let’s go home to sleep...”","Old Master Ji rubbed his eyes and glanced outside. The sun was still blazing. He muttered, “Aren’t we waiting for Sheng Qingyan?”","“No need to wait,” Rong Yu said. “When he’s done with his work, he’ll come find me on his own.”","Old Madam Sheng tried to persuade them to stay, but seeing how utterly worn out Old Master Ji was, she had no choice but to let it go and asked the family head, Sheng Dian, to personally see them out.","As soon as they got into the car, Old Master Ji leaned against Rong Yu’s shoulder and fell asleep."]},{"number":332,"title":"Chapter 332: Yingbao, You Said You Would Live at Least Another Twenty Years","paragraphs":["The car ride was smooth and steady, stopping at the entrance of the Ji family villa.","“Shh.” Rong Yu made a gesture for silence. “Get a few people to carry Grandfather back to his room to rest.”","Butler Yu called over four servants, who carefully lifted the old man and carried him to his room.","It was only four in the afternoon.","Rong Yu turned on some soft music, picked up a book, and sat in the living room to read.","As she read, her heart suddenly began to flutter with an inexplicable unease, as if she had fallen into a bottomless abyss.","She jerked her head toward the master bedroom on the first floor and dashed in without hesitation.","Old Master Ji lay quietly on the bed, his brows relaxed and his expression peaceful—nothing seemed out of the ordinary.","But Yingbao had never needed to take such long naps before...","“Yingbao!”","“Yingbao!”","“Ji Shunying!”","There was no response from the person on the bed.","Rong Yu grabbed his hand and shouted, “Ji Shunying, wake up! It’s me, your mother! Open your eyes!”","“Great-grandma, what’s wrong!”","Ji Mohan heard the commotion and rushed in.","He quickly checked Old Master Ji’s breathing and heartbeat, then let out a sigh of relief. “Great-grandma, the old man is fine. He’s just asleep.”","“A person who’s asleep can be woken up!” Rong Yu took a deep breath. “Call the hospital for an ambulance. Right now. Immediately!”","Ten minutes later, they were at the hospital.","After a series of tests, the doctor gave his conclusion: “We’ve run a full check—ECG, brain CT, blood panel... everything is normal. The old man probably stayed up for a few nights and has fallen into a deep sleep.”","Rong Yu pressed her lips together. “If he’s just asleep, after all these tests, he should have woken up by now.”","“That’s what the current tests show,” the attending physician said, also sensing something off. “Let’s admit him for observation. Monitor his vitals every hour. If anything changes, the hospital can handle it in time...”","This was already one of the top hospitals in the capital.","Rong Yu had her doubts, but for now, there was no other option.","Because of Old Master Ji’s hospitalization, every member of the Ji family rushed over as soon as they could.","Ji Zhiyuan came with Duoduo, Ji Yanting paused his company’s operations, Ji Mohan handed off his data to his assistant, Ji Jingchuan set aside his studies, and Ji Zhouping put his startup on hold.","Ji Zhiyuan said, “Before Great-grandma returned, the old man had fallen into a coma that lasted three months. All his bodily functions were normal. He just woke up when the time was right.”","Ji Yanting added, “That’s right. Back then, the old man would slip into long comas after being triggered by car accidents. It was a psychological condition.”","Ji Mohan said, “Great-grandma, don’t worry. He’ll get better.”","Ji Jingchuan wondered, “But the old man’s psychological condition stemmed from Great-grandma leaving. Now that she’s right here, how could he still be triggered into a coma? Did he eat something wrong at lunch?”","Ji Zhouping countered, “But the doctors thoroughly checked—no sign of food poisoning.”","Rong Yu spoke up. “Don’t rush. Wait until the twelve-hour continuous blood report comes out. Then we’ll see what’s going on.”","Night gradually fell.","Rong Yu reached out to brush aside a wisp of white hair on the old man’s forehead and sighed softly. She knew Yingbao’s character too well. Even in sleep, he maintained a basic alertness. There was no way he would lie there like this—like an empty shell with its soul taken away.","Was it an old, lingering illness?","Or had something new happened?","“Yingbao, you promised to live at least another twenty years. Don’t break your word...”","She sighed gently again.","Just then, footsteps echoed outside the ward.","Rong Yu looked up as the door softly opened, revealing a tall figure standing in the doorway. The hallway’s overhead light cast a long shadow behind him, outlining his figure with a cold, hard edge.","It was Sheng Qingyan.","In his memory, Rong Yu had always been so composed and unflappable. Even during a surprise attack at the base, the most she did was slightly furrow her brow—always graceful.","But now—","Her face was haggard, and her eyes, always clear and bright like winter stars, were now clouded with anxiety and worry.","Sheng Qingyan turned his gaze to the person lying in the bed.","Old Master Ji looked no different from usual, but he was too still—lying there without a trace of life.","He found himself missing that old man who always rolled his eyes at him, always found fault with him, always wanted to see him mess up... that vibrant, energetic elder, who had somehow become someone he cared about.","He spoke softly, “Ayu, can I take a look at the test results?”","Rong Yu nodded and handed them over.","Sheng Qingyan took the thick stack of reports. His slender fingers quickly flipped through the pages, his eyes carefully scanning each piece of data. Where anyone else would have seen perfectly normal numbers, his brows only furrowed deeper.","“Blood oxygen saturation 98%, heart rate 62 beats per minute, blood pressure 120/80...” he murmured, his voice growing colder. “Too perfect.”","Rong Yu’s head shot up. “What do you mean?”","Sheng Qingyan spread several reports flat on the bedside table and pointed at a few key data points. “The human body’s vital signs fluctuate naturally with the circadian rhythm. It’s impossible for them to remain at textbook-standard values for hours on end. This looks like... deliberately engineered numbers.”","Rong Yu’s fingertips trembled. “Are you saying... someone tampered with the test results?”","“No.” Sheng Qingyan’s eyes turned terrifyingly dark. “It’s a toxin that mimics normal human metabolism.”","Rong Yu took a deep breath. “Sheng Qingyan, are you sure? Since when did you know so much about medicine?”","“Three months ago, when the military’s Minister Zhao fell into a coma, his early reports showed these same perfect values. This kind of toxin interferes with diagnostic equipment, so ordinary hospitals can’t detect it.” He placed a hand on her shoulder. “After Minister Zhao died, the military found trace amounts of a convallatoxin derivative in his cerebrospinal fluid. This poison attacks the brain, its concentration rising gradually while always staying within normal range—until death...”","Rong Yu’s head felt heavy.","“The military hospital has already developed a neutralizing antidote. Transfer him now.” Sheng Qingyan dialed a number, gave quick instructions, then looked at Rong Yu and said gently, “Don’t worry. I’ve arranged everything.”","Rong Yu nodded.","If not for this precedent, no one would have imagined that such a poison even existed in this world.","In less than ten minutes, hurried footsteps sounded in the hallway. Three medical staff in dark uniforms pushed in a specialized transfer bed. The lead doctor nodded to Sheng Qingyan. “Captain Sheng, the vehicle is ready.”","Sheng Qingyan stepped forward, bent down, and carefully lifted the unconscious Old Master Ji into his arms—as if holding a baby—before gently laying him onto the transfer bed..."]},{"number":333,"title":"Chapter 333: Is Sheng Qingyan the Reincarnation of His Great-Grandfather","paragraphs":["The lights in the military hospital were exceptionally cold and white.","Rong Yu stood outside the intensive care unit, watching the medical staff bustling inside through the glass window. Old Master Ji had already been injected with an antidote, and his vital signs were gradually stabilizing, but he still hadn't regained consciousness.","Sheng Qingyan stood beside her, his gaze heavy as he stared into the ward: \"The report is out. It's a derivative of convallatoxin, mixed with a trace variant of tetrodotoxin—identical to the previous cases.\"","Rong Yu frowned. \"How many cases were there before?\"","\"Thirteen.\" Sheng Qingyan's jaw tightened. After a moment of silence, he spoke slowly. \"Over the past two years, thirteen high-ranking military officials have been secretly poisoned with this toxin. The symptoms were all the same: first, an inexplicable coma, with hospitals unable to identify the cause, and finally, death in their sleep. Even autopsies found it difficult to detect traces... It wasn't until Minister Zhao died and his family tearfully applied for an autopsy that clues began to emerge.\"","\"The victims were all key personnel responsible for military research and development, intelligence systems, or border defense. The army has been investigating, but the perpetrators have been hiding deep.\"","\"In other words, these incidents are related to national security.\" Rong Yu looked up. \"But the Ji family has only been in business for decades, with no ties to the military or government. Why would Old Master Ji become a target?\"","Sheng Qingyan gently pressed her shoulder. \"I've already arranged for people to check everyone Old Master Ji has come into contact with in the past three days. Don't worry, we will find out. It’s five in the morning now—do you want to get some sleep? I'll stay here and keep watch for you.\"","Rong Yu nodded.","She lay down on the small bed and slept fully clothed.","Sheng Qingyan held her hand with his left hand while gripping Old Master Ji's hand with the other.","He looked at the elderly man still unconscious in the hospital bed, the suspicion growing in his heart... Why did this old man, who had no relation to him, matter so much?","His importance was even no less than Rong Yu's.","He turned his gaze back to Rong Yu.","Since their last separation, he had made a point to visit the Beijing History Museum. That period of history had deeply shaken him, as if he had experienced it firsthand.","He even started having hallucinations.","It felt as though he had been part of that escort team.","The sky gradually brightened.","Rong Yu opened her eyes and immediately looked at the hospital bed. The old man was still unconscious.","Sheng Qingyan looked at her and said softly, \"I've already had breakfast brought in. I need to go to a meeting, but I'll come back later to be with you.\"","He stood up and left the ward.","Rong Yu picked up her phone and found it was blowing up with calls from her five great-grandsons, who had been bombarding her one after another.","She suddenly remembered that when they had transferred hospitals last night, she had forgotten to tell the kids. Seeing the hospital empty, the boys must have gone crazy.","She quickly called Ji Zhiyuan back: \"Zhiyuan, your great-grandfather has been transferred to the First Military Hospital. His condition is stable now. I'm here, don't worry.\"","After hanging up, the attending physician came in for rounds.","\"Normally, the patient should have woken up by morning,\" the doctor said, checking Old Master Ji's condition. \"But since the elderly man is of advanced age, his bodily functions may have been affected. If he doesn't wake up within three hours, we'll run a full systemic test again.\"","This made Rong Yu start worrying again.","She sat by the bed and began telling the old man stories in a gentle voice, just like when she first arrived in this era and used stories to wake up her precious son Yingbao.","Story after story ended.","Old Master Ji showed no reaction at all.","Rong Yu sighed, took his hand, and whispered softly, \"Yingbao, don't just keep sleeping. Open your eyes, and I'll tell you a big secret. Don't you want to know what it is?\"","She began to wonder if she had been wrong.","Earlier, she had worried that Yingbao would lose his composure and cause trouble, so she had kept Sheng Qingyan's true identity hidden from him.","But now...","Yingbao was so old—it was hard for her to accept—he could leave at any moment.","And by leaving, he would never know he had been blessed with both a mother and a father.","\"Have you ever wondered why I'm with Sheng Qingyan?\" Rong Yu's lips curved into a smile. \"His name in his past life was Ji Zheng—your father, whom you never met. Yingbao, your mother has returned, and your father has been reincarnated and come to your side. Wake up, please, okay?\"","The moment she finished speaking—","Old Master Ji on the hospital bed suddenly snapped his eyes open and sat up abruptly: \"Mom, what did you say? What did you just say!\"","At the same time, the medical monitors in the ward started beeping incessantly.","The old man's blood pressure and heart rate had instantly skyrocketed.","She quickly tried to calm him down: \"Lie down first. I'll call the doctor to examine you. When you're feeling better, I'll tell you everything slowly.\"","Old Master Ji began to throw a tantrum: \"No, no, tell me now! Now!\"","Rong Yu was about to speak.","The ward door suddenly burst open, and a crowd rushed in.","They had arrived just moments before their great-grandmother started telling the secret. They had initially wanted to step aside, but they never expected to hear such a bombshell revelation.","Ji Zhiyuan's face was full of shock: \"Great-grandmother, is Sheng Qingyan the reincarnation of our great-grandfather?\"","Ji Yanting's mouth dropped open, completely abandoning his movie star image: \"Wait, how does great-grandma know that this person is great-grandfather's reincarnation?\"","Ji Mohan scratched the back of his head: \"Great-grandmother probably confirmed Sheng Qingyan's identity through some experiment, right? Oh wait, I mean our great-grandfather.\"","Ji Jingchuan calmly said, \"If great-grandmother confirmed it, then there's no mistake.\"","Ji Zhouye slapped himself on the face: \"I was disrespectful to our great-grandfather before... Damn, I really deserve to die...\"","Ji Zhiyuan: \"...\"","Ji Yanting: \"...\"","Ji Mohan: \"...\"","Ji Jingchuan: \"...\"","They all had, at some point, given their great-grandfather dirty looks, thinking he wasn't good enough for their great-grandmother.","The most stunned person of all was Old Master Ji himself.","He grabbed Rong Yu's shoulder: \"Mom, you're joking, right? You must be joking!\"","Rong Yu saw the hope in his eyes.","She gently stroked his white hair and said softly, \"I've confirmed it. Sheng Qingyan is indeed your father reincarnated, but he has no memory of his past life.\"","Old Master Ji sat on the hospital bed, dazed.","He thought of everything that had happened before.","No wonder he cared so much about Sheng Qingyan—Sheng Qingyan was his father.","The word \"father\" was so foreign to him, because his father had died a heroic death while he was still in his mother's womb.","He had grown up without a father. He didn't know what it felt like to have one.","But it would surely be unconditional love and protection, birthday gifts every year, always showing up whenever he was needed...","And actually, he had felt all of that from Sheng Qingyan.","Swallowing hard, Old Master Ji stood up, supported by Ji Zhiyuan: \"Quick, I want to see Sheng Qingyan!\"","Rong Yu laughed in spite of herself: \"Yingbao, he doesn't have his memories. He has no recollection of the past. Don't say anything strange that makes people think the poison damaged your brain.\"","Old Master Ji pursed his lips tightly: \"Then find a way to make him remember. He can't deny me as his son!\""]},{"number":334,"title":"Chapter 334: Is there any way to help Grandpa regain his memory","paragraphs":["There was suddenly the sound of footsteps outside the door.","Sheng Qingyan, dressed in a black civilian suit, had an aura of cold toughness surrounding him, but as soon as he stepped into the hospital room, that chill seemed to melt away like snow in the sun, instantly dissipating.","Seeing Old Master Ji lively and spirited on the hospital bed, his heart, which had been hanging high, finally settled, and a faint smile curled at the corners of his lips. \"Is there anything else bothering you, Old Master Ji?\"","Old Master Ji stared at him blankly.","In fact, a long time ago in Haicheng, back when Sheng Qingyan was still suffering from autism, on the day they first met, he had also stared at Sheng Qingyan for a very long time.","So it turned out that even back then, there was a connection through bloodlines.","The elder stretched out a trembling hand.","Sheng Qingyan immediately supported him.","He had thought that Old Master Ji would, as usual, roll his eyes at him and shake him off.","But unexpectedly, the old man took both of his hands in his own, stood up, and said softly, \"A Yuan, pour me a cup of tea.\"","Ji Zhiyuan knew what the old man intended to do.","He said, \"There's no tea in the hospital room, only water. Will that do?\"","Old Master Ji nodded.","A cup of plain water was handed to him, and he took it solemnly before presenting it to Sheng Qingyan.","Even though Sheng Qingyan had no memory of it,","the soul within his bones was indeed Ji Zheng from over seventy years ago—his own father.","Since his mother had acknowledged this man,","then he must too.","He had been disrespectful before; now he offered tea as an apology and as an act of acknowledging his father.","\"Please, have some tea.\"","When Old Master Ji spoke, Sheng Qingyan was thoroughly startled.","He hadn't met Old Master Ji many times, but each encounter had left a deep impression—because he was always criticized and nitpicked.","He knew the old gentleman didn't like him, but he didn't dare show any discontent. The least he could do was be accommodating.","Never in his wildest dreams had he imagined that someone as old as Old Master Ji would offer him tea.","And yes, it was an offering, not just a handing over.","The difference between the two was very clear.","Sheng Qingyan was taken aback.","Could it be a trick to mess with him?","Was there something wrong with the water?","Should he take it?","He could see through an enemy's intentions at a glance, but he simply couldn't figure out what Old Master Ji was up to.","As he was torn between decisions,","Rong Yu’s voice rang out: \"Sheng Qingyan, if you miss this cup of tea, you'll regret it for a lifetime.\"","Hearing this, Sheng Qingyan immediately bent down and respectfully accepted the cup of plain water from Old Master Ji's hands with both hands. \"Thank you.\"","The moment he drank it down in one gulp,","Old Master Ji’s wrinkled face broke into a satisfied smile.","Sheng Qingyan inexplicably felt as though something in his own heart had also been filled, accompanied by a strange sense of fulfillment.","\"All of you, come over...\" The old man beckoned. \"One by one, from oldest to youngest, offer tea to Mr. Sheng.\"","The Ji brothers exchanged glances.","Since both elders had acknowledged this, then they indeed owed Sheng Qingyan a cup of tea as respect.","The five grandsons of the Ji family lined up in a row—no, six, including the youngest, Duoduo, who also raised a cup of water and handed it to Sheng Qingyan.","Sheng Qingyan was baffled.","He looked at Rong Yu as if pleading for an explanation of what was going on.","Rong Yu pressed her forehead. \"You saved Old Master Ji, so by rights the Ji family should offer you tea. Just drink it; it's fine.\"","Sheng Qingyan could only chug down cup after cup.","After downing seven cups of water in total, he could hear the water sloshing inside him just by walking.","He grabbed Rong Yu's hand. \"A Yu, come outside for a moment...\"","Once outside, this usually stern-faced man lowered his voice and asked, \"A Yu, why does the look in the eyes of the Ji family members—grandfather and grandsons alike—seem so strange? Do you know why?\"","It was deeply unsettling to him.","Rong Yu looked at him seriously. \"I'll say it again: Do you believe in past lives? If you do, then perhaps the Ji family were your family in a previous life...\"","While they were talking in the hallway, inside the hospital room, the Ji family gathered in a circle and whispered among themselves.","Old Master Ji said, \"If anyone can come up with a way to help your great-grandfather regain his memory, that person gets a reward of 100 million. Of course, I don't have any money—you'll have to collect it from your great-grandmother.\"","Ji Zhiyuan said, \"If everyone who was reincarnated could remember their past lives, the world would be in chaos. I think the possibility of recovering memory is close to zero.\"","Ji Yanting said, \"According to the laws of movies, a severe blow to the head has a high probability of jogging memory. Maybe we could stage an accident.\"","Ji Mohan said, \"From a scientific standpoint, memory is formed by synaptic connections between neurons. According to the latest research on neural plasticity, by reconstructing specific environmental cues, it's possible to reactivate dormant neural pathways.\"","Ji Jingchuan said, \"But the memory nerves in this body of our great-grandfather haven’t experienced anything from seventy years ago. I vaguely recall our great-grandmother mentioning that great-grandfather loved fishing—he was a fishing expert and took her fishing every weekend. I think we could recreate the scenes from over seventy years ago to help jog his memory.\"","Ji Zhousai said eagerly, \"Fourth Brother’s idea is great! Great-grandfather was always busy with special forces duties, and he’s free today. Come on, let’s go fishing right now!\"","Old Master Ji laughed slyly. \"After the fishing, we’ll head back to the hospital and let your great-grandfather cook for us himself. I’d like to taste what my father's cooking was like!\"","Just as they were plotting,","the hospital room door opened, and Sheng Qingyan found himself facing several pairs of eager eyes inside. He instinctively stepped back. \"Ahem... I'll go ask the attending physician when we can be discharged from the hospital.\"","\"Great-grand... I mean, Mr. Sheng!\" Ji Zhousai grabbed his arm. \"Come fishing with us.\"","Ji Zhiyuan smiled and said, \"I've already had someone buy fishing gear and find a good spot. Mr. Sheng, why not come along and relax?\"","Sheng Qingyan didn’t want to go.","There were still too many things to take care of, Old Master Ji was still hospitalized, and the culprit behind the scenes hadn’t been caught yet.","He was about to refuse when","Duoduo’s soft little hand tugged at his pinky finger, gently swaying it back and forth, and her voice was sweet and tender. \"Uncle Sheng, please say yes. Duoduo loves eating fish the most, and Auntie loves fish too—grilled fish, fish soup, braised fish, fish balls... Mmm, they’re really super delicious...\"","\"Say yes, say yes.\" Ji Zhousai wrapped his other arm around Rong Yu. \"Great-grand... ah, I mean Miss Rong, you have to come too!\"","Old Master Ji also wanted to go, but the toxins in his body hadn’t been fully cleared, and the real culprit might still be lurking near the hospital, so he couldn’t leave the military hospital just yet.","He instructed, \"A Yuan, A Yan, A Mo, A Chuan, A Ye—don’t be naughty. Be sensible and take good care of Mr. Sheng and Miss Rong...\"","The five of them nodded in unison.","With Ji Zhiyuan making the arrangements, everything went smoothly.","Half an hour later, a group of seven was sitting by the edge of a pond.","The water sparkled under the sunlight, and fish leaped out of the surface. If you ignored the distant skyscrapers and just looked at the scene before them, it truly felt like a fleeting moment from over seventy years ago.","As Rong Yu was lost in thought,","Sheng Qingyan also seemed momentarily stunned.","He had gone fishing with Rong Yu before, but back then he was still suffering from autism, drifting through life in a fog. Now, however, he could clearly sense that he seemed to be a natural-born fisherman. Just as naturally as he was a born sniper."]},{"number":335,"title":"Chapter 335: What's Wrong with a Little Hand-Holding and Affection","paragraphs":["The five Ji brothers weren’t really fishing seriously.","They held their rods, but their eyes kept drifting toward Sheng Qingyan and Rong Yu.","Whenever Rong Yu and Sheng Qingyan held hands, Ji Zhuye would start snapping photos manically, whooping and hollering, until he was dragged away by Ji Mohan and Ji Yanting.","Even the usually composed Ji Zhiyuan and Ji Jingchuan couldn’t help sneaking glances, sitting quietly on the sidelines, occasionally getting a mouthful of the lovey-dovey display from their great-grandparents.","Under the intense stare of so many bright, eager eyes, Sheng Qingyan felt like he was sitting on pins and needles.","Rong Yu let out a soft sigh.","When she first found out Sheng Qingyan was Ji Zheng, she had also chosen to take him fishing, hoping it would jog his memory.","But it turned out to be useless.","After all this time, she had long accepted the situation as it was.","In this peaceful era, this golden age of peace, to start afresh and have a quiet, simple romance—wasn’t that nice too?","Rong Yu simply enjoyed the rare moment of leisure.","In less than an hour, two buckets were filled to the brim with lively, flipping big fish.","The group hurried back to the hospital.","Grandpa Ji’s room was a special luxury suite—a private room with a guest room and a kitchen, fully equipped with all the cookware.","When they came back carrying the live fish, the previously listless Grandpa Ji immediately sat up in bed: “You’re finally back! Wow, more than a dozen fish—enough for all of us to eat our fill!”","Like a playful old child, ignoring the IV drip on the back of his hand, he crouched down to grab a big fish. The fish slipped from his hand, flopped onto the floor, and skittered around wildly.","Sheng Qingyan stomped on the fish’s head, instantly stunning it into submission. He picked it up: “I’ll go to the kitchen and prepare dinner.”","Ji Zhuye rolled up his sleeves: “I’ll... I’ll help!”","Grandpa Ji grabbed a pillow and smacked it into his face: “You’d be lucky if you didn’t just cause trouble, let alone help. Go sit over there, out of the way.”","Ji Zhiyuan cleared his throat: “Last month, I visited Dr. Wen’s house and helped her clean fish. I’m up for this job.”","He put on gloves, picked up the knife with precision, and said seriously, “Dr. Wen said that cutting at an angle preserves the fish’s tenderness the best...”","The fish suddenly flicked its tail, splashing water all over his face with a loud slap.","Duoduo covered her mouth and giggled: “Haha, Daddy got bullied by the big fish!”","Ji Yanting was tasked with peeling garlic; however, his slender fingers weren’t great at the job, and he even broke a sweat on his forehead.","Ji Mohan was busy chopping scallions and chili peppers. Chopping wasn’t difficult, but he forgot he had cut the peppers and rubbed his eyes directly, causing him to yelp in pain and hop around.","Ji Jingchuan was shaping fish balls, handling it with no stress at all.","Sheng Qingyan stood by the stove, his movements fluid and natural, like an innate talent.","He scored the fish’s body, heated oil to sizzling, fried the scallions, ginger, and garlic until fragrant, slid the fish meat into the pan, and with a loud crackle, the aroma instantly filled the entire room.","Duoduo peeked through the kitchen door, her big eyes sparkling: “Wow, Uncle Sheng is amazing! It smells so good. It’s definitely going to taste awesome!”","Grandpa Ji sniffed the air, unable to resist stepping closer.","He remembered that when he was very, very little, his mother had said his father could do everything—he could handle a gun and a spatula. His father’s cooking stayed in his mother’s memory for a lifetime.","He never expected that, in his lifetime, he would get to taste his father’s cooking.","What a lucky child he was in this world—as long as both his parents were around, even an old man could act like a kid.","An hour and a half later, the full fish feast was laid out on the table.","Steamed fish, the flesh as white as jade, with green scallions scattered on top for garnish.","Sweet-and-sour fish, golden and crispy, with sugar threads pulled into crystalline arcs.","Milky white fish soup, the broth as pale as snow, its fragrance wafting straight into the nostrils.","Handmade fish balls...","The hospital’s dining table was too small; ten dishes were a bit too much to fit, and there were only four seats around it.","Old Master Ji sat down, settling Duoduo onto his lap, then pulled Rong Yu and Sheng Qingyan to sit on his left and right. \"I can't wait to taste what it's like,\" he said.","Sheng Qingyan cleared his throat. \"This is the first time I’ve cooked as far back as I can remember. I hope everyone will forgive any shortcomings.\"","Ji Zhiyuan bent down to serve soup to the elders.","Old Master Ji was the first to pick up his chopsticks. The moment the fish touched his tongue, the old man’s eyes widened in surprise.","Duoduo tugged at his sleeve impatiently. \"Great-grandpa, is it good?\"","Ji Zhouye grabbed a meatball, blew on it to cool it down, and popped it into the little girl’s mouth. \"Try it yourself and you’ll know.\"","\"Mmm!\" The little girl’s grape-like eyes went wide. \"Oh my gosh, it’s so delicious, I could swallow my own tongue!\"","Rong Yu picked up her bowl. The milky white fish soup rose in a mist of steam. She blew on it gently, took a sip, and the moment the soup touched her tongue, her movements suddenly froze.","This taste...","It was exactly the same as the taste in her distant memories.","Her hand trembled, and some of the hot white soup splashed onto the back of her hand.","\"Careful, it’s hot.\"","Sheng Qingyan took her hand and blew on it softly.","The five grandsons of the Ji family, who had been too busy savoring the food to pay attention, now nudged each other, winking and grinning as they all turned to look at Rong Yu and Sheng Qingyan.","\"Ah Yuan, are you having a facial spasm? Ah Yan, where are your eyes looking? Hey, Ah Mo, why are you taking photos? Ah Chuan, stop messing around. Ah Ye, why are you squeezing in so close? Get lost!\" Old Master Ji scolded them impatiently. \"If you lot have nothing better to do, go deliver the leftover fish soup to the patients in the other wards instead of hanging around here getting in the way.\"","His parents had been reunited after so long apart. Was it so wrong for a legitimate married couple to hold hands and show a little affection? These towering grandsons standing around were ruining the atmosphere!","Ji Zhouye protested, \"We haven’t even had any yet! Why give it to others?\"","Old Master Ji shot him a glare. \"Then you can all squat in the hallway outside and eat there...\"","Ji Jingchuan said, \"Someone should stay here to look after Grandpa. Can I stay to serve the dishes and rice?\"","The family was in the middle of their lively banter when footsteps sounded at the door.","The voice of Old Madam Sheng drifted in. \"Oh, how lively. Old Master Ji, surrounded by your grandsons, all so dutiful and staying by your bedside. Truly enviable.\"","Old Master Ji immediately dropped his casual demeanor and stood up. \"Old Madam Sheng, what brings you here?\"","\"I heard early this morning from Yan’er that you were hospitalized, so of course I had to come visit.\" Old Madam Sheng stepped inside, accompanied by someone else—An Nuo, who had just been married yesterday.","An Nuo wore an elegant cheongsam, paired with a beige shawl, radiating a poised and graceful air.","\"This is a premium nourishing supplement that can help strengthen the body,\" she said, placing the gift box she carried by the bedside. With concern, she added, \"Yesterday, Old Master Ji attended the wedding banquet and suddenly fell ill after returning home. Could it be that he ate something he shouldn’t have at the feast?\"","Old Master Ji frowned. \"I ate the same things as everyone else. Why would I be the only one to get poisoned?\"","Ano paused, her fingers stilling. \"Are you sure it's poison?\"","\"Almost certain.\" Sheng Qingyan rubbed his fingers together, his gaze fixed on Ano's face. \"The military has already identified the composition ratio of this toxin. They can clear the remaining poison from the body within three days.\""]},{"number":336,"title":"Chapter 336: Originally, no one suspected you.","paragraphs":["After staying in the hospital room for half an hour, Old Madame Sheng got up and left.","Just as she reached the hospital entrance, Anuo said, \"Mom, a friend asked me to help with something, so I need to go handle it first.\"","She watched Old Madame Sheng’s car drive away and immediately hailed a taxi. The car drove smoothly to a hotel in the city center, where a banquet was being held.","She presented her VIP card and walked straight in.","The place was crowded with guests, and no one noticed her arrival.","\"Over here!\"","A woman on the spiral staircase waved.","Anuo walked over in her high heels, smiling as she greeted her. \"Miss Lu, that dress is really stunning on you today.\"","Lu Jiaojiao handed her a glass of wine. \"Reporter An... no, I should call you Mrs. Sheng now. Congratulations on your marriage. Come on, let’s go upstairs and talk slowly.\"","The two entered a lounge.","As soon as she stepped inside, Anuo pulled out a device that looked like a detection lamp from her handbag. She scanned the room thoroughly, confirming there were no hidden surveillance cameras, before finally sitting down in relief.","Lowering her voice, she said, \"Miss Lu, you wanted to get into Japan’s top materials research institute, right? The opportunity has come.\"","Lu Jiaojiao immediately sat up straight.","Nearly a year ago, she had been branded a \"scholarly seductress,\" her reputation destroyed, and she was nailed to the pillar of shame in the scientific research community.","She had been learning since she could remember—studying hard, working tirelessly. The only thing she was truly good at was research. But she was no longer welcome in the academic circle, and to her family, she had lost all value.","Her father constantly assessed her with a calculating gaze, as if estimating how much she could be sold for.","When she had no way out, she met Anuo.","Anuo had introduced her to a Japanese investor who had founded a pharmaceutical factory in China. Her job was to assist the factory with various data analysis and research.","That investor became her protector, temporarily preventing the Lu family from forcing her into marriage.","If she could go to Japan and enter the largest materials research institute there, she could rebuild her future.","\"This is a new type of medication, but its formula has been cracked, so it needs an upgrade. Here’s a copy of the medical record I transcribed for your research,\" Anuo said calmly. \"If you can complete this task, I’ll help you establish a foothold in Japan’s scientific research circle.\"","Lu Jiaojiao was overjoyed.","This was exactly her area of expertise.","She grabbed Anuo’s hand excitedly. \"Really?\"","Anuo gently pulled her fingers away. \"Only if you can do it. Alright, I have to go...\"","Before she could finish,","suddenly, there was a knock at the door.","\"Knock, knock!\"","Two soft taps, and Anuo felt an inexplicable unease.","In the past, she would have sat there calmly, no matter who was at the door, and handled it with ease.","But for some reason, she was deeply unsettled.","She whispered, \"Whoever it is, send them away.\"","Lu Jiaojiao nodded and raised her voice. \"Who is it? What do you want? I’m resting in here!\"","The knocking persisted.","Frowning, Lu Jiaojiao walked to the door and peered through the peephole. She saw a familiar face—Rong Yu.","She turned back and murmured, \"It’s nothing to do with you. Just an old acquaintance of mine.\"","She yanked the door open and leaned against the frame. \"Miss Rong, a busy person like you actually has time to attend such a low-class banquet? What do you want?\"","Rong Yu’s lips were cold. \"Step aside.\"","She grabbed Lu Jiaojiao by the arm and pulled her to the side.","Lu Jiaojiao shouted angrily, \"This is my private lounge! What do you think you’re doing? Let go of me! Security—\"","Before she could finish,","suddenly, a gust of wind struck from her left, and something ice-cold pressed against her temple.","She turned her head in disbelief.","A gun.","It was a gun!","Her legs went weak with terror, and she nearly collapsed to the floor.","Sheng Qingyan pressed the gun to her head and forced her to step backward into the lounge.","Anuo had been calmly sipping tea when she looked up and saw Sheng Qingyan walk in. Even for someone as composed as her, it felt like someone had grabbed her by the throat.","\"Qingyan, what brings you here?\" She forced a smile, instantly regaining her composure. \"Are you and Miss Rong here for the banquet too?\"","\"Aunt.\"","Sheng Qingyan toyed with the gun, his voice flat and chilling. Despite the intimate title, it sent a shiver down Anuo’s spine.","\"To be honest, no one suspected you at first.\"","His voice was icy.","Three hours ago, he had obtained a list from the military of everyone who had come into contact with Old Master Ji over the past three days—more than two hundred people, most of whom had brief interactions at the Sheng family wedding banquet.","The military had spent over ten hours screening everyone, finally narrowing it down to two suspicious names.","He had been planning to approach those two individuals.","But instead, Anuo had come straight to him.","In Old Master Ji’s hospital room, Anuo had acted very naturally—asking about his condition naturally, picking up the medical record naturally... but it was all too natural, and that made it unnatural.","He had deliberately let a bit of information slip.","And sure enough, Anuo had immediately separated from Old Madame Sheng and rushed here alone.","Who would have thought that on the second floor of a banquet hall with hundreds of people, an intelligence exchange was taking place? What a perfect choice of venue.","\"Anuo!\" Sheng Qingyan dropped the formal address. \"Come with me. You need to cooperate with a military investigation!\"","Anuo was incredulous. \"Sheng Qingyan, what have I done that you need to detain me? I was just sitting in a lounge chatting with a friend. Is that a crime? You need evidence to arrest someone. Do you have any?\"","\"There is no evidence yet, but according to the National Emergency Security Law...\" Sheng Qingyan said coldly, \"When there is a significant threat to national security, the military has the authority to place high-risk individuals under 24-hour temporary supervision to prevent the leakage of critical intelligence.\"","\"I’m just an ordinary person. Since when did I become a threat to national security?\" Anuo trembled with anger. \"I’m a CCTV journalist, the eldest daughter of the An family, the wife of your uncle, your elder. Don’t you fear retribution for slandering me like this?\"","Rong Yu scoffed. \"You poisoned an eighty-year-old man. Don’t you fear retribution?\"","Although there was no direct evidence,","once a suspect was identified, investigating around them would surely uncover clues.","Sheng Qingyan pulled out handcuffs from behind his waist and walked toward Anuo step by step.","Anuo straightened up, her voice calm. \"Don’t touch me. I’m already carrying the Sheng family’s bloodline.\"","\"It’s just a trip to the military headquarters for some questioning. Being pregnant changes nothing.\" Sheng Qingyan locked the cold handcuffs onto her wrists, then turned his icy gaze to Lu Jiaojiao, who was trembling on the floor. \"You’d better pray that you’re clean. Otherwise, your fate won’t be any better than Anuo’s!\"","Lu Jiaojiao felt as though a bucket of ice water had been poured over her, leaving her frozen to the bone."]},{"number":337,"title":"Chapter 337: No, we must have overlooked something.","paragraphs":["An Nuo was temporarily detained by the military for twenty-four hours.","The military retrieved her files and promptly sent them to the Special Operations Division.","Sheng Qingyan stared at the documents, his brow deeply furrowed.","An Nuo had gone abroad to study at the age of eight, heading to the Lighthouse Country. She didn’t return until after graduating with a master’s degree.","The An family was considered a major clan in the capital. Through their influence, An Nuo secured a position at the Central Media Station. Starting as an intern, she worked her way up and was now the station’s leading figure, frequently hosting major interviews.","Since childhood, she had been a model girl—excellent grades, no need for her family to worry. After entering the workforce, she was diligent and hardworking; all her colleagues spoke highly of her.","At an event last year, she met Sheng Yun.","At the time, Sheng Yun had just come out of a relationship and pursued An Nuo with fervent passion.","Her nearly thirty years of life showed nothing out of the ordinary. The trajectory was much like any other Chinese student who had studied abroad.","“Qingyan, this might really be a mistake,” said a comrade in military uniform, patting Sheng Qingyan on the shoulder. “We’ve checked. She really is pregnant. That baby in her belly is your own nephew. Let her go.”","“Twenty-four hours aren’t up yet. We wait,” Sheng Qingyan said in a low voice. “Have we investigated everyone close to An Nuo?”","The other man nodded. “We’ve gone through everyone. No issues. All interactions with An Nuo were normal. As for that Lu family illegitimate daughter, Lu Jiaojiao, she’s known An Nuo for less than half a year. Their relationship is decent, meeting from time to time. An Nuo recommended Lu Jiaojiao for a position at a pharma company invested in by a Sakura Country firm. The company is fully compliant. We can’t detain her just because of nationality, can we?”","Sheng Qingyan tapped his fingers on the table. “No. We must be missing something...”","He sent the file to Rong Yu.","He was a rough man, not quick-witted.","So he let the naturally intelligent handle it.","Rong Yu took every name and address mentioned in the file and wrote them all on a blackboard. She drew lines connecting them, organizing every logical thread with crystal clarity. Even so, nothing stood out.","It wasn’t that the military lacked intelligence; it was that An Nuo showed absolutely no signs of suspicion.","Could An Nuo really be innocent?","She didn’t believe it.","But...","If An Nuo were a spy, how would she be transmitting information?","Rong Yu’s eyes locked onto one name: Lu Jiaojiao.","It was six in the evening. The city lights flickered to life as traffic surged through the streets. Capital City was in the midst of rush hour, alive with noise and bustle.","Lu Jiaojiao paced back and forth in her apartment.","In her mind, she kept seeing Sheng Qingyan’s icy glare when he left. Fear kept churning inside her.","She knew An Nuo wasn’t ordinary.","But exactly what she was, Lu Jiaojiao didn’t know.","All she knew was that An Nuo could help her, so she only felt gratitude toward her.","But now, An Nuo had been taken away.","Would it be her turn next?","Lu Jiaojiao replayed every moment she had spent with An Nuo. She only handled data analysis for a pharma company invested in by the Sakura Country—surely that wasn’t illegal?","She hurriedly searched online. Over three to four hundred Chinese nationals were employed at that company. She let out a breath of relief.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Loud pounding on the door startled her so badly she nearly jumped. She took a deep breath, crept to the peephole, and saw her father outside.","Ever since her scandal broke, the Lu family had put her on the shelf, waiting for a good proposal. Furious, she had moved out of the Lu house into this apartment and never returned. With the protection of that pharma company, her father hadn’t dared to force her back. But what brought him here today?","She opened the door.","As it swung open, she saw someone standing next to her father: Rong Yu.","Why is this Rong Yu such a persistent ghost?","Lu Jiaojiao’s heart pounded wildly, racing out of control. She stepped back and tried to slam the door shut.","But her father blocked it with his foot. Then, a gust of wind swept past, and a loud slap landed hard across Lu Jiaojiao’s face.","“Dad, what did I do to deserve—”","Before she could finish, her father struck her again with the back of his hand. At the same time, he grabbed her by the hair, dragged her across the floor, and threw her onto the living room floor.","Rong Yu followed inside, turning to close the door behind her.","She picked up a data analysis textbook from the coffee table on the living room’s center table, sat down leisurely on the sofa, and began to read.","Lu Jiaojiao’s father glared at her, teeth clenched. “You’ve already disgraced the Lu family, and now you bring disaster? How did I end up with a bastard like you? If murder weren’t a crime, I would’ve killed you by now!”","“What—what disaster did I bring?” Lu Jiaojiao’s head spun. “Dad, whether you like it or not, I am your biological daughter. Half of your blood runs through me. How can you twist everything around based on just a few words from that bitch Rong Yu, and try to destroy me?”","Her father’s fury boiled over.","Just a few hours ago, from all sides—online and offline, domestically and overseas—major consortiums—the Ji family, the Hai family, the Si family, the Tang family, the Zhou family, the Sheng family—had simultaneously launched a brutal assault on the Lu family’s business. Major celebrities endorsing Lu family products had suddenly announced they were terminating their contracts. A social media influencer had even fabricated stories against the Lu family, setting off a storm of public outrage online. Without warning, the Lu family had become a target for everyone.","Even the most powerful family in the capital couldn’t withstand this level of collective punishment.","When he was at his wits’ end, this Miss Rong arrived on behalf of those consortiums.","Rong Yu tightened her lips.","She rarely resorted to underhanded methods.","But now, she had no time for niceties.","She needed to extract what she wanted from Lu Jiaojiao as fast as possible.","And after all, only family knows where a person’s weakness lies.","Lu Jiaojiao’s father spoke, each word deliberate: “Lu Jiaojiao, once, because you were outstanding, I added your name to the family genealogy and also had your mother’s grave moved into the Lu family ancestral cemetery. If you refuse to confess, then I’ll have someone dig up your mother’s coffin and scatter her ashes to the wind!”","Lu Jiaojiao’s eyes instantly turned bloodshot. “Don’t you dare touch my mother’s grave!”","“Then you will cooperate fully with Miss Rong’s interrogation!” Her father gave her a vicious kick, then turned and walked back to stand beside Rong Yu, speaking deferentially. “Miss Rong, you may ask whatever you need now.”","Rong Yu wore a complicated expression.","She had never expected that someone like Lu Jiaojiao, who had clawed her way up by stepping on others, would have a weakness like this: her late mother.","For the sake of her mother’s ashes, she was willing to give in to anything.","Rong Yu began, “The chairman of that Sakura Country-invested pharma company—he and An Nuo aren’t close friends. So why, when An Nuo recommended you, did he immediately let you take a core role at the company?”","Lu Jiaojiao bit her lip so hard it nearly bled.","Rong Yu let out a faint smile, looking straight into her eyes. “What’s the matter? Not convenient to tell me?”"]},{"number":338,"title":"Chapter 338: What Are the Benefits of Marriage for Me","paragraphs":["Lu Jiaojiao didn’t want to say anything.","But when she turned her head, she saw her father open a photo on his phone. It was the scene from when they had moved her late mother’s grave.","If she continued to defy him, her father would follow through on his threat and make sure her mother couldn’t rest in peace even in death.","She lowered her head. “Anuo was only responsible for introducing me to Matsumoto and arranging for us to meet. She doesn’t have much influence with him... Matsumoto was satisfied with me. We’re both superior and subordinate, and it’s also a kept relationship.”","“You slut!” Lu’s father grabbed a book from the coffee table and threw it at her. “The Lu family arranged a marriage for you, but you refused it, and now you’re going off to be someone’s mistress? You’ve disgraced the entire Lu family...”","“Why do I have to get married? What good would marriage do me?” Lu Jiaojiao stiffened her neck. “Marriage would only be a shackle. Matsumoto is just a stepping stone for me to move up. So what if I’m a mistress? At least I’m free. I won’t be drained dry by a husband’s family. My future life could have endless possibilities...”","Her father wanted to hit her again.","But Rong Yu stopped him with a cold glare.","“I’ve got time to waste with you. Take your time thinking. Don’t rush.”","She crouched down. “Every time you meet with Anuo, you immediately meet with Matsumoto afterward. Tell me, what did you talk about with him?”","Lu Jiaojiao was on the verge of collapse. “We didn’t talk about anything! Just between a man and a woman, sometimes work... really nothing important! Miss Rong, I’m begging you to let me go! Anuo and I are just ordinary friends. I don’t know what she’s done wrong. I only know She probably has some connections in Sakura Country that can get me into the Sakura National Materials Lab... Please don’t use my father to go after me. I swear, I’ll never show up in front of you again. Please just let me off, okay?”","“No.” Rong Yu lifted her chin. “There’s definitely something else about Anuo that you haven’t told me.”","Lu Jiaojiao’s tears streamed down. “I’ve already said everything. I’ve told you everything. I wouldn’t dare hide anything. If you’re capable, go interrogate her. Why do you have to force me, an innocent person... I really don’t know anything.”","Rong Yu sat back down on the sofa. “I’ve got time to waste with you. Take your time thinking. Don’t rush.”","She wasn’t in a hurry.","But Lu’s father was almost going mad from anxiety.","The Lu family’s corporate group couldn’t afford to delay any longer.","He glared darkly at Lu Jiaojiao. “Even if it’s just the tiniest bit about Anuo, you have to say it—especially the little details you usually overlook. If you can’t give Miss Rong the information she wants, you know the consequences!”","Lu Jiaojiao had no choice but to force herself to think.","Over an hour later, she suddenly lifted her head. “I remember now! When Anuo introduced me to Matsumoto, I vaguely overheard them talking. Matsumoto said that Anuo looked completely different from when she was a child. They must have met over a decade ago...”","Rong Yu’s lips relaxed slightly.","Now she knew where the problem lay.","Twenty-four hours passed in a flash.","At the entrance of the detention facility, a group of people stood waiting.","Anuo’s mother was trembling with anger. “My daughter just married into the Sheng family on her first day, and you Sheng people personally sent her to the military for detainment? Your Sheng family has gone too far!”","Sheng Yun’s face was rigid. “Naturally, because she was suspicious, so we...”","“Slap!” Anuo’s father raised his hand and struck him across the face. “My daughter graduated from a top university, was a host for the National Central Television, and was more than a match for a delinquent like you. She’s just become pregnant and was going to surprise you, and yet you could stand by and watch her be locked up? You’re unworthy of being her husband!”","Sheng Dian’s face was grim. “President An, this is the military handling a case according to the law, without regard for personal relationships.”","“Fine talk of ‘without regard for personal relationships’!” Anuo’s mother’s voice was trembling. “Our Anuo has been a good girl since childhood. Her life trajectory is spotless. She started working as a host abroad before graduating, and came back to the National Central Television immediately. She’s always lived under everyone’s gaze. How could she possibly be a spy? What spy would choose such a career?”","“The An family has been providing basic supplies to the government since the 1970s,” Anuo’s father said, tears streaming. “We’ve donated tens of millions in various disaster relief efforts. The An family has never wronged our country, and yet you’ve taken away our only daughter... If anything happens to our Anuo, I will never let a single member of the Sheng family off!”","Xu Lu quickly said, “Right now, it’s just an investigation. It’s still under investigation. Please don’t panic, both of you...”","Just then.","The door before them opened.","Sheng Qingyan walked out of the military detention room with Anuo.","Anuo looked haggard. As soon as she saw her family, tears burst from her eyes, and she threw herself into her mother’s arms. “Mom...”","Her mother hugged her tightly. “Are you okay? Did they hurt you? Do you need to go to the hospital?”","Anuo sobbed softly. “I’m fine... It’s all been cleared up. It was a misunderstanding...”","“You Sheng people heard that, didn’t you? It was a misunderstanding!” Anuo’s father’s eyes blazed with even more fury. “You, Sheng Yun, don’t even have the ability to protect your own wife! You, Sheng Qingyan, show no respect for your elders! Your Sheng family has no sense of right and wrong! My family can’t afford to be in-laws with you! I’m going back to have the lawyers draft a divorce agreement...”","“No, I don’t want a divorce...” Anuo’s voice trembled. “I’m already pregnant. I can’t let my child grow up without a father.”","Sheng Yun stepped forward. “Father-in-law, mother-in-law, I promise you that from now on, I will protect Anuo...”","“Shut up! You’re unworthy!” Anuo’s mother glared at her daughter with disappointment and anger. “Can’t you have some spine? The Sheng family treated you like a criminal suspect and locked you up for a whole day and night. Tomorrow, they’ll find some small mistake and drag you to court again. You and your child will never earn any respect in this family. Don’t you understand that?”","Anuo wiped her tears. “I’m not getting a divorce. I’m just not getting a divorce...”","“Why won’t you listen to us adults?” Anuo’s father looked completely baffled. “What’s so good about Sheng Yun that you’re willing to go through this humiliation?”","“Do you think she’d just walk away now that she’s finally made it into the Sheng family?”","A cold, clear female voice came from behind the crowd.","Everyone turned around to see Rong Yu standing there, holding a file folder in her hand. Her black ponytail was crisp and neat. Her white shirt was spotless. Her striking features were calm to the point of being icy.","When he saw her, the tight lines around Sheng Qingyan’s brows instantly softened.","He strode over and stood beside Rong Yu.","“Who are you?” Anuo’s mother frowned.","Anuo’s father stared at her. “What do you mean by that?”","Rong Yu’s voice sounded as if it came straight from a freezer. “Her goal was to get into the heart of the Sheng family. Why would she give that up just by getting divorced?”","From the moment Rong Yu appeared, Anuo’s eyelids had been twitching violently. She cried out, “It was Sheng Yun who pursued me! Sheng Yun who proposed to me! I never schemed to marry into the Sheng family! Rong Yu, I’ve never crossed you. Why do you insist on slandering me like this!”","Anuo’s mother pulled her daughter behind her protectively.","Rong Yu pulled a stack of documents from the file folder. “Madam An, the person you’re protecting right now might very well be the murderer of your own biological daughter!”","Anuo’s mother froze. “What murder? What killer? What on earth are you talking about?”"]},{"number":339,"title":"Chapter 339: What does the child in your belly have to do with me","paragraphs":["“Enough! How much more are you going to humiliate my daughter?”","An father’s face was livid with fury.","Rong Yu handed him a file. “Whether it’s humiliation or not, shouldn’t you take a look first, President An?”","An father flipped it open, scanned it rapidly, and nearly fainted.","“What?”","“How is this possible?”","“No... I don’t believe it. I don’t...”","Rong Yu spoke calmly. “As you can see, the An Nuo standing before you is not your biological daughter. The real An Nuo went abroad to study at age eight and only returned after completing graduate school. She only saw her parents once a year, which left an opening for someone to impersonate her. This impostor has undergone more than thirty plastic surgeries...”","“Ridiculous!” An mother clutched her daughter tightly. “Say whatever you want. I’m taking my daughter home!”","An Nuo looked like a fish gasping for air as her mother pulled her toward the car.","But then—","Sheng Qingyan stepped forward and blocked their path.","Rong Yu approached, grabbed An Nuo’s chin without warning.","Seeing this, An mother tried to push Rong Yu away, but Sheng Qingyan seized her wrist.","“Sheng Yun! Your pregnant wife is being bullied like this, and you just stand there?” An mother’s voice was breaking. “Are you even a man? My An Nuo really married the wrong person!”","Sheng Yun’s eyes darkened. “It’s not certain whether she’s my wife or not.”","“Open your mouth!” Rong Yu forced An Nuo’s jaw open with pressure. “When the real An Nuo was sixteen, she visited a dentist in China. According to dental records, her upper right second premolar had a typical curved root canal. But this one...”","She released her hand, her gaze burning like fire. “When did you take the place of the real An Nuo? Let me guess—was it the night of An Nuo’s eighteenth birthday party? Or the night she stayed out with her boyfriend for the first time at nineteen? Perhaps it was the day she went camping at twenty...”","An mother roared in anger. “Judging someone’s identity by a tooth? That’s absurd!”","“Let’s do a paternity test immediately,” Sheng Qingyan said. “The military’s test will yield results in an hour.”","“No!”","An Nuo suddenly shrieked.","“This is an invasion of my human rights, a trampling of my dignity! Mom, Dad, let’s go home. I want to go home right now!”","This unusually intense reaction stunned the An family.","An father had been standing silently at the back. Now he strode forward abruptly and grabbed her shoulder.","“Nuo Nuo,” the head of the An family said, his voice dark and menacing, “if you’re really my daughter, why are you afraid of a test?”","“Dad, I...” An Nuo’s pupils dilated wildly, her lips trembling. “Yes, I am the An family’s daughter. Why should I do whatever they say? On what grounds...”","An father’s eyes grew colder, and his grip tightened. “My daughter fell off a swing at age six and fractured her collarbone, leaving a permanent scar. Let me see...”","He roughly yanked down the high collar of An Nuo’s shirt. Beneath it, her collarbone was smooth and unblemished.","Time seemed to freeze in that moment.","An father’s gaze turned as sharp as a blade. “You’re not my daughter after all. No wonder you suddenly started wearing high-necked clothes after your eighteenth birthday. So... that’s when you replaced my daughter!”","He suddenly grabbed her throat, his eyes bloodshot. “Tell me! Where is my daughter?”","An Nuo’s face turned purple as she struggled, her legs flailing, her hands desperately prying at his iron-like fingers.","An mother let out a heart-wrenching wail and threw herself at her husband, pounding on him. “Let go! She’ll die! She’s carrying a child!”","But An father seemed to have lost his mind, his grip tightening. “Tell me where Nuo Nuo is, or I’ll kill you with my own hands!”","Desperately, An Nuo turned to Sheng Yun, choking out the words. “Sheng Yun, save me... I’m pregnant with your child...”","Sheng Yun stood motionless, his expression as cold as ice. Slowly, he said, “I married An Nuo. Are you her? Since you’re not, what does the child in your belly have to do with me?”","So that was why she’d revealed the traitor in the base, offered up her accomplice—it was only to gain his trust.","He had been a fool.","An Nuo’s face had turned from purple to blue, and her eyes began to roll back.","Just then, Sheng Qingyan lunged forward. With a precise karate chop to An father’s wrist, he sent An Nuo collapsing weakly to the ground, gasping for air, the five purple fingerprints still vivid on her neck.","“President An, if she dies, we won’t be able to find anything out,” Sheng Qingyan said coolly. “Arrest her!”","Several soldiers stepped forward, hoisting An Nuo up like a dead fish, and dragged her back into the military headquarters.","An mother collapsed to the floor, tears smearing her perfectly made-up face. “My Nuo Nuo, my only precious daughter... how could this happen...”","She suddenly grabbed Rong Yu’s pant leg. “Please, tell me this isn’t true... tell me Nuo Nuo is still alive...”","Rong Yu knelt down and gently held her trembling hand. “Mrs. An, I’m sorry. According to my investigation, the real An Nuo likely died during her studies abroad. The imposter planned this for a long time. She spent over two years getting plastic surgery to match An Nuo’s appearance...”","“No!”","An mother let out a piercing scream, then her eyes rolled back, and she fainted.","An father slammed his fist into the wall, scraping the skin from his knuckles until they bled. He slumped to his knees like a man whose soul had been drained, the once composed businessman now hunched over, looking twenty years older.","Sheng Yun’s expression was a storm of emotions. He pressed his lips together, helped the two elderly to their feet, and arranged for someone to take them home.","Sheng Qingyan gently squeezed Rong Yu’s hand, then turned and entered the military compound.","When they had investigated around An Nuo, they found nothing. But once they knew she was an impostor, countless clues surfaced on their own... At just eight weeks pregnant, with a fragile fetus, she suffered a miscarriage and was sent to the hospital after three days of confinement.","After the forces entrenched in China were purged, Grandfather Ji was finally allowed to leave the hospital.","Sheng Qingyan found time to personally escort him out.","“Ah, A Yuan, clear out a room in the villa,” Grandfather Ji insisted. “Mr. Sheng will stay here tonight. Put him in the room next to your great-grandmother’s— no, I mean, next to Miss Rong’s.”","If he weren’t afraid of startling his biological father, he would have suggested Sheng Qingyan share a room with her directly.","Ji Zhiyuan asked, “Mr. Sheng, what style of room do you prefer?”","Given the situation, his great-grandfather would likely be frequently staying over at the Ji mansion anyway; it was better to set up a room properly.","“There’s no need,” Sheng Qingyan said. “Tonight, I have to accompany the troops to Base Four. You should already have seen the news. In three days, Base Four will launch the Eagle Eye-One rocket. The special forces are deploying to ensure a successful launch.”","Rong Yu smiled. “Then see you at the base. I have to go there too.”","Sheng Qingyan looked troubled. \"I've been assigned a mission by the organization. I have to be on standby twenty-four seven...\""]},{"number":340,"title":"Chapter 340: She probably won't give you a friendly look.","paragraphs":["Sheng Qingyan was a legendary figure among the soldiers of his generation.","When he was still a rookie, during a full-gear swimming-crossing exercise spanning thirty kilometers, he dragged a cramping teammate across the river, setting the fastest record in history—arriving fifteen minutes earlier than the previous record holder.","In a firefight at Base Four, he precisely located and eliminated two enemy S-class snipers, ensuring the safe evacuation of the chief engineer and the research team, earning him a first-class merit.","He participated in the destruction of a transnational drug trafficking group’s core stronghold, confiscated drugs, and rescued hostages, earning a second-class merit.","During a high-ranking official’s inspection, he uncovered an assassination plot and subdued three assassins disguised as journalists on the spot...","Without passing any assessment, he was recruited into the special operations force and became the youngest special operations team commander in the entire military.","When the general personally conferred his rank, he said only eight words:","“A blade of the nation—this is what it means.”","As one of the commanders of the special operations team, Sheng Qingyan’s latest mission was to provide twenty-four-hour protection for the chief designer of the Eagle Eye Project until its launch was successfully completed.","“Hey, Captain Sheng!” A squadron leader walking toward him grinned. “I heard you landed a sweet gig?”","Sheng Qingyan didn’t stop walking. “What sweet gig?”","The squadron leader winked. “Protecting the female chief designer of the Eagle Eye Project—twenty-four-hour close protection.”","The training ground was filled with special operations soldiers assigned to ensure this launch. A bunch of them gathered around, chiming in with laughter and teasing.","“Captain Sheng, I heard she’s a knockout!”","“Knockout? She’s the chief engineer of the Eagle Eye system!”","“Oh, hey, Captain—I heard you have a girlfriend. Will she get jealous?”","Sheng Qingyan stopped and swept his gaze across the group. His sharp look silenced them instantly.","His voice was calm. “A mission is a mission. It’s not about gender. The nation’s critical hardware is about to launch. If you’re all so bored, today you’ll add an extra twenty-kilometer loaded cross-country run.”","The group scattered like startled birds.","Though his voice was calm, the tightness of his lips gave him away.","If Ah Yu—his girlfriend—were about to spend twenty-four hours with another man, would he be jealous?","At 1:50 p.m., Sheng Qingyan was already at the base gate.","After three layers of strict security checks, the vehicle finally entered the core area of the base. Several people stood in front of the main building. Sheng Qingyan immediately recognized the chief engineer, Cui Xiao—a very famous missile expert.","“Commander Sheng!” Cui Xiao warmly approached and shook his hand. “Last time we met, you were still a new recruit. In just a few months, you’ve become the special ops commander. Truly, heroes born young!”","Sheng Qingyan shook hands with standard propriety. “Chief Engineer Cui, please give your orders.”","“We’ll need your full attention this time. The Eagle Eye project is in its most critical phase, and the safety of our chief designer must be guaranteed without a single flaw.” Cui Xiao turned to lead the way. “Come with me. I’ll introduce you to our genius designer. I take it you’ve heard—she’s a woman. Before you came to protect her, did you report to Engineer Rong?”","Sheng Qingyan replied, “It’s an organizational assignment, unrelated to personal matters. No special report is needed.”","Cui Xiao could read nothing from his expression.","Well, the young man sure could keep his cool—made Cui Xiao feel a bit childish for his teasing.","“Oh, really?” Cui Guo stirred the pot deliberately. “Let me give you a heads-up: when the Eagle Eye launches, Engineer Rong will be there too. Her boyfriend is going to be standing behind another woman twenty-four-seven. I doubt she’ll give you a very warm reception.”","“Chief Engineer Cui is joking,” Sheng Qingyan said evenly. “The mission is the mission. Rong Yu... she understands the nature of my work very well.”","After passing through three more armored security doors, Sheng Qingyan followed Cui Xiao into the core control area.","Cui Xiao stopped in front of a heavy blast door. While his identity was being verified, he couldn’t resist adding, “By the way, our chief designer has a bit of a... distinctive temperament. When she’s working, she acknowledges no one. You’ll need to be patient.”","Sheng Qingyan nodded indifferently, beginning to mentally plan how to get along with this special-tempered female chief designer.","The blast door slowly opened, revealing a spacious, bright main control room. Dozens of researchers in white lab coats were busy at various instruments, their work accompanied by the low hum of electronic equipment.","“Engineer Rong! The one guarding you is here!” Cui Xiao called out to the depths of the core area.","Hearing that form of address, Sheng Qingyan’s heart suddenly skipped a beat.","Engineer Rong?","That was what the base staff called Rong Yu, wasn’t it?","He only knew she played a very important role at the aerospace base—but he’d never known exactly what she did.","Just as Rong Yu never knew the specific details of his missions.","Then, a slender figure emerged from behind a pile of instruments. Under her white lab coat were a simple shirt and black combat pants, and her long hair was tied up in a neat ponytail. She lifted her head and broke into a smile.","The moment she saw Sheng Qingyan, her eyes lit up, and the corners of her mouth lifted involuntarily—but she quickly put on a professional expression. “Captain Sheng, pleasure to meet you. I’m Rong Yu, chief designer of the Eagle Eye Project.”","Sheng Qingyan froze.","He’d only been in the special operations unit for a little over two months, completing over a dozen missions of varying scale—most at the national level.","He’d always known his Ah Yu was outstanding.","But he’d never known she was this remarkable.","She had actually designed the Eagle Eye rocket, set to launch into space—a feat that would etch her name into aerospace history.","His Ah Yu was truly incredible.","A small part of him wondered—why, with someone so brilliant, would she ever fall for him...?","Seeing his dazed expression, Cui Xiao burst out laughing. “Well, Commander Sheng, didn’t I say you should’ve checked with Engineer Rong? You told me it wasn’t necessary.”","Sheng Qingyan’s ears turned bright red. His mouth opened, but he couldn’t find the words.","Rong Yu stifled a smile, walked over to him, and put on an official tone on purpose. “Captain Sheng, the final testing phase for Eagle Eye begins tomorrow. I’m entrusting my safety to you.”","Sheng Qingyan finally found his voice. He stood at attention, but his tone was much softer than usual. “That’s my duty, Engineer Rong.”","Cui Xiao clapped his hands. “Alright, alright, you two lovebirds, stop pretending in front of me. Engineer Rong, I deliberately didn’t tell Commander Sheng you were the one he’d be protecting, just to see his reaction—and it was pretty amusing.”","The other researchers in the control center laughed good-naturedly.","Rong Yu’s cheeks flushed faintly.","Sheng Qingyan cleared his throat, struggling to maintain his soldierly composure.","“Don’t be nervous, you two. The work pressure is high—Chief Engineer Cui was just cracking a small joke.” Lin Rang wheeled his wheelchair over. “Actually, the organization arranged for Captain Sheng to come partly because we genuinely need the best protection, and partly because of you two being together—it’ll help your junior alumna feel more at ease during the launch.”","Sheng Qingyan snapped back into military discipline, saluting crisply. “The organization can rest assured. I will ensure Engineer Rong’s safety around the clock!”"]},{"number":341,"title":"Chapter 341: Rong Yu, She Is the Real Chief Designer of the Eagle Eye Project","paragraphs":["The top headline on global news was taken over by China's Eagle Eye One.","The UN television host faced the camera and announced: \"Good evening, global audience. We are now reporting that China is about to launch the Eagle Eye One space debris cleanup system in thirty minutes. According to experts from the International Space Safety Committee (ISSC), this debris cleanup model carries significant risks. So, is Eagle Eye One a space janitor or an orbiting killer?\"","Netizens from various countries were buzzing online.","A U.S. netizen said: \"What makes China think they can succeed? Eagle Eye technology hasn't been internationally verified. A reckless launch could trigger a catastrophic chain reaction. Can China afford that?\"","A Russian netizen commented: \"Our country tried space cleanup decades ago and ended up creating more debris. I don't think the Chinese are smarter than us.\"","An EU netizen wrote: \"The EU should ban China's janitor from approaching our orbital zones. Who knows if it might accidentally swallow our navigation systems?\"","A South Korean netizen claimed: \"The term 'Eagle Eye' was copied from our ancient texts. No wonder it looks so familiar.\"","A Japanese netizen speculated: \"Is China trying to use Eagle Eye to infiltrate global satellite systems...\"","Regardless of the international noise, inside the domestic livestream, the Chinese host—with a calm and reassuring face—continued to report the progress at a steady pace.","\"Greetings to all viewers. You may not know that in the near-Earth orbit above us, there are over 100 million pieces of space debris. These fragments, ranging from tiny screws to abandoned satellites, travel at speeds ten times that of a bullet. If a collision occurs, the chain reaction could destroy global communication, navigation, and even weather satellite systems...\"","\"Today, China's Eagle Eye One will usher in a new era of human space cleanup!\"","\"...\"","Inside the control room, hundreds of screens flickered with data streams. Engineers' fingers flew across keyboards.","Rong Yu stood before the main console, her gaze fixed on the orbital map on the large screen.","\"The countdown begins!\"","As her voice fell, everyone in the control room rose to their feet.","Voices rang out in unison:","\"Five!\"","\"Four!\"","\"Three!\"","\"Two!\"","\"One!\"","\"Ignition——!\"","Rong Yu pressed the command button with one hand.","With a tremendous roar, the rocket lifted Eagle Eye One into the sky, its tail flame carving a brilliant golden trail through the night.","The BBC livestream chat exploded instantly:","\"Did they really dare?\"","\"Are the Chinese polluting space now?\"","\"Why isn't the UN Space Safety Committee stopping this...\"","International comments were mostly sarcastic, reproachful, and angry.","But Rong Yu's eyes were fixed solely on the data screens.","\"First stage separation successful.\"","\"Second stage ignition normal.\"","\"Eagle Eye One has successfully entered its designated orbit—\"","Seventy-two minutes later, Eagle Eye One reached its target orbit and deployed its claw—a set of retractable capture nets woven from nanofibers.","The livestream camera captured the scene.","Eagle Eye precisely approached a piece of debris. The robotic arm shot out, but instead of grabbing roughly, it sprayed conductive gel that instantly enveloped the target's surface, activated a pulsed magnetic field to decelerate it rapidly, and achieved a \"soft landing\" capture.","The conductive gel solidified, and electromagnetic adhesion was activated.","The debris was firmly locked and dragged toward the atmospheric incineration zone.","The entire process was swift, fast, and seamless—as flexible as a human arm.","The domestic livestream erupted.","\"Wow, I'm dazzled. This is so high-tech, like a sci-fi movie!\"","\"Eagle Eye One just put space into deep-cleaning mode. Who can beat that?\"","\"Five thousand years ago, we gazed at the stars; five thousand years later, we step into the Milky Way and make the stars brighter.\"","\"Eagle Eye One: Heard someone doubted me? Come on, take a look at what Chinese power can do!\"","\"Motherland is too strong. I barely know how to read, but I can only say: Awesome!\"","\"...\"","Meanwhile, the BBC livestream chat saw a complete reversal.","A UN engineer posted: \"I've worked on robotic arm design for over 20 years at the ISSC. The technology behind Eagle Eye completely overturns my understanding. When did China's aerospace tech become this powerful?\"","A U.S. scientist wrote: \"I have to say, Eagle Eye's orbital prediction algorithm is at least one generation ahead of ours. It even calculated the impact of Earth's magnetic field on micro-debris, something we haven't managed to model yet.\"","A Russian expert commented: \"This is terrifying. Eagle Eye One can predict the rotational trajectory of debris and capture it accurately. That requires at least a trillion-level fluid dynamics simulation space. Where did they get the funding?\"","...","At first, only a small number of people abroad were paying attention, but experts and professors from various countries began posting their views online, drawing more and more viewers into the livestream, sending the popularity skyrocketing.","That night, the name \"Eagle Eye One\" made the front page of news outlets in over 100 countries.","The control room team worked through almost the entire night.","As dawn barely broke, Rong Yu's hoarse voice rang out: \"Eagle Eye One, maiden mission complete!\"","Though sleepless, everyone was ecstatic and erupted in cheers.","Cui Xiao took off his glasses, rubbed his reddened eyes, and said hoarsely, \"Notify the media. Press conference in ten minutes.\"","Journalists had already set up their gear. When the group entered, flashbulbs blazed like a rainstorm, all aimed at Lin Rang, who sat in a wheelchair.","Every frontline reporter knew that the Eagle Eye One project was the work of a young man, with even Cui Xiao—the brilliant chief engineer—only playing a supporting role.","Reporters scrambled to ask questions.","\"Professor Lin, as the chief designer of the Eagle Eye project, can you share the significance of this success?\"","\"Professor Lin, what was the initial inspiration behind developing Eagle Eye?\"","\"Professor Lin, how do you think the successful launch of Eagle Eye One will impact the global space situation...\"","\"The success of Eagle Eye One marks China's leap from follower to leader in space governance,\" Lin Rang said, taking the microphone. His voice was soft but every word was clear. \"But today, the person you should be interviewing is not me. It's my junior colleague, Rong Yu. She is the true chief designer of the Eagle Eye project.\"","When the project was first initiated, two names were filled in under the chief designer field: Rong Yu first, Lin Rang second.","The order was not based on alphabetical listing or random writing. The meaning behind it was unmistakable to everyone present.","When the reporters saw Rong Yu's face, they all froze.","A chief designer this young?","Was she even twenty?","Back then, Chief Engineer Cui Xiao was also in his twenties when he took on that role!","As the reporters stood stunned, the livestream chat was boiling over.","\"Wait! The chief designer is a woman?! And so young?\"","\"Oh my god, it's Rong Yu! Don't you all recognize Rong Yu?!\"","\"I thought Rong Yu was just an ordinary top student, but little did I know, she's actually the lead of a space project—she totally blew my mind!\"","\"She's only nineteen, just a freshman. She's younger than my little sister! Ahhh, is she even human?\"","\"Wrong, the guy above. From beginning to end, the Eagle Eye project took thirteen months. In other words, when Rong Yu was just eighteen, she became the chief designer...\"","\"...\""]},{"number":342,"title":"Chapter 342: Her gaze rests upon the stars and the Milky Way, upon the highest place.","paragraphs":["Inside the press hall, it was quiet for a long while.","Under everyone’s stunned gaze, Rong Yu sat down in the chief designer’s seat, with Lin Rang on her left and Cui Xiao on her right, while a row of core engineers lined up beside them.","The reporters quickly resumed their professional composure.","A male reporter spoke up first: “Chief Designer Rong, as one of the chief designers of Eagle Eye One, may I ask which part of the work you are primarily responsible for? Is it overall coordination?”","Rong Yu, as if not catching the insinuation, said calmly, “I am in charge of Eagle Eye’s core algorithms, including the dynamic balance of the magnetic capture system and the precise control of the ion beam...”","Her voice was not loud, but every word reached everyone’s ears clearly.","Another reporter stepped forward quickly: “Chief Designer Rong and Professor Lin both serve as chief designers, but Professor Lin is senior and widely recognized as a genius. May I ask why your name precedes Professor Lin’s?”","“Seniority has never been a measure of capability.” Cui Xiao frowned, took the microphone, and replied. “Professor Lin focuses on the academic field, while Engineer Rong is more inclined to mathematical and practical applications. This project was proposed and initiated by Engineer Rong, with Professor Lin providing full theoretical support and coordinating with all engineers to realize the details. Engineer Rong and Professor Lin are complementary. The space industry has never been about one or two people’s heroism—it is the joint effort of everyone!”","Every word was forceful and resolute.","A third reporter finally changed his expression and asked seriously, “Could Chief Designer Rong explain the technical principle of Eagle Eye capturing space debris? Some international experts have questioned its precision.”","Rong Yu smiled.","This was the question she wanted to answer.","She turned and gestured for the staff to pull up the orbital data from that time.","“The rotational speed of satellite debris is beyond normal parameters, and its surface is coated with aluminum oxide, giving it extremely high reflectivity.” She pointed to the dynamic model on the screen. “If we used a conventional ion beam to cut it directly, it would cause energy scattering and even risk damaging other orbiting satellites.”","The reporters began jotting down notes, their expressions growing serious.","“So we designed a dynamic buffering algorithm.” Her fingertip traced an arc across the screen. “The ion beam doesn’t clash with the debris head-on. Instead, it works like flowing water: first, a gel adheres to the debris surface, then gradually penetrates...”","“Chief Designer Rong,” a foreign reporter from the corner asked, “does the black technology demonstrated by Eagle Eye One in capturing abandoned satellites imply that China already possesses space weaponization capabilities?”","Rong Yu raised an eyebrow: “That’s like asking whether a kitchen knife can kill people. Technology itself is innocent—it all depends on whose hands it’s in.”","She looked at everyone present. “Eagle Eye’s design purpose is to solve a problem that has threatened all of humanity for decades: space debris. As for other possibilities, I can only responsibly tell everyone that China’s spacecraft will always protect peace in space.”","After the press conference, the hashtag #EagleEyeFemaleChiefDesigner shot to the top of the trending list.","Major official accounts nationwide, as well as universities, frantically reposted the video of Rong Yu’s interview. Even clips from her time participating in an entertainment talent show were cut and circulated across the internet like wildfire.","Anyone scrolling on their phones, no matter which app they used, was bombarded with this news. Even those who didn’t watch short videos or news received a text notification about the successful launch of Eagle Eye One...","If before, the name Rong Yu was only popular online, then after the successful launch of Eagle Eye One, the name Rong Yu became known to all ages and families.","The Rong family was attending a celebration banquet—celebrating the Rong Group’s leap to a new level, and Rong Ruoyao landing her first leading role in a TV series as an actress.","Amid the clinking of glasses, everyone in the banquet hall simultaneously looked down at their phones.","“Eagle Eye One’s female chief designer is named Rong Yu?”","“Isn’t that President Rong’s eldest daughter? Wasn’t she only brought to live with him last summer?”","“Yes, yes, I remember now. She got into Tsinghua University—such an outstanding child—and now she’s become the chief designer of something called Eagle Eye?”","“What exactly is a chief designer? Can someone explain?”","Rong Ruoyao was frozen.","The video on her phone looped endlessly.","She saw Rong Yu in her white research coat, saw the familiar faces sitting beside Rong Yu—faces usually only seen on state TV news—watched Rong Yu answer the reporters’ difficult questions with clarity, and saw how the national official accounts celebrated Rong Yu...","For a moment, she was dazed.","So, from a year ago, while still in high school, Rong Yu was already the chief designer of a national mega-project?","So, back then, the people around Rong Yu were already top-tier national experts?","And she—she had been foolishly trying to compete with a genius like Rong Yu?","What was she even competing for?","Could she possibly win?","Who on earth could win against her?","Song Huai gripped his wine glass tightly, his lips pressed together.","He recalled scene after scene from the past.","He’d always thought she was too cold.","He’d always thought she was too distant.","Only now did he understand: her gaze was fixed on the stars and the galaxy, on the highest places.","She had never even noticed him.","And what had he done?","Song Huai downed his glass of wine and immediately opened WeChat to send a message to his teacher, Liu Jinyue: “Teacher, I’m sorry. I’ve been hiding this from you. At the national physics finals, even though I was the team leader, the one who actually solved the problems was Rong Yu. I... I don’t deserve to be your student.”","Liu Jinyue replied quickly: “Silly child, I’ve known for a long time. Although you lack leadership skills, your aptitude for physics has always impressed me. You are still a student in my mentorship. Come to my office tomorrow—I have a project for you.”","Song Huai suddenly started crying.","At the same time, a flood of reporters surged into the banquet hall’s entrance, surrounding Rong Wangtian.","“President Rong, is the great aerospace chief designer your biological daughter?”","“President Rong, when did you discover Rong Yu’s potential to become a researcher?”","“President Rong, please share some interesting stories about Rong Yu’s studies and life...”","Staring at the dense crowd in front of him, Rong Wangtian was dumbfounded.","To be honest, even he only learned at this very moment that his eldest daughter was the chief designer of Eagle Eye One...","It was all too surreal, like a dream."]},{"number":343,"title":"Chapter 343: China's Eagle Eye One May Trigger a Space Disaster","paragraphs":["The reporters couldn't interview Rong Yu herself, so they swarmed Rong Wangtian with a frenzy of questions.","Rong Wangtian stood there dumbfounded, unable to utter a single word in reply.","Shen Lin stepped forward in time, picked up a microphone, and spoke with a smile: \"Hello everyone, I'm Rong Yu's stepmother. Let me answer some questions on her behalf. Rong Yu lived with her biological mother until she turned eighteen. The credit for her excellent upbringing goes entirely to her biological mother – she was a remarkable woman...\"","\"Now Rong Yu is studying at Huagu University in the capital and works at the Aerospace Institute as the Chief Designer of Eagle Eye One. This is the greatest honor in the history of the Rong family. On behalf of the Rong family, I announce—\"","Shen Lin raised her glass: \"The Rong Corporation will donate ten million yuan in full to the Fourth Aerospace Institute!\"","Rong Wangtian, brimming with excitement, declared: \"I also announce that we will allocate a portion of the Rong Corporation's quarterly profits to support the advancement of China's aerospace industry!\"","Rong Ruoyao covered her mouth in disbelief.","Ten million was already a huge sum – enough to buy a large house in Haicheng. And donating part of the quarterly profits meant the Rong Corporation would be funneling funds to the Aerospace Institute indefinitely... wouldn't that drive the company into bankruptcy!","The guests present, inexplicably stirred up, began shouting one after another.","\"President Rong is a true champion! My Li Family Garment will donate one million to the Fourth Aerospace Institute!\"","\"My Zhao Family Supermarket Chain donates five hundred thousand!\"","\"My Wu family, two hundred thousand.\"","\"The Chen family...\"","Song Huai spoke up: \"Mom, the Song family should donate too.\"","Madam Song pursed her lips: \"Why bother? It's pointless. It just makes Rong Yu look like she's so great.\"","\"Mom, Rong Yu is genuinely great.\" Song Huai stepped forward and announced loudly, \"On behalf of the Song family, I donate five million!\"","The invited guests eagerly lined up to announce their donations publicly.","Shen Lin quickly had someone record the names and amounts. Turning around, she saw her daughter Rong Ruoyao standing in a corner, twisting her fingers together. She sighed softly.","She walked over and whispered, \"Yao Yao, are you thinking the Rong family isn't exactly a major elite dynasty, yet we're donating so much to the Aerospace Institute in one go? Is it hard to let go?\"","Rong Ruoyao nodded quietly.","\"Look at the news.\" Shen Lin pulled out her phone. \"Rong Yu has taken over the trending searches, and because we led the way in donating, the Rong Corporation has secured a spot on the list too. Don't underestimate that trending spot; it means the Rong Corporation is now deeply tied to Rong Yu. As long as she continues contributing to our country, the Rong Corporation will always have a place in China.\"","Rong Ruoyao nodded, half understanding.","The news of the Rong Corporation's leading donation was covered widely, triggering a chain reaction. Many large corporate groups, riding this wave of publicity, began donating enormous sums themselves. Director You of the Fourth Aerospace Institute was grinning from ear to ear.","With all this funding, Eagle Eye Two could proceed smoothly.","\"Something terrible!\" the assistant suddenly rushed into the office. \"Director, a major crisis!\"","Director You shot up, brow furrowed: \"What happened?\"","The assistant handed him a tablet. The screen showed an international news broadcast—","CNN Headline: 〈U.S. Operational Satellite Cleared as Space Debris by Eagle Eye One: What Is China's Objective?〉","BBC Breaking News: 〈ISSC Emergency Meeting: China's Eagle Eye One May Trigger a Space Disaster〉","The assistant opened the news, which showed a UN spokesperson speaking grimly: \"The International Space Safety Committee (ISSC) and the Global Orbital Management Alliance (GOMA) jointly demand that China immediately cease operating Eagle Eye One and submit all technical data, or face space sanctions.\"","Rong Yu had stayed up all night and was sleeping.","She slept for thirteen hours before waking up. Out of habit, she grabbed her phone, and the moment she turned it on, news notifications flooded in.","Foreign ministries on various public platforms issued stern condemnations of Eagle Eye.","The U.S. said: \"The Eagle Eye system incorrectly cleared our satellite. Please compensate for substantial losses!\"","Japan declared: \"Eagle Eye One is not yet perfected and poses a major threat to space safety. Please recall the Eagle Eye system immediately.\"","Britain called out: \"I urge all countries to unite in boycotting Eagle Eye One...\"","Rong Yu shot upright in bed.","That's impossible!","The Eagle Eye system had passed thousands upon thousands of validation tests. It absolutely could not have actively captured an operational satellite.","She walked out of her dormitory to find Cui Xiao.","Sheng Qingyan was stationed outside the door. With a quiet, gentle tone, he said, \"Ah Yu, Chief Engineer Cui and Professor Lin and the others are in an emergency meeting.\"","Rong Yu tied her ponytail as she walked: \"Why didn't you wake me to join them sooner?\"","\"Chief Engineer Cui said you were too exhausted and needed more rest,\" Sheng Qingyan said softly. \"Don't rush. Have something to eat first.\"","Rong Yu looked at him: \"You must be tired too. Go get some rest.\"","Sheng Qingyan straightened his back and said: \"Orders from the organization: round-the-clock protection for Chief Designer Rong. I'm not going anywhere.\"","Rong Yu relaxed slightly: \"Alright then, let's go to the cafeteria first. We'll charge up and then get to work.\"","Meanwhile, the meeting room was thick with anger.","Cui Xiao's voice was ice-cold: \"Everyone should be clear on the situation. The U.S. is teaming up with the ISSC and GOMA, pretending our system mistakenly targeted their satellite, to force us to hand over our Eagle Eye technology.\"","Engineer Zhao Mingzhe sneered: \"Most of the space debris out there was created by the U.S. We put in tremendous human, material, and financial resources to clean up space, and now they're turning the tables on us!\"","\"Eagle Eye could never have captured a live U.S. satellite,\" said Lin Rang, sitting in a wheelchair, his voice cold. \"Only two possibilities: either the U.S. deliberately destroyed its own satellite to trick Eagle Eye into capturing it, or...\"","\"Or the satellite was already beyond use,\" Rong Yu strode in. \"I'm leaning toward the second option.\"","The meeting room was collectively exasperated.","\"Using a defunct satellite to demand massive compensation—are the Americans kidding?\"","\"They've basically perfected the art of pulling a hoax.\"","\"Do they still think they're the ones calling the shots on the global stage?\"","\"Everyone!\" Rong Yu spoke up. \"This is no time for outrage. We need to prove ourselves with evidence, and shut the whole world down.\"","She quickly laid out task assignments on the whiteboard.","\"Chief Engineer Cui, personally head to the International Space Safety Bureau to request the global satellite orbit database for the last three months, focusing on orbital decay rates.\"","\"Colleague, extract the full-cycle operational logs of the Eagle Eye system to prove it only captured internationally recognized space debris.\"","\"Engineer Jiang, Engineer Zhao, you lead your teams in handling this part...\"","\"I want all evidence chains closed within 48 hours.\" Rong Yu looked around the room. \"Any questions, everyone?\"","Lin Rang turned his wheelchair, the first to respond: \"The orbit calculation team will have the report ready in 18 hours.\"","The lights at the base control center stayed on for two full days and two nights."]},{"number":344,"title":"Chapter 344: Where Did Azheng Come From","paragraphs":["Rong Yu was utterly exhausted by the time she wrote down the final number.","She handed the document to Lin Rang for review, and while waiting for the result, she fell asleep leaning against her chair.","Lin Rang finished calculating, about to discuss it with her, but noticed her eyes were closed and her breathing steady. He turned toward the shadows and said, \"Captain Sheng, could you please take Xiao Yu to lie down for a while? This afternoon, we have to fly to the capital for the hearing. Remember to wake her up in time.\"","While Rong Yu worked, Sheng Qingyan had been standing in the shadows, protecting her safety twenty-four hours a day.","His icy demeanor was concealed beneath his black tactical outfit, and his face was incredibly gentle as he carefully lifted the sleeping woman from the chair.","Sensing the reassuring scent of him, Rong Yu buried her head against his chest obediently.","She seemed to travel back in time to that returning cruise ship years ago.","Lying on a deck lounge chair, she had fallen asleep in the sea breeze. Half-awake, half-asleep, she felt someone gently support her back and knees, lifting her entirely.","The man's chest was warm and firm, the brass buttons of his military uniform pressing against her cheek, carrying the warmth of sunlight.","Perhaps the ship swayed slightly, and his footsteps blended with the sound of the waves. Steady and sure, he carried her and gently laid her on the bed.","\"A Zheng...\"","Rong Yu murmured.","Sheng Qingyan was stunned.","A Zheng?","Who was A Zheng?","He only knew of the Ji family members: Yuan, A-Yan, Mo, Chuan, and Aye.","There was no A Zheng.","Sheng Qingyan desperately wanted to ask who this person was.","But this was the first time Rong Yu had slept so deeply in two days. How could he bear to wake her?","He was about to stand up and guard the door.","But Rong Yu grabbed his hand. Her voice was a soft mumble. \"A Zheng, sleep with me for a while.\"","Sheng Qingyan: \"...\"","He resigned himself, lying down on the small bed's outer edge.","He carefully wrapped his arm around her waist, and as he closed his eyes, every sense expanded, keeping a constant state of alertness...","That same afternoon, the Capital International Convention Center was buzzing.","The Global Emergency Space Security Hearing was about to be held here, with representatives from all nations gathered, cameras and microphones aimed at the central projection stage.","The representatives sat in the conference room, murmuring among themselves.","The representative from the Beacon State laughed coldly. \"The Eagle Eye system's technology is immature. Haphazardly clearing space debris, misidentifying targets, causing our country heavy losses. This meeting must force China to immediately suspend Eagle Eye One operations and disclose all technical details!\"","The French representative asked, \"May I ask, what was the cost of this satellite?\"","\"3.8 billion US dollars,\" said the Beacon State representative. \"The money isn’t important. What’s important is—\"","His gaze swept across the representatives. \"Just imagine if your satellite was the one wrongly eliminated today. What if, next time, it’s the Galileo navigation satellite from the European Space Agency? Or Russia’s meteorological monitoring station? Or Japan’s communication relay?\"","The French representative smiled but did not commit. They certainly relied on space assets, but they had no intention of being used as a pawn by the Beacon State.","The Russian representative leaned back in his chair. He wouldn’t side with either China or the Beacon State. He was just there to watch the show—maybe even pick up something useful.","The Sakura State representative immediately chimed in, \"Mr. Oliver is absolutely right. I wholeheartedly support the Beacon State!\"","The English representative adjusted his glasses and spoke slowly, \"Technically speaking, if the Eagle Eye’s recognition algorithm does have flaws, then the international community has the right to demand transparency.\"","The German representative hesitated before speaking, \"But the issue of space debris really does need to be addressed...\"","The Beacon State’s Oliver shouted, \"Dear delegates, as long as China discloses its technology, we can jointly build a safer space governance system. At that time, all nations can share monitoring data and avoid similar tragedies!\"","Unofficial meaning: those who cooperate will get a share of the pie later.","Murmurs spread through the room.","Just then, the door swung open, and the Chinese delegation arrived.","Delegates from all countries immediately turned to look. Their leader was a young woman about twenty, not old by any means, but she exuded an incredibly powerful presence. The moment she entered, inexplicably, everyone fell silent.","On her right sat Lin Rang in a wheelchair.","Lin Rang had once been so remarkable, a rising star in mathematics. Yet a tragic accident left him unable to walk... Even so, he remained an outstanding figure in mathematics and the future successor of Academician Yun...","And now, he willingly served as deputy to this young woman.","On her left—","Everyone immediately stood up.","This was... Cui Xiao.","Years ago, when aerospace technology was blockaded by major powers and China seemed at a loss, a genius appeared. That man was Cui Xiao.","In that era, computers were extremely rare. It was Cui Xiao, with nothing but his hands, an abacus, and paper, who derived the rocket fuel mixture formula by pure computation, solving the combustion oscillation problem that had plagued China for over half a year...","He had emerged as a prodigy at eighteen. Now, at sixty, he was a national treasure of China, as well as a thorn in the side of rival nations.","A figure of such unsurpassed caliber, from any perspective, stood beside this young girl, like an indomitable mountain, preventing anyone from daring to underestimate Rong Yu.","Rong Yu stepped forward, walking calmly to the Chinese delegation’s seats.","She sat in the center, flanked by Cui Xiao and Lin Rang. Behind them sat two translators, and behind them, eight attending security personnel.","The chairman of the International Space Security Council stood and announced, \"All representatives are present. The International Space Security Hearing now begins!\"","He adjusted his glasses, let his gaze sweep across the room, and spoke with seriousness, \"In accordance with the International League Space Treaty, this hearing is officially convened in the capital of China. The agenda item is the safety review of the Eagle Eye One space debris clearance system.\"","The director of the International Space Orbit Alliance brought up an official document projection. \"According to reports submitted by multiple nations, the Eagle Eye One is accused of capturing and disintegrating a Beacon State in-orbit satellite without adequate warning. Per procedure, the Chinese side must provide an explanation.\"","Oliver of the Beacon State straightened his suit and stood, \"The Free Guardian satellite, costing 3.8 billion US dollars and tasked with our nation’s meteorological monitoring, was forcibly dismantled by the Eagle Eye One without any warning. China must take responsibility!\"","The English representative said, \"This is not merely a technical issue. It is a contempt for international rules!\"","The Sakura State representative shouted, \"If even the Beacon State’s satellite was not safe, how much more dangerous are the others?\"","The Australian representative banged on the table. \"Eagle Eye operations must be suspended immediately, pending the establishment of an international oversight mechanism...\"","At the Chinese delegation seats,","Cui Xiao whispered to Rong Yu, \"Are you ready?\"","Rong Yu’s smile was faint. \"They’ve gone through the trouble of coming all the way to China. Let them put on their show a little longer.\""]},{"number":345,"title":"Chapter 345: The responsibility of us Chinese is the true responsibility of a great power.","paragraphs":["Inside the conference room, representatives from various nations were speaking. The vast majority of countries unconditionally supported the Lighthouse Nation, but a few spoke up for Hua-Xia, and some, like the Soviet Federation, remained neutral.","The chairman of the committee stood up. \"Now, please let the Hua-Xia representative respond to the accusations.\"","Rong Yu rose to her feet.","She walked steadily toward the central podium, all eyes in the room fixed on her. Oliver stood with his arms crossed, a disdainful smirk on his lips.","\"Good day, everyone. I am the representative of Hua-Xia. My name is Rong Yu.\" She smiled, looking toward Oliver. \"First of all, I would like to thank Mr. Oliver for providing such a precise figure—3.8 billion US dollars.\"","Her gaze swept across the room. \"As everyone knows, the Freedom Watchman was a satellite launched by the Lighthouse Nation six years ago. Due to the cutting-edge technology used at the time, its construction cost was relatively high—3.8 billion dollars is reasonable. However, its last orbital maneuver was a year and a half ago. Since then, its orbit has been steadily decaying, and it has long been marked as uncontrolled debris. Its current value is, zero.\"","Oliver slammed his hand on the table. \"Our Freedom Watchman was launched only six years ago, with an estimated service life of fifteen years. It is still in active operation. To protect your Eagle Eye One, you’re now biting the hand that feeds you? Hua-Xia, don’t get too cocky. Sending a little girl as your representative is an insult to all the nations here. Get out, now!\"","\"Please don’t be angry, Mr. Oliver.\" Rong Yu's smile was faint. \"Allow me to do a quick calculation on the spot. If I make a mistake, you are welcome to point it out at any time.\"","Oliver let out a cold laugh.","A calculation on the spot?","How ridiculous.","All the classified data of the Watchman satellite had already been destroyed. Anything she came up with would only be laughable.","Her fingers flew across the virtual keyboard. The main screen switched to a real-time orbital simulation system, and rows of formulas flashed rapidly across the display. After inputting the data, the system automatically generated an orbital decay animation, clearly showing that the satellite had long been out of control and was on course to crash into the space station at any moment, causing immeasurable consequences!","Rong Yu pointed at the data. \"The calculation results show that the Freedom Watchman has residual propellant at 0.2%, below the minimum standard for maintaining orbit. Its attitude control engines last ignited more than three months ago. The solar panel power output has already failed. May I ask Mr. Oliver: what black technology does your nation use to keep a satellite with no fuel, no power, and no control still in service?\"","The entire room fell silent.","The Lighthouse Nation engineers frantically tapped their keyboards. One minute passed. Three minutes. Five minutes. Sweat dripped from their foreheads. Finally, one of them, pale-faced, shook his head at Oliver.","The data calculated by Hua-Xia matched the destroyed classified files of the Lighthouse Nation almost exactly.","There was no way to refute it.","Rong Yu looked at Oliver, her tone sharp. \"So, is your nation trying to use a piece of long-obsolete space junk to demand 3.8 billion US dollars from Hua-Xia in compensation? Arrogant? Who is the one being arrogant? Who is making extortionate demands? Who is using this as an excuse to impose sanctions on Hua-Xia?\"","Oliver's face turned ghostly pale. He opened his mouth, but not a single word came out.","The German delegate stood up, righteous and indignant. \"Such deceptive behavior severely undermines international mutual trust. Our nation strongly condemns it!\"","The English delegate quickly shifted positions. \"As a responsible nation, we should reassess the accusations against the Eagle Eye system.\"","The Australian delegate slammed his folder shut with a grim face. \"Clearly, someone is trying to exploit international procedures for improper gain.\"","The Russian delegate applauded. \"A 3.8-billion-dollar piece of space junk? That’s a first.\"","The Cherry Blossom Nation, usually a staunch supporter of the Lighthouse Nation, remained silent.","A wave of condemnation from countless nations washed over the room like a tidal surge. Oliver’s expression was uglier than ever.","\"Quiet, everyone.\" The committee chairman raised his voice. \"Lighthouse Nation representative, if you have more evidence, please present it.\"","Oliver: \"...\"","He did not.","\"Then, the International Space Safety Committee and the Global Orbital Management Alliance jointly announce—the immediate revocation of all accusations against Hua-Xia’s Eagle Eye system!\"","Oliver collapsed into his chair, his tie crooked, crumpled pages of his speech scattered in front of him.","All the Lighthouse Nation representatives lowered their once-arrogant heads.","Rong Yu closed the data interface and pulled up a new document: the \"Human Orbital Safety White Paper Proposal.\"","Her eyes blazed with determination. \"Ladies and gentlemen, tens of thousands of satellites and pieces of space debris are tangled like cobwebs around the fragile planet we call home. This is not the sole responsibility of Hua-Xia—this is a crisis for all of humanity! The orbit of the planet beneath our feet is being shackled by the very chains we have forged!\"","She displayed a set of data:","\"Space collision incidents have increased by 470% in the last decade.\"","\"Inoperative satellites account for 63% of all assets.\"","\"Debris density in critical orbital zones exceeds safety thresholds by more than ten times.\"","\"Today, I stand here on behalf of Hua-Xia to solemnly propose—\" Her voice rose sharply. \"First, establish a global space governance fund, with contributions from each nation based on their space launch volume. Second, open orbital monitoring data and create humanity’s first shared orbital management system. Third—\"","She looked at everyone in the room. \"Effective immediately, Hua-Xia will share some of the algorithms used in Eagle Eye One for international oversight.\"","The entire room erupted into applause!","After a wave of noise, they fell into reverent silence.","The Lighthouse Nation representatives were stunned, their faces full of disbelief.","They had staged this entire act to force Hua-Xia into handing over the core technology of Eagle Eye. Now that Hua-Xia had the moral high ground, not only did it not retaliate, but it voluntarily offered to share core algorithms.","If it had been the Lighthouse Nation, they would have imposed a total technology blockade. They simply could not understand what the top brass of Hua-Xia was thinking.","The Russian Federation was the first to raise its hand. \"Our nation supports this great initiative!\"","The English representative, fired up with passion, declared, \"Thank you to the generous Hua-Xia nation. With you, truth can shine upon the stars!\"","The German representative added, \"Our nation seconds this motion. This is a charter of the stars for all humanity!\"","The French representative said, \"This is the true spirit of a great power...\"","The live stream on Hua-Xia Central Television’s channel was instantly flooded with bullet comments:","\"Tears in my eyes! Hua-Xia’s sense of responsibility is the true spirit of a great power!\"","\"Free sharing of core technology—so this is what our ancestors meant by 'the world belongs to all'!\"","\"I used to think the 'stars and seas' was just a dream, but today, I finally see the vanguard!\"","On Weibo, trending topics exploded:","#HuaXiaSharesSpaceGovernancePlan#","#ThisIsWhatTheCommunityOfSharedFutureForHumanityReallyMeans#","#LighthouseNation38BillionScamEndsInLaughter#","#GeniusProdigyRepresentsHuaXia#","The chairman of the ISSC and the director of the GOMA jointly brought down the historic gavel. \"The Human Orbital Safety White Paper Proposal is passed!\"","Rong Yu looked down at the emblem on her chest, shining brightly.","\"This is Hua-Xia’s answer to the world.\"","\"Not hegemony, not scheming—but for the civilization of humanity—\"","\"To open a road to the stars!\""]},{"number":346,"title":"Chapter 346: The Grand Finale · Part One","paragraphs":["Outside the International Space Conference Center, dusk was falling.","The meeting had finally ended. Specialized diplomats were assigned to escort the delegations from various countries, and Rong Yu was finally able to withdraw.","Sheng Qingyan had just pushed open the glass door of the conference hall for her when a burst of celebratory firecrackers exploded.","\"Boom—!\"","Streamers flew everywhere, drifting down onto the heads of Rong Yu and Sheng Qingyan.","\"Hail the triumphant return of our aerospace heroine—!\"","The entire Ji family stood in a line, their formation as grand as a red carpet at a film festival.","Old Master Ji stood at the forefront, wearing a bright red Tang suit and holding an erhu. He immediately played a marching tune with great vigor and declared in a booming voice, \"Mom, you were incredible today. With the truth, you slapped the faces of the delegates from all over the world, showcasing our national power and making grand strides!\"","Rong Yu: \"...\"","When had this old rascal learned to play the erhu? And he was actually pretty good at it.","Ji Zhiyuan strode forward, pulling out a stack of documents: \"Just now, the five major families of Haicheng jointly acquired a portion of the family assets owned by Mr. Oliver, the representative from Beacon Country. After a unanimous decision, we have decided to gift these assets to Great-grandmother as a celebration gift. Please accept.\"","Rong Yu: \"...\"","Oliver came to Huaxia to compete for interests on behalf of Beacon Country, and ended up having his home raided. She silently lit a candle for him.","Ji Yanting straightened his tie and spoke up: \"Great-grandmother, a production team approached me. They want to base a movie on your story, a film about the vast sea and stars, and invite a young actress who suits the image to play you. Would Great-grandmother be willing to authorize it?\"","Rong Yu: \"...\"","She was still alive, and they wanted to find someone to play her—how did that feel so strange?","Ji Mohan took out a massage device and forcefully hung it around Rong Yu’s neck: \"Great-grandmother has been working too hard these past few days. Try out this massage device I developed. Every person at the Chinese Academy of Sciences has one. It’s good for easing neck pain from looking down at data.\"","Rong Yu twisted her neck: \"This is not bad.\"","Ji Jingchuan said plainly: \"I just hired a group of online trolls. Now, on the foreign internet, the trending topic is #OliverCountdownToResignation#. Does Great-grandmother want to check the real-time trending index?\"","Rong Yu gave a thumbs-up.","Now it would be almost impossible for Oliver to avoid resigning.","\"All of you, move aside!\" Ji Zhouye strode over energetically, pulled a silk banner from behind him, unfurled it with a snap, and read aloud in a loud voice: \"Face-slapping skills unmatched in the world, global certification as the ultimate trouble-scoundrel nemesis!\"","\"—Written and respectfully presented by the Universally Invincible, Superbly Thunderous, Number One Filial Grandson, Ji Zhouye.\"","The whole crowd fell silent for three seconds.","Old Master Ji slapped him upside the head: \"You even misspelled the word for 'thunderous,' you useless brat! All those years of schooling wasted!\"","Ji Zhiyuan held back his laughter and coughed: \"The handwriting is so ugly, hanging it in the bathroom would work great for warding off evil. Good, very good.\"","Ji Yanting frowned: \"How is this so similar to the silk banner that Duoduo made in kindergarten handicraft class a few days ago?\"","Ji Mohan quietly explained: \"Second Brother, you didn’t see it wrong—that’s exactly the same banner. Aye borrowed it and customized it.\"","Ji Jingchuan remarked: \"Aye rarely writes his own calligraphy. We can make do and look the other way.\"","\"Wah wah, as expected, Fourth Brother loves me the most,\" Ji Zhouye said with a fake crying face. \"Great-grandmother, do you think it looks good?\"","Rong Yu reached out and rubbed his fuzzy head: \"It’s wonderful.\"","The vast sea of stars might be important.","But none of it could compare to the warmth of family. The ugly banner didn’t diminish the heartfelt sentiment.","Duoduo’s sweet, soft voice piped up: \"Auntie, Great-Grandpa, Dad, Second Uncle, Third Uncle, Fourth Uncle, Little Uncle—come, let’s take a group photo together.\"","She held up her phone and switched it to selfie mode.","Sheng Qingyan, standing beside Rong Yu, quietly stepped back a few paces, moving out of the frame.","But a firm grasp caught him.","Old Master Ji pulled him to his own side: \"Mr. Sheng, stand right here, we’ll take the photo together.\"","On his left was Rong Yu, on his right was Sheng Qingyan, and in front were the five grandsons in a row. Duoduo, held in Ji Zhiyuan’s arms, raised the phone high.","\"Everyone, smile—!\"","Duoduo clicked the capture button a dozen times in rapid succession.","The phone froze the moment of the family portrait. Sheng Qingyan’s daze had yet to fade.","Staring at the photo in which he stood shoulder to shoulder with the Ji family, his heart felt as if it were gently squeezed. Was this warmth truly something he deserved?","He seemed to have forgotten something.","What was it?","But then, the very next second—","\"Bang!\"","A gunshot from a distance suddenly tore through the evening sunset.","\"Get down—!\"","Sheng Qingyan reacted in an instant, pressing Rong Yu into his chest with one hand while grabbing Old Master Ji with the other, rolling hard toward the cover of a barrier.","A bullet grazed past his ear, embedding deeply into the wall behind.","The five Ji grandsons each scrambled to find cover. None of them had ever experienced such a scene; no one dared to move.","\"It’s a sniper targeting you!\" Sheng Qingyan’s eyes darkened. \"A-Yu, I’ll cover your retreat!\"","Rong Yu shook her head: \"Sheng Qingyan, you first cover Yingbao and Duoduo to withdraw. They’re an old man and a little child—they can’t be allowed to get hurt. Go quickly!\"","Old Master Ji’s eyes reddened: \"Mom, I’m not leaving.\"","Rong Yu touched his face: \"Yingbao, that car accident seventy years ago left a lifelong trauma in your heart. Mom will never abandon you again... Don’t worry, Mom won’t get hurt. You evacuate first, be good.\"","Sheng Qingyan was dazed again.","Every word A-Yu said, he understood its meaning. But when they were all strung together, he couldn’t make sense of it.","Now wasn’t the time to think about that.","\"Yingbao, Duoduo, close your eyes and hold tight to me.\"","The moment Sheng Qingyan spoke the words \"Yingbao,\" he himself froze for an instant.","But there was no time to ponder.","Duoduo was scooped up. The little girl wrapped her arms tightly around his neck, burying her face against his shoulder, her eyelashes trembling as she squeezed her eyes shut.","Old Master Ji gave Rong Yu one last glance, his eyes red, then placed his hand in Sheng Qingyan’s. The old man was swept up like a child, tucked under Sheng Qingyan’s arm. He wanted to resist, but resistance was useless...","Sheng Qingyan pulled out a gun and handed it over: \"A-Yu, take the gun. Protect yourself. I’ll be right back.\"","He forced himself to look away, his gaze sweeping the surroundings.","The sniper’s position was high. Bullets were coming from the southeast. The nearest cover was a bulletproof reception vehicle fifteen meters away.","But in between lay an open square with no cover at all.","He took a deep breath, pressed his body low, and shot forward like a cheetah.","\"Bang—!\"","A bullet whizzed past his ear, the scorching air searing his skin.","Sheng Qingyan didn’t stop, didn’t even lower his head—he abruptly changed direction, sprinting in an irregular trajectory.","This was an anti-sniper maneuver learned on the battlefield.","Old Master Ji’s stomach churned from the jostling, but he clenched his teeth silently. Duoduo’s little hands gripped even tighter, her soft hair flying in the wind.","\"Swoosh—!\"","A bullet shattered the brick at their feet, scattering debris.","Sheng Qingyan twisted sharply, shielding his back against the flying shards.","\"Ugh...\" A sharp shard of porcelain sliced into his shoulder blade, blood instantly soaking through his shirt.","Duoduo heard his muffled groan and flinched in terror: \"Uncle Sheng...\"","\"Don’t open your eyes,\" he said, his voice still steady. \"We’re playing hide-and-seek. Count to a hundred, and we’ll be safe.\"","He looked at Old Master Ji, whose face had turned pale, and his voice carried a coaxing tenderness, as if soothing a child. \"Old Master, do you know how to use a gun?\"","Old Master Ji’s gaze was somewhat unfocused. \"I suppose... I do,\" he said.","That was over seventy years ago. There had been a pistol left behind by his father, and his mother had taught him how to use it. But there were no bullets in the house—he had never actually fired a gun in his life.","Sheng Qingyan pulled a spare gun from the small of his back and handed it over. \"In ten seconds, I’ll run to the left.\"","He pointed to the reflective metal ornament on the edge of the fountain—an excellent makeshift mirror.","Old Master Ji’s hands trembled slightly.","He struggled to speak. \"Can I... really do this?\"","Sheng Qingyan said each word slowly and firmly, \"I said you can, so you can. Listen to my command—get ready—\""]},{"number":347,"title":"Chapter 347: The Grand Finale · Part 02","paragraphs":["\"Three, two, one——!\"","Sheng Qingyan lunged forward like a bolt of lightning.","At almost the exact same moment.","\"Bang——!\"","Old Master Ji fired a blind shot using the metal's reflective surface.","The sniper lying in ambush in the distance let out a shriek of pain as his sniper rifle plummeted from the high vantage point.","\"Yingbao, you're amazing.\"","Sheng Qingyan couldn't help calling out Yingbao again, and he even unconsciously ruffled Old Master Ji's white hair. Realizing this might be too forward, he quickly withdrew his hand.","He swiftly handed over the old man and Duoduo to the arriving military personnel. After the elderly man and the child were safely bundled into the bulletproof armored vehicle, Sheng Qingyan turned around and charged back through the hail of bullets.","The military had already taken control of this area. Ji Zhiyuan's five brothers, who weren't the targets, had been safely evacuated.","As for Rong Yu, she was pinned down in a corner by the crossfire of several snipers.","Three sniper positions had her locked in a triangular formation. The only barrier in front of her was already riddled with holes.","A urgent voice crackled through the communicator: \"Captain Sheng, there's a ventilation duct on the west side that allows you to circle around. Clear the obstacles in three minutes, and we can cover Miss Rong's escape...\"","Sheng Qingyan's gaze never left Rong Yu.","His knuckles were white from clenching.","Three minutes?","Even three seconds could leave her lying in a pool of blood.","\"Concentrate all firepower on suppressing the right sniper position!\"","Before he even finished speaking, he had already shot forward like an arrow released from the bowstring.","Bullets kicked up dust at his feet. Behind him came the dense covering fire from his teammates.","The moment Rong Yu saw his figure, her pupils contracted sharply. She yelled his name hoarsely, \"Sheng Qingyan, don't come over here!\"","She could never forget it.","In her past life, on the cruise ship, the scene of him being shot and falling into the sea.","Her death had cast a shadow over Yingbao for the rest of his life.","A Zheng's sacrifice was a nightmare she could never shake off either.","But Sheng Qingyan acted as if he hadn't heard. His body moved in an erratic zigzag, dodging one deadly bullet after another.","He was too fast.","Fast as a cheetah.","Yet it still seemed too slow.","When he was only three or four meters away from her, the barrier in front of her was suddenly blasted through. The upper half of her body was exposed. On a distant high-rise building, the muzzle of a sniper rifle flashed, and a bullet tore through the air.","The world seemed to slow down.","The bullet ripped through the air, inching closer and closer to the left side of Rong Yu's chest. She slightly turned her face, her eyes, usually filled with smiles, now reflecting his sprinting figure.","This scene——","Sheng Qingyan's eyes widened.","Why did this scene feel so familiar, as if he had seen it before?","Memories shattered like fragments of glass, at this moment, surging fiercely into his mind.","The blood-red sunset on the cruise ship deck, a group of intellectuals, the escort team, the sudden attack from the Lighthouse Country's navy...","The icy seawater filling his lungs, and in his last conscious moment, her heart-wrenching scream of his name.","It was the memories from their past life!","So, in their past lives, they had been lovers all along!","Sheng Qingyan drew in a sharp breath.","The scenes of the past rose so clearly before him. So, in his past life, he had taken a bullet for her, was hit, fell into the sea, and died a martyr.","He had left her behind, pregnant with his child.","He dared not imagine how a pregnant woman could have survived in that war-torn era.","\"A-Yu! Duck!\"","The moment he roared, drawing his gun, aiming, and pulling the trigger happened in one seamless motion.","\"Clang——!\"","The two metal bullets collided mid-air. Sparks burst like shooting stars.","Rong Yu whirled around. The intercepted bullet grazed her forearm, finally embedding itself with a thud into the ground at her feet.","Her gaze cut through the smoke and met Sheng Qingyan's across the distance.","His hand holding the gun was still suspended in the air, the muzzle smoke not yet dissipated. The depths of his eyes churned with emotions as thick as the night itself——","It was like a look exchanged only after crossing the boundary between life and death.","\"A-Yu!\"","Sheng Qingyan rolled over and arrived by her side.","Rong Yu couldn't remember how the evacuation went from there. All she knew was that when she came to her senses, she was already stuffed into a bulletproof vehicle, safely withdrawn to a secure area.","The man was dressing the graze wound on her forearm.","\"A-Yu, does it still hurt?\"","His jet-black eyes mirrored her figure.","She looked at him. Her lips moved. For a long time, she finally spoke tentatively, \"A Zheng?\"","\"It's me. I am Sheng Qingyan, and I am also Ji Zheng.\" Sheng Qingyan pulled her tightly into his arms. \"A-Yu, I remember. I remember everything. I'm sorry, I'm so sorry...\"","He frantically kissed her hair.","Just a moment before this, he had been wondering who this 'A Zheng' was that A-Yu couldn't stop mumbling about in her sleep.","It was him.","Rong Yu's tears flowed like a torrent.","\"A Zheng...\"","She leaned on his shoulder, letting her tears soak his clothes.","Back then, when he died a heroic death, she hadn't cried.","When she gave birth, in so much pain, losing so much blood, walking through the gates of hell, she hadn't cried either.","In all those years, as a woman who had lost her husband, she single-handedly upheld the Ji family's honor. She had faced countless hardships, but she had never even reddened her eyes...","Even when she met her husband's reincarnation, those grievances were hard to voice, because he didn't remember.","He remembered nothing.","She had once consoled herself that not remembering those painful pasts might be a good thing.","But in truth, it was self-deception.","He had finally returned.","\"A Zheng...\"","She called his name.","\"I'm here, A-Yu. I'm here.\" Sheng Qingyan's heart ached with every throb. He kissed her tears away. \"It was my fault. I shouldn't have left you and our child. Don't cry, be good, don't cry anymore...\"","When no one comforted her, it was bearable. But the moment someone did, the tears became completely uncontrollable.","Until——","\"Mom!\"","\"Mom!\"","\"What's wrong with you, Mom?\"","Old Master Ji dashed into the car in one leap, pulling Sheng Qingyan away and sitting down beside Rong Yu.","\"Mom, where are you hurt? Don't scare me, please don't scare me!\"","Seeing Rong Yu's face streaked with tears, his own voice choked up. His eyes turned red, and tears streamed down his wrinkled cheeks.","In his memory, Mom was always composed, calm, and unflappable. No matter what happened, she never showed her emotions. But now, she was crying like this.","It must have hurt a lot. Hurt so much that even someone like Mom couldn't bear it.","Rong Yu's uncontrollable tears stopped the moment she saw her grown son.","Crying in front of her child was too embarrassing.","She coughed. \"I'm fine. I just got some sand in my eyes.\"","Old Master Ji sobbed loudly. \"What sand? You're lying, Mom. You're lying to me. Are you trying to leave me again?\"","A hand suddenly reached out and wiped away his murky tears.","\"Yingbao.\"","Sheng Qingyan stared steadily at the old man before him.","No wonder he always felt an attachment. No wonder he was always inexplicably concerned. So this was his son, the one he had never met.","Yingbao had lived his entire life without a father. His journey must have been so much harder than others.","He had failed A-Yu.","And he had also failed Yingbao.","Sheng Qingyan opened his arms. A gentle smile formed on his lips. \"Yingbao, come here. Dad wants to hold you.\"","Old Master Ji stood there dumbfounded.","He first looked at Rong Yu. Seeing her nod.","His tears gushed out again, his voice hoarse. \"Dad?\"","\"Yes. I am Ji Zheng. I am your father.\"","Sheng Qingyan reached out proactively and pulled the old man into his arms.","The body of an infant was soft and tender.","But the old man’s body carried a certain stiffness.","He touched his son’s white hair, traced his wrinkles...","He had missed the birth, missed the first steps, missed the babbling, missed childhood, adolescence, youth, middle age... Never had he imagined that his first meeting with his son would occur in the son’s twilight years.","For nearly eighty years, his Yingbao had suffered too much.","“Dad—!”","Old Master Ji let out a sob and held tightly to his father, who was in the prime of his youth.","“Yingbao, be good. Dad is back, and he will never leave again,” Sheng Qingyan said gently, patting his back. “Mom and Dad will always be with you.”","With his other arm, he embraced Rong Yu.","A family of three, who had crossed time and space and overcome every impossibility, had finally come together in an embrace.","Those missed dawns and dusks, those absent meals across the four seasons, those longings that had slowly faded through the years—all were gradually filled by the surging love within their bloodline.","Rong Yu lowered her head.","She looked at her son, whose temples were flecked with gray, and then turned her gaze to Sheng Qingyan, who smiled beside her. She suddenly understood that so-called time and space were merely a measure of longing.","Bullets could pierce flesh, and years could blur faces, but the bond of blood and bone would never be forgotten.","A belated call of “mom” and “dad,” nearly eighty years in the making, seemed to turn every regret into a footnote of completeness.","The toughest thing in the world is not steel.","It is the family bond that can transcend death and penetrate time and space.","It will take root deep in the bloodline and bloom flowers that never wither upon reunion.","— The End of the Main Story —"]},{"number":348,"title":"Chapter 348: Extra Story 01","paragraphs":["Four years later.","At the Global eSports Finals.","The score froze on the big screen, lights exploded across the venue, and golden confetti poured down like a storm.","“Let’s congratulate the China Suosuo Team on winning the world championship—give them a round of applause!”","The two commentators on stage were practically screaming with excitement, their voices cracking. On the viewing platform, five people stood in a row.","Ji Zhouye, dressed in a custom suit, sat with his legs crossed, wearing a look of calm composure, as if to say, “Just routine stuff, nothing too surprising.” But the corners of his lips, which he couldn’t quite suppress, betrayed his inner elation.","Si Lin leaped up from his chair. “We won! We actually won! Hahaha, world champions—our company’s world champions!”","Zhou Shiyu shoved Si Lin aside, holding up her selfie stick and shouting, “Family! This is the Suosuo Team our company trained! In just four years, we’ve won the world championship! Quick, send the gifts!”","Tang Mi, towering in ten-centimeter heels, clapped gracefully before whipping out her phone. “Get this on the trending topics right now. We need to make sure everyone knows the Suosuo Team has conquered the world—”","Hai Chang’an quickly steadied her, gripping her waist. “Pregnant and still wearing heels, seriously? Sit down, just sit down!”","“I’m only four months along, what’s the big deal?” Tang Mi shook him off. “Call PR right now—push all the trending topics up. This has to dominate the feeds—”","A crowd of reporters swarmed in, their microphones practically jabbing Ji Zhouye in the face. “As the founder of the Suosuo Team, what do you think was the key to victory?”","Ji Zhouye struck a pose, pausing strategically as if ready to speak.","Before he could, Si Lin snatched the microphone. “The key to victory is obviously my full oversight. These talented players were all personally recruited by me—”","Zhou Shiyu shoved him aside. “Clearly, it was my persistence—I visited them three times—”","Tang Mi refused to back down. “I handled all the logistics. Without me, the Suosuo Team wouldn’t be where it is today.”","Hai Chang’an pressed a hand to his forehead. “Alright, alright, it’s all your doing. Just stop pushing, will you? Think of the baby...”","The reporter hesitated. “Uh... And the name ‘Suosuo Team’—does it have any special meaning?”","“Everyone shut up. I’ll answer this one.” Ji Zhouye raised the microphone, his voice suddenly deepening. “Many of you here might not know this, but the saxaul tree can survive in temperatures as low as -40°C, its roots burrowing ten meters into the earth... All of us were once the most hopeless members of our families. Someone taught us to transform like the saxaul, shrinking our leaves into branches, grinding our pride into roots, and growing with all our might—only then could we be seen by the world.”","As his words faded, something seemed to strike him. He quickly glanced at his watch, exclaimed, “Sorry, the interview will have to end here. We have something urgent to deal with—let’s go!”","Tang Mi’s eyes widened. “Ugh, I knew I shouldn’t have come to the eSports finals. If I miss this big event, I’ll regret it for life!”","Hai Chang’an wrapped an arm around her. “If we fly now, we’ll make it in time. Don’t panic.”","Si Lin cleared the way ahead. “Move aside, everyone!”","Zhou Shiyu turned off her live stream. “Family, I’m about to attend a grand wedding. See you tomorrow!”","The five of them boarded a private jet. The plane sliced through the clouds and soon landed at Haicheng Airport. They rushed without pause to Lotus Manor.","Outside the manor’s vermilion gates, gilded hydrangeas gleamed under the sun. Twelve large red lanterns hung from the lintel all the way to the hallway, their tassels swaying gently in the crosswind, casting shadows on the bluestone path that blended into a dazzling sea of red. Even the potted peonies by the wall seemed to drink in the festive spirit, blooming brighter than usual.","This celebration was a spectacle unseen at Lotus Manor in a hundred years, a corner of the world where even time seemed dyed in honey, moving with unusual tenderness.","But—","The old man’s strong, spirited voice shattered the gentle mood.","“What’s going on? Why haven’t the bride and groom arrived yet?” Ji Shunying paced back and forth at the main gate like an ant on a hot pan. “Zhiyuan, check on them, will you? Make sure nothing’s happened!”","Ji Zhiyuan spoke up. “Old Master, don’t worry. Just a moment ago, when Great-Grandfather went to pick up Great-Grandmother from the research institute, there was a hiccup with the data, so they got delayed.”","Ji Shunying scolded, “The auspicious hour is almost upon us—how can I not worry? Duoduo, call and ask how far along they are.”","“Hmph!” Duoduo crossed her arms and snorted. “Great-Grandfather is too much! I’m never talking to him again!”","“You little girl, why such a temper!” Ji Shunying was both exasperated and amused. “A child who gets angry will turn ugly. No more pouting, okay!”","“Great-Grandfather stole my spot as the flower girl, and I’m going to be mad!” Duoduo puffed out her cheeks. “An old man playing flower girl—aren’t you embarrassed?!”","Ji Shunying wasn’t afraid of embarrassment at all.","A child being a flower girl for their parents—that was only right and proper. This flower girl position was his. He was determined to keep it!","He pinched the little girl’s cheek. “On the day your parents get married, you can be whatever kind of child attendant you want. Nobody will compete with you for that!”","Duoduo’s little face fell.","Her father had already proposed three times, but her mother wouldn’t agree. She spent Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays with her father, Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Saturdays with her mother, and Sundays with both parents at activities, competitions, or the amusement park.","But there was no progress between her parents at all.","Marriage seemed like a lost cause.","As the little girl stewed in her gloom,","A tiny ball of a child waddled over to her, holding out his chubby arms like lotus roots. “Sister, carry me.”","“Tuantuan!” Ji Yanting strode over and scooped his son into his arms. “You’re too heavy. Duoduo can’t lift you.”","He turned to look at the woman beside him. “Honey, could you cut out one feeding? He’s getting too chubby!”","The woman standing next to him was stunningly beautiful, her figure untouched even after childbirth. She was Chi Fangfei, a film queen who had won countless awards on the silver screen.","The two of them—one a queen of cinema, the other a king—had collaborated six times and had always been good friends.","If not for that night at the celebration banquet, when he accidentally overheard Chi Fangfei talking to her best friend on the phone, he would never have known that she had entered the entertainment industry for his sake.","She had secretly loved him.","Maybe because he now knew Chi Fangfei’s secret, he found it harder to stay at ease when they worked together afterward, unconsciously drawn to her more and more.","Some fans started stirring up trouble, claiming that the way he looked at Chi Fangfei was far from innocent.","Their fan bases clashed ferociously, sparking a storm on the internet that raged on for three full days without any resolution.","Then, on the fourth day, a piece of news left Ji Yanting dumbfounded.","To quell the rumors, Chi Fangfei had casually found someone to pose as her boyfriend and introduced him publicly at a press conference.","Later...","“When you pulled me away in front of the media that day,” Chi Fangfei said, holding Ji Yanting’s arm with a smile, “I knew there must be a place for me in your heart.”","And so, she had been brave, direct, and fearless in pursuing her first love, whom she had quietly adored for over a decade.","All he had to do was take that one step.","As for her, she would walk the remaining ninety-nine herself.","Everything unfolded with an almost unbelievable smoothness.","Their son was now nearly two years old."]},{"number":349,"title":"Chapter 349: Extra Story 02","paragraphs":["“They’re here! The bride and groom will be here any minute!” Ji Mohan shouted as he ran in. “Grandfather, don’t worry—five minutes at most!”","Beside him was a woman in her twenties. Though not particularly beautiful, her dimples were striking, and she radiated energy and vitality. She was Ye Weiwan, the screenwriter who had taken the internet by storm last year—and also Ji Mohan’s fiancée.","They had known each other for years, and three years ago, a certain opportunity had led them to confirm their relationship.","It wasn’t until a few days ago that Ji Mohan learned the truth: the person who had actually saved him when he fell into the lake all those years ago was Ye Weiwan.","So this was fate’s destined bond.","He proposed on the spot, and she said yes.","“Come on, everyone gets a party popper!” Ye Weiwan handed one to each person standing at the gate, pointing above them. “You guys aim this direction, and you guys over there—make sure you remember your spots. That way, the confetti will form a heart, perfectly framing the bride and groom. How romantic is that!”","“Why didn’t I get one?”","A clear, crisp voice cut through.","Tang Jin, heavily pregnant, walked over, supported by Ji Jingchuan.","“Little Jin, what chaos are you stirring up here?” Ji Shunying felt a jolt of panic. “You’re only days away from your due date—you could go into labor any moment. Chuan, take Little Jin inside and have her sit down until the banquet starts!”","Ji Jingchuan smiled. “I’ve got her; it’s fine.”","He took a party popper from Ye Weiwan and placed it in Tang Jin’s hands, speaking gently. “Twist it here. If you can’t manage it, just leave it to me.”","Tang Jin pressed her lips together and smiled. “Alright.”","“And here comes the couple flaunting their love again...” Ji Zhouye huffed. “A single dog angrily flipping over the food bowl!”","Sheng Ciyuan waved him over. “Come on, Aye, single dogs stand over here, so you don’t get too stuffed.”","Si Lin and Zhou Shiyu also walked over, lining up with the rest of the singles.","“They’re here! They’re finally here!”","Under everyone’s watchful eyes, the wedding car stopped at the main gate. The moment the door opened, the ceremonial firecrackers on both sides had already been waiting, bursting into a deafening roar. A cascade of multicolored confetti rained down like a colorful storm, mingling with the cheers of the gathered guests and erupting into a wave of excitement.","Sheng Qingyan was the first to step out. He was dressed in a crisp military uniform, perfectly blending a man’s fortitude with tenderness. The sunlight refracted a brilliant golden gleam off his shoulder badges, yet it couldn’t rival even a fraction of the softness in his eyes.","He turned and bent down, his palm gently shielding the car door frame.","Rong Yu’s hand joined his, and as she stepped out of the wedding car, her modified cheongsam dress, embroidered with intertwined lotus patterns, spread like a ripple of dark red along her movement. The pearl tassels on her crown brushed against her cheeks, accentuating her stunning beauty.","The crowd that had been packed tightly together immediately parted to both sides, leaving a path paved with a red carpet.","Ji Shunying grabbed a flower basket and stepped forward, scattering rose petals and gold foil confetti into the air with all his might.","In the courtyard, Old Madam Sheng, seated in the place of honor, watched the scene in speechless amazement. After a long pause, she finally spoke: “What kind of obsession does this Old Master Ji have with grabbing the flower boy role? An old man past eighty, scampering behind the bride and groom like a child, tossing petals...”","She simply couldn’t understand.","Why, when the eldest son of the Sheng family and the eldest daughter of the Rong family were getting married—one a Sheng, the other a Rong—did they have to hold the wedding at the Ji family’s estate?","She would never forget the day the date was set. Old Master Ji had thrown a tantrum, completely losing all dignity.","Her heart had softened, and she’d agreed.","Ah, well. The Ji estate would do; it was fine enough.","Hand in hand, the bride and groom walked step by step into the main hall.","“First bow to Heaven and Earth!”","The emcee’s voice rang out through the estate via the microphone.","“Second bow to the parents!”","On the high seats, only one person sat: Old Madam Sheng.","Sheng Qingyan’s parents, Sheng Dian and Xu Lu, stood behind the old lady.","As for Rong Wangtian, he didn’t dare sit at all; he remained on the very edge.","It was already beyond his expectations to be invited to his eldest daughter’s wedding; he didn’t have the audacity to put on airs as her father...","“Husband and wife bow to each other!”","No sooner had these words been spoken than Zhou Shiyu shouted, “Captain Sheng, Miss Rong, kiss! Kiss!”","The entire courtyard of guests immediately followed suit, the crescendo of shouts nearly lifting the rooftops.","When Sheng Qingyan lowered his head, Rong Yu’s phoenix crown brushed against the tip of his nose. The pearl tassels swept across his cheek, carrying the pure, cool scent of her presence.","They exchanged smiling glances and shared a gentle kiss.","Fireworks suddenly exploded in the sky above the estate, painting a cascade of colorful light that poured down, capturing their embracing silhouette against the hall’s red silk drapes.","After the nuptial ceremony, the banquet began.","High red lanterns were hung aloft, and clinking glasses filled the feast. Ji Shunying was granted an exception and allowed a few cups of wine. His cheeks flushed crimson, but he still grinned cheerfully, insisting on belting out a song.","“Today is a good day—may all wishes come true...”","Ji Shunying wailed, the tune hopelessly off-key.","Old Master Zhou looked utterly baffled. “Miss Rong and Captain Sheng are the ones getting married—what’s he doing, dancing and making a racket like that?”","Old Master Hai coughed. “You just don’t get it, don’t get it.”","Old Master Si rolled up his sleeves. “Let’s clap along to Old Ji’s beat!”","Even the normally strait-laced Tang Youyi was dragged along as the old men joined the raucous singing and dancing, making the scene wildly lively.","Rong Yu held her forehead. “These old rascals sure know how to make a buzz.”","Sheng Qingyan’s face was full of tenderness. “On such a rare good day, let them make merry—it’s fine.”","Just as Ji Shunying was hitting his stride, Zhou Shiyu and Si Lin started instigating a stir, urging everyone to crash the bridal chamber.","“Haha, time for the bridal chamber!”","“We have to give Captain Sheng a proper hard time—he keeps that cold, stern face every day!”","“I can’t even imagine how shy Miss Rong must look...”","Hearing this, Ji Shunying sobered up a good measure. He slammed the table. “Everyone, buzz off! No rowdiness!”","He shooed the guests away, his intoxicated eyes growing deeply earnest. “Mom, Dad, I wish you a joyful marriage.”","He paused, then continued. “I am eighty-three years old now. I’m getting older by the day—I don’t know how much longer I have left. I know you’re both very busy, but... I still hope you can have a child. No, two children—one younger brother and one younger sister. The brother will be like Dad, the sister like Mom. Holding hands, they’ll call me ‘Old Brother’...","After I’m gone, there needs to be someone to support you in your old age and see to your final rites...","Let them—let them continue loving you in my place...”","Rong Yu’s tears streamed down without restraint.","She pulled her Old Son tightly into her embrace. “Yingbao, don’t ever say things like that.”","Sheng Qingyan spread his broad arms, wrapping the two of them together. “Yingbao, no matter what, you will always be our most beloved treasure, Mom and Dad’s dearest. Our only wish is for you to live healthy and happy.”","In that instant, over seventy years seemed to flash by in the blink of an eye. Drifting through the night air came the lullaby he had loved most as a child:","Moonlight bright, shines on the hall,","Father’s steps sound, heading home from the wall.","Boots dusted with snow from the border roads,","From his pocket, warm sesame candy he bestows.","...","Moonlight bright, climbs to the bed,","Mother hums songs as the gauze curtains spread.","Her fingers comb through my hair so fine,","Sleep deep falls as dreams intertwine.","...","—The End—"]}]);
